*Any guy would be over the moon to have a girlfriend like this; especially if said girlfriend wanted to stay the night at his place...*

1325
01:52:24,000 --> 01:52:27,000
*Not that Ena is my girlfriend, of course.*

1326
01:52:27,000 --> 01:52:34,000
*She might be determinedly addressing me as "darling", but I don't return her feelings, whatever they are.*

1327
01:52:34,000 --> 01:52:40,000
*I've grown fond of her, I suppose, but that's not the same as love. Neither is lust.*

1328
01:52:40,000 --> 01:52:42,000
*She's attractive, but...*

1329
01:52:42,000 --> 01:52:43,000
Ena: "Haru...?"

1330
01:52:43,000 --> 01:52:49,000
*Ena peers at me, with the same curiosity she directed an hour earlier to my electrical outlets.*

1331
01:52:49,000 --> 01:52:54,000
Ena: "Is something the matter? You have been staring at me rather intensely."

1332
01:52:54,000 --> 01:52:58,000
Ena: "I hope I have not done anything to displease you?"

1333
01:52:58,000 --> 01:53:00,000
Haru: "What? Oh, no..."

1334
01:53:00,000 --> 01:53:04,000
*I push aside Ena's concerns with a wave of my right hand.*

1335
01:53:04,000 --> 01:53:11,000
*I need to make an effort to look unmoved by all this, even if my face is feeling suspiciously hot.*

1336
01:53:11,000 --> 01:53:13,000
Haru: "It's fine. You're fine."

1337
01:53:13,000 --> 01:53:15,000
*She's better than fine, in fact.*

1338
01:53:15,000 --> 01:53:19,000
Haru: "I'm just tired, that's all. I'm starting to space out."

1339
01:53:19,000 --> 01:53:21,000
Haru: "I think I need my rest."

1340
01:53:21,000 --> 01:53:30,000
Ena: "As do I! I have been awfully busy as of late. It is not often that I escape from the palace, then flee to another planet."

1341
01:53:30,000 --> 01:53:35,000
Haru: "I can't imagine it would be, yeah. It sounds pretty stressful."

1342
01:53:35,000 --> 01:53:41,000
Ena: "It was, at the time, but I am glad I was able to endure. Revi helped me a good deal."

1343
01:53:41,000 --> 01:53:46,000
Ena: "If I had not persevered, I never would have met you, after all."

1344
01:53:46,000 --> 01:53:51,000
Ena: "I really am fortunate, sitting here in you apartment, speaking to you."

1345
01:53:51,000 --> 01:54:01,000
Ena: "You let me bathe my weary body, and now I am even wearing your clothes! I am surrounded by your scent. It feels like you are embracing me, ehehe..."

1346
01:54:01,000 --> 01:54:05,000
*Giggling girlishly, Ena winds her arms about her waist.*

1347
01:54:05,000 --> 01:54:07,000
Ena: "I have never been happier."

1348
01:54:07,000 --> 01:54:16,000
Haru: "I'm glad to hear it. It'd be awful if you hated it here, after coming all this way. I bet it'd feel like a massive waste of a trip."

1349
01:54:16,000 --> 01:54:19,000
Ena: "That is one way of looking at it, I suppose!"

1350
01:54:19,000 --> 01:54:27,000
Ena: "In truth, I could not return to Corval even if I wished - not right now, at least. I no longer have my ship."

1351
01:54:27,000 --> 01:54:30,000
Haru: "I remember you said it broke apart?"

1352
01:54:30,000 --> 01:54:35,000
Ena: "Indeed. The pieces burned up when I entered the planet's atmosphere."

1353
01:54:35,000 --> 01:54:38,000
Haru: "Does that mean you're trapped here, then?"

1354
01:54:38,000 --> 01:54:47,000
Ena: "Not necessarily. I can communicate with my home planet using the technology installed in my power suit. It is very durable."

1355
01:54:47,000 --> 01:54:55,000
Ena: "If I wanted, I could contact Revi, and she could come and retrieve me in her ship. Revi is a very talented pilot!"

1356
01:54:55,000 --> 01:55:02,000
Ena: "I do not wish for that, though. There is much I still wish to experience upon your planet, and..."

1357
01:55:02,000 --> 01:55:07,000
*Ena looks at me from beneath her eyelashes, her lips curled into a smile.*

1358
01:55:07,000 --> 01:55:10,000
Ena: "There is much I wish to do with you, too."

1359
01:55:10,000 --> 01:55:12,000
Haru: "I'm flattered. Uh..."

1360
01:55:12,000 --> 01:55:15,000
*I glance away, one hand buried in my hair.*

1361
01:55:15,000 --> 01:55:18,000
Haru: "I guess it's hard being a princess, huh?"

1362
01:55:18,000 --> 01:55:28,000
Ena: "Indeed, it is. It is awfully stuffy. I was not able to do anything I wanted. Eyes were on me at all times, and there were so many rules."

1363
01:55:28,000 --> 01:55:30,000
Ena: "This is much more enjoyable."

1364
01:55:30,000 --> 01:55:39,000
Ena: "There are rules on Earth, too - strange ones, about how many clothes one should wear, and what kinds! - but I do not mind them."

1365
01:55:39,000 --> 01:55:43,000
Ena: "I can bear with it, if you promise you will stay with me."

1366
01:55:43,000 --> 01:55:54,000
Haru: "Of course. You've got nobody else on this planet, other than Hiyori and I, so I'll stay with you. I can even show you around, if you want. I don't mind."

1367
01:55:54,000 --> 01:55:57,000
Ena: "Thank you. I am looking forward to it."

1368
01:55:57,000 --> 01:55:58,000
Ena: "Aaaah..."

1369
01:55:58,000 --> 01:56:07,000
*Ena exhales, then lies back in her futon. She curls up on her side, her mint green hair strewn across the covers, and smiles at me sleepily.*

1370
01:56:07,000 --> 01:56:12,000
Ena: "I cannot wait for tomorrow. The sun cannot rise quickly enough."

1371
01:56:12,000 --> 01:56:15,000
Ena: "I am sure we will have a good time together."

1372
01:56:15,000 --> 01:56:16,000
Haru: "Oh yeah?"

1373
01:56:16,000 --> 01:56:21,000
*I lie back in my own futon, pulling the covers over me, and look at Ena askance.*

1374
01:56:21,000 --> 01:56:24,000
Haru: "How can you be so sure about that?"

1375
01:56:24,000 --> 01:56:30,000
Ena: "It is a foregone conclusion, darling. How could I not have a good time while with you?"

1376
01:56:30,000 --> 01:56:33,000
Ena: "I really do love you, you know? Ehehe..."

1377
01:56:33,000 --> 01:56:43,000
*Ena's gentle laughter soon transmutes into the soft, regular sounds of breathing. Her eyelashes fall shut, casting shadows against her smooth cheeks.*

1378
01:56:43,000 --> 01:56:46,000
*It looks like she's already fallen asleep.*

1379
01:56:46,000 --> 01:56:51,000
*That was pretty fast, not that I came blame her. She's been through a lot.*

1380
01:56:51,000 --> 01:56:54,000
*Her fortitude is impressive, really.*

1381
01:56:54,000 --> 01:56:58,000
*I observe her, and as I do so, I find I can't help but smile.*

1382
01:56:58,000 --> 01:57:00,000
*So, she loves me, huh?*

1383
01:57:00,000 --> 01:57:07,000
*It's a fast development - almost unnaturally so - but her confession stirs something with me regardless.*

1384
01:57:07,000 --> 01:57:11,000
*Is there any chance that I might, some day, return her feelings?*

1385
01:57:11,000 --> 01:57:14,000
*It's not beyond the realms of possibility.*

1386
01:57:14,000 --> 01:57:17,000
*I'll just have to see what tomorrow holds.*

1387
01:57:17,000 --> 01:57:18,000
Haru: "Aaah..."

1388
01:57:18,000 --> 01:57:21,000
*A yawn wrenches its way from my own throat.*

1389
01:57:21,000 --> 01:57:24,000
*I close my eyes, my lashes matting together...*

1390
01:57:24,000 --> 01:57:27,000
*And soon I, too, succumb to my own sleepiness.*

1391
01:57:27,000 --> 01:57:28,000
*The next day...*

1392
01:57:28,000 --> 01:57:36,000
Ena: "Aaah. That was one of the best sleep cycles I have experienced in a good, long while. I feel very well-rested now."

1393
01:57:36,000 --> 01:57:42,000
Ena: "What of you, Haru? Are you ready for another day upon your wonderful planet?"

1394
01:57:42,000 --> 01:57:44,000
Haru: "Mm, nn... Zzzz..."

1395
01:57:44,000 --> 01:57:47,000
Ena: "Hm? Haru? What did you just say?"

1396
01:57:47,000 --> 01:57:49,000
Haru: "Nn, mm... Zzzzz..."

1397
01:57:49,000 --> 01:58:01,000
Ena: ""Zzz" I wonder what that could mean. Is it some manner of code? Are you attempting to communicate sensitive data to me in an encrypted fashion, so it will not be compromised?"

1398
01:58:01,000 --> 01:58:03,000
Haru: "Mmm... Zzzzz..."

1399
01:58:03,000 --> 01:58:06,000
Ena: ""Zzzz" again. I wonder what it could mean."

1400
01:58:06,000 --> 01:58:12,000
Ena: "It is quite peculiar that you are making such noises with your eyes closed. I wonder..."

1401
01:58:12,000 --> 01:58:14,000
Ena: "Are you responsive, Haru?"

1402
01:58:14,000 --> 01:58:15,000
Haru: "Zzzz..."

1403
01:58:15,000 --> 01:58:21,000
Ena: ""Zzzz" again. Is that a genuine response, or is Haru making these noises inadvertently?"

1404
01:58:21,000 --> 01:58:28,000
Ena: "Perhaps I should take it as a natural function of an earthling's body, much like breathing."

1405
01:58:28,000 --> 01:58:36,000
Ena: "I am beginning to wonder whether he means to speak to me at all. Why, he looks as though he is still asleep!"

1406
01:58:36,000 --> 01:58:37,000
Haru: "Zzzz..."

1407
01:58:37,000 --> 01:58:44,000
Ena: "Will you not wake up, darling? The ball of gas in the sky which you humans call the "sun" has risen."

1408
01:58:44,000 --> 01:58:52,000
Ena: "Your room is full of light, and outside I can hear the twittering of the warm-blooded, avian lifeforms you call "birds"."

1409
01:58:52,000 --> 01:58:59,000
Ena: "I believe they are telling you to arise, as am I. I wish to go outside and explore more of your planet."

1410
01:58:59,000 --> 01:59:01,000
Ena: "Will you not wake up, darling?"

1411
01:59:01,000 --> 01:59:02,000
Haru: "Zzzz..."

1412
01:59:02,000 --> 01:59:03,000
Ena: "Darling?"

1413
01:59:03,000 --> 01:59:04,000
Haru: "Zzz..."

1414
01:59:04,000 --> 01:59:10,000
Ena: "Oh my. I suppose it is no good. He is impervious both to my voice and my touch."

1415
01:59:10,000 --> 01:59:16,000
Ena: "He must have been even more exhausted than I, to sleep for such a great length of time."

1416
01:59:16,000 --> 01:59:20,000
Ena: "That, or humans are more delicate than I thought."

1417
01:59:20,000 --> 01:59:27,000
Ena: "I not want to be late to meet Hiyori, but... Hmm. My darling does look very cute when he slumbers so."

1418
01:59:27,000 --> 01:59:35,000
Ena: "I feel very blessed to have witnessed such a sight. He is so vulnerable in this state, and so very delicate."

1419
01:59:35,000 --> 01:59:40,000
Ena: "His eyelashes are so long, and his lips... they look very kissable, ehehe."

1420
01:59:40,000 --> 01:59:43,000
Ena: "I would like to help myself, but..."

1421
01:59:43,000 --> 01:59:44,000
Haru: "Zzzz..."

1422
01:59:44,000 --> 01:59:52,000
Ena: "Perhaps that is a breech of human etiquette? I cannot say for certain. There is still much I need to study."

1423
01:59:52,000 --> 01:59:53,000
Ena: "Oh! I know."

1424
01:59:53,000 --> 02:00:04,000
Ena: "While my darling sleeps, I should use this as an opportunity to familiarize myself with Earth, and with the interests of its inhabitants. That will help me blend in."

1425
02:00:04,000 --> 02:00:11,000
Ena: "My darling must be a wise man, for his shelves are full of books. I shall help myself, hehe."

1426
02:00:11,000 --> 02:00:12,000
Haru: "Zzzz..."

1427
02:00:12,000 --> 02:00:20,000
Ena: "Now, let me see. What is this? All these books appear to be about the stars - and the ones on these shelves, too."

1428
02:00:20,000 --> 02:00:27,000
Ena: "I know much about the stars already, having come from space. These books will not help at all."

1429
02:00:27,000 --> 02:00:31,000
Ena: "I need to find material more pertinent to earthly concerns."

1430
02:00:31,000 --> 02:00:35,000
Ena: "Perhaps my darling has more books in his closet?"

1431
02:00:35,000 --> 02:00:36,000
Haru: "Zzzz..."

1432
02:00:36,000 --> 02:00:43,000
Ena: "Hmm... There are fewer books in here than there were on the shelves, but... Oh, my! My, my, my!"

1433
02:00:43,000 --> 02:00:50,000
Ena: "These appear to be books, though they are of a different kind to the others I have seen thus far."

1434
02:00:50,000 --> 02:01:01,000
Ena: "There are strange women on the covers, wearing very little. I thought my darling said, last night, that going unclothed was considered improper among his people?"

1435
02:01:01,000 --> 02:01:11,000
Ena: "I wonder why these women are allowed to pose so. Is it more acceptable to depict nakedness in books than it is to go naked in real life?"

1436
02:01:11,000 --> 02:01:14,000
Ena: "Let me see what else this book contains..."

1437
02:01:14,000 --> 02:01:15,000
Haru: "Zzzz..."

1438
02:01:15,000 --> 02:01:17,000
Ena: "Oh, my. My, my, my!"

1439
02:01:17,000 --> 02:01:23,000
Ena: "This is not a book with words. It is full, instead, of photos - all of women!"

1440
02:01:23,000 --> 02:01:28,000
Ena: "They are posed in such intriguing manners! I can see so much skin!"

1441
02:01:28,000 --> 02:01:29,000
Haru: "Zzzz..."

1442
02:01:29,000 --> 02:01:30,000
Ena: "I wonder..."

1443
02:01:30,000 --> 02:01:34,000
Ena: "Could my darling be interested in such affairs?"

1444
02:01:34,000 --> 02:01:40,000
Ena: "Would he like it if I enacted some of the scenes I can see in this book upon him?"

1445
02:01:40,000 --> 02:01:44,000
Ena: "Certainly, that should rouse him from his slumber!"

1446
02:01:44,000 --> 02:01:45,000
Haru: "Zzzz..."

1447
02:01:45,000 --> 02:01:51,000
Ena: "Perhaps I will try it. If nothing else, it will serve to strengthen our bonds."

1448
02:01:51,000 --> 02:01:59,000
Ena: "I want to show my darling how much I care for him. What better way to do that than to cater to his desires?"

1449
02:01:59,000 --> 02:02:02,000
Ena: "I hope you are prepared, darling."

1450
02:02:02,000 --> 02:02:06,000
Ena: "I am going to make all your dreams come true..."

1451
02:02:06,000 --> 02:02:07,000
Ena: "Ehehe~"

1452
02:02:07,000 --> 02:02:12,000
*I mutter darkly to myself, as I walk down the street alongside Ena.*

1453
02:02:12,000 --> 02:02:19,000
*It's been about half an hour since Ena's rather unconventional wake-up call, and I'm still reeling from it.*

1454
02:02:19,000 --> 02:02:29,000
*As if Ena's "good morning kiss", shall we say, wasn't bad enough, I also had the pleasure of being raked over the coals by my jealous housemate.*

1455
02:02:29,000 --> 02:02:38,000
*Koichi didn't catch the pair of us in the act, thank goodness, but he did overhear the suspect noises that emitted from my room.*

1456
02:02:38,000 --> 02:02:47,000
*He had the decency not to barge in as I was cleaning up, but once I dressed and left the room, Ena in tow, he descended upon me.*

1457
02:02:47,000 --> 02:02:55,000
Koichi: "What the hell was going on in there, man? What were you doing so early in the morning, on a weekend, and-"

1458
02:02:55,000 --> 02:03:00,000
Koichi: "Hey, what the hell? Who's this chick - and what's with her get-up?"

1459
02:03:00,000 --> 02:03:06,000
Koichi: "You weren't making her dress up in weird outfits to satiate your fetishes, are you?"

1460
02:03:06,000 --> 02:03:14,000
Koichi: "Isn't Hiyori enough for you? Are you trying to screw every single girl you meet? Real life isn't a visual novel!"

1461
02:03:14,000 --> 02:03:19,000
*...That's how my very one-sided talk with Koichi went, more or less.*

1462
02:03:19,000 --> 02:03:25,000
*He did not seem very happy; both by being waken so early, and my luck with the ladies.*

1463
02:03:25,000 --> 02:03:26,000
*Sigh.*

1464
02:03:26,000 --> 02:03:37,000
*I'm lucky, I guess, Koichi was the only one who heard us. I think Daigo and Kosuke must've slept through that confrontation - though how they managed that, I don't know.*

1465
02:03:37,000 --> 02:03:43,000
*I wasn't exactly being quiet, and neither was Kosuke when he clapped eyes on Ena.*

1466
02:03:43,000 --> 02:03:48,000
*Then again, Daigo did once sleep through a magnitude 5 earthquake.*

1467
02:03:48,000 --> 02:03:58,000
*If Ena insists on remaining at my place, I guess I'll have to introduce her formally to the other guys at some point, but that can wait for later.*

1468
02:03:58,000 --> 02:04:03,000
*For now, Ena is in dire need of some clothes that aren't moulded to her body.*

1469
02:04:03,000 --> 02:04:12,000
*She's attracting quite a few funny looks as she walks down the street, barefoot, her green hair swishing around her shoulders.*

1470
02:04:12,000 --> 02:04:14,000
*What a pain this all is.*

1471
02:04:14,000 --> 02:04:15,000
Ena: "Hmm, hmm, hmm~"

1472
02:04:15,000 --> 02:04:22,000
*The instigator of my current problems, alas, seems blissfully unaware of the chaos she's causing.*

1473
02:04:22,000 --> 02:04:26,000
*Ena is busy humming cheerfully, her eyes bright like gems.*

1474
02:04:26,000 --> 02:04:36,000
*She drinks in the sights like a tourist, turning her head this way and that to take in all the apartments and the street lamps and the utility poles.*

1475
02:04:36,000 --> 02:04:46,000
*I don't live in a particularly nice area of Tokyo. It's all quite rundown, really. A rough neighborhood like this was the only one I could afford.*

1476
02:04:46,000 --> 02:04:52,000
*There's nothing all that attractive about our immediate surroundings, but Ena seems enchanted.*

1477
02:04:52,000 --> 02:04:53,000
Haru: "Hey."

1478
02:04:53,000 --> 02:04:58,000
*I call to Ena from a few paces behind, hands jammed deep in my pockets.*

1479
02:04:58,000 --> 02:05:00,000
Haru: "Are you enjoying the sights?"

1480
02:05:00,000 --> 02:05:05,000
Ena: "Oh, yes, very much so! This place is nothing at all like Corval!"

1481
02:05:05,000 --> 02:05:06,000
Haru: "In what way?"

1482
02:05:06,000 --> 02:05:15,000
Ena: "In every conceivable way! The architecture is completely different, and we do not have all these funny poles growing out the ground!"

1483
02:05:15,000 --> 02:05:22,000
Ena: "The sky in Corval is red, not blue, and we have two suns, and it is far, far hotter! Drier, too!"

1484
02:05:22,000 --> 02:05:29,000
Ena: "Our grounds are not hard like this, beneath the feet. Most of Corval's surface is covered in sand!"

1485
02:05:29,000 --> 02:05:36,000
Ena: "It is colder here, too, and the people wear strange clothes. They are covered almost from tip to toe!"

1486
02:05:36,000 --> 02:05:38,000
Ena: "It is all very strange to me!"

1487
02:05:38,000 --> 02:05:43,000
Haru: "I guess it would be, if you're used a hot climate like that..."

1488
02:05:43,000 --> 02:05:45,000
*I frown thoughtfully.*

1489
02:05:45,000 --> 02:05:52,000
*Part of me wishes Ena wouldn't stare at everything - and, more importantly, everyone - we pass so unabashedly.*

1490
02:05:52,000 --> 02:05:58,000
*It's a bit embarrassing, being saddled with a girl who's making her "other"ness so apparent.*

1491
02:05:58,000 --> 02:06:06,000
*I can't fault her for her enthusiasm, though. This is the first time Ena's had a proper look at Tokyo's streets.*

1492
02:06:06,000 --> 02:06:17,000
*She walked back home with me last night, sure, but it was dark then, and she was tired. She didn't get a good look at the buildings, or the stores, or the cars.*

1493
02:06:17,000 --> 02:06:20,000
*There weren't many people outside then, either.*

1494
02:06:20,000 --> 02:06:27,000
*This must be a huge culture shock to Ena, but she doesn't seem at all overwhelmed. She looks excited instead.*

1495
02:06:27,000 --> 02:06:31,000
*Every little thing prompts from her a squeal of delight.*

1496
02:06:31,000 --> 02:06:36,000
*I've never thought this part of Tokyo is all that much to look at myself, but...*

1497
02:06:36,000 --> 02:06:45,000
Ena: "Oh, goodness me! Look at this small, cute animal! We do not have these on Corval, though I am familiar with them in theory!"

1498
02:06:45,000 --> 02:06:49,000
Ena: "This is what you humans call a "cat", is it not?"

1499
02:06:49,000 --> 02:06:52,000
Ena: "It is so cute! Do you think I can pet it?"

1500
02:06:52,000 --> 02:06:56,000
Ena: "I would very much like to become his friend, ehehe~"

1501
02:06:56,000 --> 02:07:00,000
*As I watch Ena, I feel my grumpiness beginning to fade.*

1502
02:07:00,000 --> 02:07:11,000
*She might've gotten me into an awkward situation this morning, sure, but I don't think she intended that. I don't think Ena has a wicked bone in her body...*

1503
02:07:11,000 --> 02:07:20,000
*If, indeed, she has bones. I'm not sure about the inner workings of beings from Corval, but I don't want to find out in a hurry.*

1504
02:07:20,000 --> 02:07:28,000
*I find space interesting, but I have no desire to dissect its inhabitants to further my understanding of its vastness.*

1505
02:07:28,000 --> 02:07:37,000
Ena: "Here, kitty, kitty. Come here. I promise I will not hurt you! I wish only to see how your fur feels. I am sure it must be very soft!"

1506
02:07:37,000 --> 02:07:39,000
Ena: "You really are lovely!"

1507
02:07:39,000 --> 02:07:42,000
*Ena's smile is so warm, it thaws out my heart.*

1508
02:07:42,000 --> 02:07:50,000
*It can't thaw out my fingers, alas, which are freezing, or the tip of my nose, but I feel... contented, I guess.*

1509
02:07:50,000 --> 02:07:57,000
*She's caused me a bunch of problems, and I'm sure she'll cause a bunch more problems in the future, but...*

1510
02:07:57,000 --> 02:08:03,000
Ena: "Look, darling! The cat is letting me stroke him! He's really letting me stroke him!"

1511
02:08:03,000 --> 02:08:09,000
Ena: "He really is soft, just as I suspected! His green eyes are so cute, and his little ears..."

1512
02:08:09,000 --> 02:08:12,000
Ena: "Oh, and his tail! Look how it twitches!"

1513
02:08:12,000 --> 02:08:14,000
Ena: "What a curious creature!"

1514
02:08:14,000 --> 02:08:18,000
Ena: "Can we keep him, darling? Please, please, please?!"

1515
02:08:18,000 --> 02:08:25,000
*I think I'm glad I met Ena. She's such a sweetheart, it's hard not to feel happy in her presence.*

1516
02:08:25,000 --> 02:08:31,000
*I can't help but smile, despite my residual fatigue and the chill wind that buffets me...*

1517
02:08:31,000 --> 02:08:37,000
*Though, there is something I feel I must mention, before Ena gets her hopes up too high.*

1518
02:08:37,000 --> 02:08:43,000
Haru: "You can pet that cat as much as you want, but we can't take it back with us."

1519
02:08:43,000 --> 02:08:44,000
Ena: "Huh?!"

1520
02:08:44,000 --> 02:08:45,000
*Ena pouts.*

1521
02:08:45,000 --> 02:08:46,000
Ena: "Why not?!"

1522
02:08:46,000 --> 02:08:55,000
Haru: "For one, our apartment doesn't allow pets, and for another, Koichi is allergic. I wouldn't want to risk killing my housemate."

1523
02:08:55,000 --> 02:08:56,000
Ena: "Hm?"

1524
02:08:56,000 --> 02:09:02,000
*Ena looks back to the black cat which she's been petting, her head tilted askance.*

1525
02:09:02,000 --> 02:09:04,000
Ena: "Are cats dangerous?"

1526
02:09:04,000 --> 02:09:13,000
Haru: "They can be, if you're allergic to them. They don't mean to be dangerous, of course; it's just an unfortunate thing that can happen."

1527
02:09:13,000 --> 02:09:19,000
Ena: "Oh, I see. That sounds awfully sad. I would hate to make people ill simply by existing..."

1528
02:09:19,000 --> 02:09:21,000
Ena: "But do not worry, Mr. Kitty."

1529
02:09:21,000 --> 02:09:26,000
*Ena rubs the cat behind the ears, which prompts it to meow contentedly.*

1530
02:09:26,000 --> 02:09:33,000
Ena: "I promise I shall pause to pet you whenever our paths cross. You have not seen the last of me."

1531
02:09:33,000 --> 02:09:37,000
Ena: "You are so very lovely, I cannot keep away from you."

1532
02:09:37,000 --> 02:09:38,000
Ena: "I love you..."

1533
02:09:38,000 --> 02:09:43,000
Ena: "And I love this planet, and I love its people, and I love you too, darling!"

1534
02:09:43,000 --> 02:09:47,000
*Ena looks back at me, flashing a mouthful of white, pearly teeth.*

1535
02:09:47,000 --> 02:09:50,000
Ena: "I want to stay here forever and ever!"

1536
02:09:50,000 --> 02:09:51,000
Haru: "...!"

1537
02:09:51,000 --> 02:10:01,000
*Ena's innocent declaration pierces my heart. I feel my cheeks beginning to turn pink, despite the chill weather, and I have to drop my gaze to my feet.*

1538
02:10:01,000 --> 02:10:03,000
*I can't meet Ena's eye.*

1539
02:10:03,000 --> 02:10:05,000
*She really is adorable.*

1540
02:10:05,000 --> 02:10:08,000
Hiyori: "Hi, you two! Long time no see!"

1541
02:10:08,000 --> 02:10:13,000
*Hiyori greets Ena and I enthusiastically once we enter her line of sight.*

1542
02:10:13,000 --> 02:10:23,000
*Hiyori's short, choppy hair is braided at the sides, as per usual, and she's wearing a gray coat layered over her pastel pink sweater and navy skirt.*

1543
02:10:23,000 --> 02:10:27,000
*She looks rather snug in that coat, given its fluffy collar.*

1544
02:10:27,000 --> 02:10:33,000
*Certainly, she looks snugger than Ena, who's still wearing her skintight bodysuit.*

1545
02:10:33,000 --> 02:10:40,000
*Hiyori gives Ena a once over, her arms linked behind her back, and blinking curiously, she says...*

1546
02:10:40,000 --> 02:10:45,000
Hiyori: "Goodness, that attire isn't very practical! Aren't you cold, Ena?"

1547
02:10:45,000 --> 02:10:51,000
Ena: "It's alright. This suit of mine is made with cutting edge Corvan technology."

1548
02:10:51,000 --> 02:10:59,000
Ena: "It has sensors built to read my body temperature, which in turn adjusts the levels of heat outputted by the suit."

1549
02:10:59,000 --> 02:11:01,000
Ena: "It's actually rather warm!"

1550
02:11:01,000 --> 02:11:05,000
Hiyori: "Really? That's so interesting! Can I feel it?"

1551
02:11:05,000 --> 02:11:06,000
Ena: "Go right ahead!"

1552
02:11:06,000 --> 02:11:10,000
*Smiling, Ena holds out an arm for Hiyori's inspection.*

1553
02:11:10,000 --> 02:11:17,000
*Hiyori's slender fingers wind about Ena's wrist. She squeezes it, as though searching for a pulse, then gasps.*

1554
02:11:17,000 --> 02:11:24,000
Hiyori: "You're right! This suit does feel very warm! I think it might be even cozier than my coat!"

1555
02:11:24,000 --> 02:11:25,000
Ena: "I told you so."

1556
02:11:25,000 --> 02:11:31,000
*Smiling, Ena extricates her arm free from Hiyori's grip, then takes a neat step backwards.*

1557
02:11:31,000 --> 02:11:33,000
Ena: "I feel just fine!"

1558
02:11:33,000 --> 02:11:40,000
Ena: "The climate upon this planet may be dissimilar to what I am accustomed to, but my suit can adjust to it."

1559
02:11:40,000 --> 02:11:45,000
Ena: "Corvan technology is made to last, and it's awfully adaptive!"

1560
02:11:45,000 --> 02:11:56,000
Ena: "This suit is constructed from polyfibers that should last for at least a century, without sustaining any major wear and tear, even if I were to use it all day!"

1561
02:11:56,000 --> 02:12:06,000
*Ena does a neat twirl on the spot like a ballerina, arms outstretched. Her long hair fans out around her, caught in the chill, wintry breeze.*

1562
02:12:06,000 --> 02:12:09,000
Ena: "I could wander the streets like this all day!"

1563
02:12:09,000 --> 02:12:11,000
Hiyori: "I'm happy to hear that!"

1564
02:12:11,000 --> 02:12:12,000
*Hiyori beams.*

1565
02:12:12,000 --> 02:12:20,000
Hiyori: "Now that I know your suit is that impressive, it makes me wonder whether we need to buy you any new clothes at all."

1566
02:12:20,000 --> 02:12:26,000
Hiyori: "I'm afraid the manufacturing processes on Earth can't compare to your technology!"

1567
02:12:26,000 --> 02:12:30,000
Hiyori: "Your suit sounds much more practical than my coat."

1568
02:12:30,000 --> 02:12:39,000
Haru: "It might be more practical, if we're talking purely about keeping warm, but it's absolutely impractical for day-to-day wear."

1569
02:12:39,000 --> 02:12:47,000
Haru: "We've been getting all kinds of funny looks since we set off this morning, and I don't want Ena standing out too much."

1570
02:12:47,000 --> 02:12:52,000
Hiyori: "That is a good point. We wouldn't want to draw suspicion towards her."

1571
02:12:52,000 --> 02:12:58,000
Hiyori: "The last thing I want is for you to be taken away to a laboratory and dissected!"

1572
02:12:58,000 --> 02:13:02,000
*Ena ceases her twirling and looks to Hiyori, her eyes wide.*

1573
02:13:02,000 --> 02:13:04,000
Ena: "Could that really happen?"

1574
02:13:04,000 --> 02:13:09,000
Hiyori: "I'm not entirely sure. It happens a lot to aliens in movies..."

1575
02:13:09,000 --> 02:13:17,000
Hiyori: "But you're not much like the aliens that get depicted in movies. You look like an ordinary girl, for the most part."

1576
02:13:17,000 --> 02:13:26,000
Hiyori: "I'd like to think our government would feel guilty about cutting you up, but... Well. Humans can be awfully xenophobic."

1577
02:13:26,000 --> 02:13:36,000
Hiyori: "If they are willing to harass those they presume to belong to their own species, I shudder to think what they might do to an extraterrestrial."

1578
02:13:36,000 --> 02:13:41,000
*Hiyori shudders, though I don't think this can be attributed to the cold.*

1579
02:13:41,000 --> 02:13:48,000
*Hiyori is such a cheery person by nature, it's strange to see her sound - and, indeed, look - so serious.*

1580
02:13:48,000 --> 02:13:51,000
*I wonder if she's speaking from past experiences.*

1581
02:13:51,000 --> 02:14:06,000
*Though I've spent several months in Hiyori's company, as a fellow member of the astronomy club, I know very little about her past. She almost never talks about it - save, I guess, for her assertions that she's from another planet.*

1582
02:14:06,000 --> 02:14:12,000
*She certainly acts like it, at times, but I've never given her claims much credence.*

1583
02:14:12,000 --> 02:14:16,000
*Did she stress this point back when she was in high school, too?*

1584
02:14:16,000 --> 02:14:19,000
*If so, I wouldn't be surprised if she got bullied.*

1585
02:14:19,000 --> 02:14:28,000
*It seems inevitable, really. Hiyori is a bit of a weirdo, but I don't think that excuses any potential harassment she might've suffered.*

1586
02:14:28,000 --> 02:14:30,000
*Teenagers really can be cruel.*

1587
02:14:30,000 --> 02:14:33,000
*I'm tempted to ask Hiyori about this, but...*

1588
02:14:33,000 --> 02:14:43,000
Hiyori: "Well, don't worry, Ena! Haru and I are with you, and we'll make sure that doesn't come to pass. I promise we'll take good care of you!"

1589
02:14:43,000 --> 02:14:48,000
Hiyori: "Nobody will take you away to any scary facility; not on my watch!"

1590
02:14:48,000 --> 02:14:52,000
Hiyori: "I'll help you blend in, or my name isn't Akasaka Hiyori!"

1591
02:14:52,000 --> 02:14:56,000
Ena: "Yay! Thank you, Hiyori! You are very kind to me."

1592
02:14:56,000 --> 02:15:03,000
Hiyori: "Of course. We are friends, after all. As fellow aliens, we have to stick together, ehehe."

1593
02:15:03,000 --> 02:15:13,000
Hiyori: "Now, why don't we start shopping? Your suit is a very impressive piece of technology, but Haru is right: you really do need some human clothes."

1594
02:15:13,000 --> 02:15:22,000
Hiyori: "It'll be no easy feat to showcase all of your charms, Ena, but don't worry; Big Sis Hiyori's got this! You can rely on me!"

1595
02:15:22,000 --> 02:15:23,000
*Later that day...*

1596
02:15:23,000 --> 02:15:26,000
Hiyori: "Alrighty! This looks good to me!"

1597
02:15:26,000 --> 02:15:27,000
Hiyori: "Hey, Haru!"

1598
02:15:27,000 --> 02:15:35,000
*Hiyori pokes her head out from behind the curtain of the fitting room, a mischievous smile playing about her lips.*

1599
02:15:35,000 --> 02:15:39,000
Hiyori: "Are you ready to see Ena in her brand new look?"

1600
02:15:39,000 --> 02:15:43,000
Hiyori: "This outfit is very adorable, if I do say so myself!"

1601
02:15:43,000 --> 02:15:45,000
Haru: "Oh, are you done?"

1602
02:15:45,000 --> 02:15:46,000
*I sigh in relief.*

1603
02:15:46,000 --> 02:15:48,000
Haru: "Thank goodness."

1604
02:15:48,000 --> 02:15:56,000
*I've been waiting outside the fitting rooms for what seems a small eternity, aimlessly scrolling through my phone.*

1605
02:15:56,000 --> 02:16:03,000
*I never knew there was so much truth to the stereotype that women can take so long for clothes shopping.*

1606
02:16:03,000 --> 02:16:12,000
*A quick glance at my phone tells me it's been two hours, give or take, since Hiyori, Ena, and I entered this department store.*

1607
02:16:12,000 --> 02:16:21,000
*Hiyori guided Ena around, pointing out various bits and pieces she thought were particularly cute, while I trailed along behind them.*

1608
02:16:21,000 --> 02:16:30,000
*Being an average guy without an eye for fashion, I was content to let Hiyori call all the shots during "Operation: Outfit Ena".*

1609
02:16:30,000 --> 02:16:34,000
*I found the whole process pretty tedious, if I'm being honest...*

1610
02:16:34,000 --> 02:16:40,000
*But I guess it was nice watching the two girls bond over flouncy skirts and button-up shirts.*

1611
02:16:40,000 --> 02:16:51,000
*Every once in a while, Hiyori turned to me to ask my opinion about a particular printed skirt, or the neckline of a shirt, but I doubt my replies were all that helpful.*

1612
02:16:51,000 --> 02:16:56,000
*I'm of the opinion that Ena's cute enough to make any outfit work.*

1613
02:16:56,000 --> 02:17:02,000
*I just want to see her dressed in something a less ostentatious than her sci-fi suit.*

1614
02:17:02,000 --> 02:17:07,000
*Now, at long last, it looks like Hiyori's finally finished styling Ena.*

1615
02:17:07,000 --> 02:17:17,000
*With a bit of luck, I'll soon be free from this department store, and the bubbly pop songs that've been playing incessantly over the speakers.*

1616
02:17:17,000 --> 02:17:23,000
*If I have to listen to one more song by Ikue Ayu, I think I'll tear my own ears off.*

1617
02:17:23,000 --> 02:17:26,000
Haru: "What does Ena look like, then? I'm curious."

1618
02:17:26,000 --> 02:17:28,000
Hiyori: "I knew you would be, ehehe."

1619
02:17:28,000 --> 02:17:34,000
Hiyori: "I'm sorry it took so long to pick something out but, well, you can't rush perfection."

1620
02:17:34,000 --> 02:17:41,000
Hiyori: "I don't mean to toot my own horn, but I think I did a wonderful job putting this ensemble together!"

1621
02:17:41,000 --> 02:17:45,000
Hiyori: "I'm sure she'll take your breath away, hohoho!"

1622
02:17:45,000 --> 02:17:50,000
Haru: "Those are some pretty confident words. Now I'm really invested."

1623
02:17:50,000 --> 02:17:54,000
Hiyori: "As you should be! Just feast your eyes on this!"

1624
02:17:54,000 --> 02:18:03,000
*Hiyori draws back the curtain that separates the fitting room cubicle from the waiting area with a dramatic flourish, to reveal...*

1625
02:18:03,000 --> 02:18:09,000
Ena: "Hello again, Haru! It feels like it has been quite some time since I last saw your face!"

1626
02:18:09,000 --> 02:18:16,000
Ena: "Why, I think it has been twenty-two of your Earthen minutes and thirteen Earthen seconds exactly, ehehe~"

1627
02:18:16,000 --> 02:18:22,000
Ena: "I hope you can forgive me. These clothes Hiyori chose for me are awfully curious."

1628
02:18:22,000 --> 02:18:29,000
Ena: "They are nothing like I have ever before witnessed, on Corval or during my brief stint upon this planet."

1629
02:18:29,000 --> 02:18:39,000
Ena: "They are much breezier than my power suit, and they do little to keep out the cold air, but Hiyori assured me they were very fashionable."

1630
02:18:39,000 --> 02:18:41,000
Ena: "What do you think?"

1631
02:18:41,000 --> 02:18:42,000
Haru: "Well, uh..."

1632
02:18:42,000 --> 02:18:44,000
*I stare at Ena, struck dumb.*

1633
02:18:44,000 --> 02:18:48,000
*She's not wearing her skintight suit any more, at least...*

1634
02:18:48,000 --> 02:18:54,000
*But I'm not entirely convinced that her current get-up is much of an improvement.*

1635
02:18:54,000 --> 02:19:03,000
*Ena's wearing a frilly white blouse with short sleeves that gapes open in the front, which is secured by two crisscrossing strips of fabric.*

1636
02:19:03,000 --> 02:19:10,000
*The shirt is cinched shut about the neck with a red ribbon, which I suppose adds a degree of cuteness to it...*

1637
02:19:10,000 --> 02:19:21,000
*But, really, that shirt is bizarre. It mightn't be too out-of-place on a runway, filled with zany high fashion pieces, but it's no way intended for daily wear.*

1638
02:19:21,000 --> 02:19:31,000
*The high-waisted skirt the shirt's been paired with is fine, I guess, but even that seems a bit too short and a bit too tight to be comfortable.*

1639
02:19:31,000 --> 02:19:34,000
*I think she looks attractive, but...*

1640
02:19:34,000 --> 02:19:38,000
Haru: "Hey, Ena... Are you, uh, alright wearing that?"

1641
02:19:38,000 --> 02:19:42,000
Ena: "I will admit, it is quite different from what I am used to-"

1642
02:19:42,000 --> 02:19:47,000
*I'll say! The gaping front of her shirt almost makes Ena's suit look tame!*

1643
02:19:47,000 --> 02:19:50,000
Ena: "-but I rather enjoy experiencing new things."

1644
02:19:50,000 --> 02:19:58,000
Ena: "I did not get much of a chance to partake in other cultures in Corval. I was not often allowed to leave the palace."

1645
02:19:58,000 --> 02:20:04,000
Ena: "I dressed as my parents' desired, and had to be on my best behavior at all times."

1646
02:20:04,000 --> 02:20:13,000
Ena: "This is very liberating! You humans have so many choices, in all facets of your life, from your itineraries to your attires!"

1647
02:20:13,000 --> 02:20:19,000
Ena: "So, what do you think, darling? Do you think these clothes will help me fit in?"

1648
02:20:19,000 --> 02:20:22,000
Haru: "I, uh, really wonder about that..."

1649
02:20:22,000 --> 02:20:26,000
*Crap. I can't stop myself from staring at Ena's chest.*

1650
02:20:26,000 --> 02:20:34,000
*I always knew she was well-endowed, but this shirt really shows off her goods. It leaves almost nothing to the imagination.*

1651
02:20:34,000 --> 02:20:38,000
*Did Hiyori pick this scanty shirt out on purpose to tease me?*

1652
02:20:38,000 --> 02:20:41,000
*Is this supposed to be some kind of joke?!*

1653
02:20:41,000 --> 02:20:45,000
Haru: "Are you serious about making Ena wear this, Hiyori?"

1654
02:20:45,000 --> 02:20:48,000
Hiyori: "Well, why not? I think she looks adorable!"

1655
02:20:48,000 --> 02:20:53,000
*Hiyori beams guilelessly, as though unaware of how provocative Ena looks.*

1656
02:20:53,000 --> 02:21:03,000
Hiyori: "I am not confident enough in my body to wear an outfit like this, personally. I'm a bit too squishy to pull it off, and not in the right places!"

1657
02:21:03,000 --> 02:21:07,000
Hiyori: "I'm also too short. My legs are all stumpy."

1658
02:21:07,000 --> 02:21:15,000
Hiyori: "Ena, meanwhile, is proportioned like a fashion model. She has such lovely long legs, and she's so slender!"

1659
02:21:15,000 --> 02:21:20,000
Hiyori: "If anybody can pull off a sophisticated, sexy look like this, she can!"

1660
02:21:20,000 --> 02:21:25,000
Hiyori: "She's so cute, it would be a crime if she didn't buy this outfit!"

1661
02:21:25,000 --> 02:21:30,000
Hiyori: "I should take a photo, so I can commemorate this moment for posterity!"

1662
02:21:30,000 --> 02:21:35,000
*Hiyori begins to snap shots of Ena on her phone, while Ena smiles bashfully.*

1663
02:21:35,000 --> 02:21:39,000
*It's nice to see these two getting on, I guess, but...*

1664
02:21:39,000 --> 02:21:46,000
Haru: "Ena might be cute, but I think it'll be more of a crime if she does go outside in that outfit."

1665
02:21:46,000 --> 02:21:55,000
Haru: "That shirt is in no way stable. She's one misstep away from a severe wardrobe malfunction, and it's not properly insulated."

1666
02:21:55,000 --> 02:22:02,000
Haru: "Corval is a desert planet, remember. She's not used to the cold. I don't want her getting sick."

1667
02:22:02,000 --> 02:22:03,000
Hiyori: "Oh, right..."

1668
02:22:03,000 --> 02:22:07,000
*Hiyori puts her phone back in her skirt pocket, then giggles.*

1669
02:22:07,000 --> 02:22:10,000
Hiyori: "I didn't think of that, ehehe."

1670
02:22:10,000 --> 02:22:16,000
Hiyori:  "I was so excited about dressing Ena up, my common sense must have fled me..."

1671
02:22:16,000 --> 02:22:17,000
Haru: "Evidently."

1672
02:22:17,000 --> 02:22:18,000
*I sigh.*

1673
02:22:18,000 --> 02:22:25,000
*Hiyori claims to have common sense, even if it is in absentia, but I often find myself wondering.*

1674
02:22:25,000 --> 02:22:26,000
*She's such a ditz.*

1675
02:22:26,000 --> 02:22:35,000
*Maybe I was wrong for entrusting Ena's new wardrobe to Hiyori. I shudder to think what future fashion disasters she might come up with.*

1676
02:22:35,000 --> 02:22:44,000
Haru: "Let's find a more sensible outfit for her. She needs some warm pieces to keep out the cold, like sweaters and pants and the like."

1677
02:22:44,000 --> 02:22:48,000
Haru: "We should probably get her a coat, too, in case it snows..."

1678
02:22:48,000 --> 02:22:49,000
Ena: ""Snows"?"

1679
02:22:49,000 --> 02:22:51,000
*Ena looks at me curiously.*

1680
02:22:51,000 --> 02:22:52,000
Ena: "What is that?"

1681
02:22:52,000 --> 02:23:01,000
Haru: "It happens when it gets really cold, and water vapor turns into ice crystals. It falls from the sky, and it turns the ground white."

1682
02:23:01,000 --> 02:23:07,000
Haru: "It's pretty, but it's not something you'd want to brave without being covered up."

1683
02:23:07,000 --> 02:23:12,000
Ena: "Ooh! That really does sound incredible! I would love to see that!"

1684
02:23:12,000 --> 02:23:17,000
Haru:  "I'd love to show it to you, too, but not while you're dressed like that."

1685
02:23:17,000 --> 02:23:19,000
Ena: "So, this outfit is no good...?"

1686
02:23:19,000 --> 02:23:21,000
Haru: "It's definitely no good."

1687
02:23:21,000 --> 02:23:22,000
*I sigh.*

1688
02:23:22,000 --> 02:23:28,000
*Being the only one in this group with anything even approaching insight is quite the burden.*

1689
02:23:28,000 --> 02:23:34,000
*I shudder to think how Ena would've ended up if Hiyori had been left to her own devices.*

1690
02:23:34,000 --> 02:23:36,000
*Now that's a scary thought.*

1691
02:23:36,000 --> 02:23:37,000
*Some time later...*

1692
02:23:37,000 --> 02:23:43,000
Ena: "Thank you for helping me choose an outfit, Hiyori! I think this looks really nice, ehehe~"

1693
02:23:43,000 --> 02:23:51,000
Hiyori: "It's no problem! It's to be expected, really, that any outfit would look good on you. Your figure's incredible!"

1694
02:23:51,000 --> 02:24:00,000
Ena: "Oh, no, you're just flattering me. I was always told to eat more back on Corval. My parents were forever saying I'm too skinny!"

1695
02:24:00,000 --> 02:24:03,000
Hiyori: "Really? I think you look perfect!"

1696
02:24:03,000 --> 02:24:08,000
Ena: "By earthling standards, maybe, but not by those of my home planet."

1697
02:24:08,000 --> 02:24:09,000
Ena: "Oh well!"

1698
02:24:09,000 --> 02:24:17,000
*Ena beams, full of the joys of spring (it being winter notwithstanding), as she does a neat 360 degree spin on the spot.*

1699
02:24:17,000 --> 02:24:24,000
*Her long, mint green hair flutters about her in the cool breeze, and her skirt shifts about her thighs.*

1700
02:24:24,000 --> 02:24:28,000
Ena: "So, what do you think, darling? Do you like it?"

1701
02:24:28,000 --> 02:24:29,000
Haru: "Hmm..."

1702
02:24:29,000 --> 02:24:32,000
*I look Ena up and down, my arms folded.*

1703
02:24:32,000 --> 02:24:44,000
*The outfit Hiyori chose for her, after much deliberation, is fairly conservative; certainly more so than the frilly nightmare she cajoled Ena into back in the fitting room.*

1704
02:24:44,000 --> 02:24:53,000
*This outfit is much more suitable for the wintry chill. It conceals a fair bit of flesh, which should keep Ena warm and toasty.*

1705
02:24:53,000 --> 02:25:01,000
*Ena's clad in a thickly-knit woolen turtleneck with striped sleeves, which Hiyori has paired with a wine red dress.*

1706
02:25:01,000 --> 02:25:08,000
*The dress itself is fairly short, but Ena's legs are clad in thick, opaque pantyhose to offset the cold.*

1707
02:25:08,000 --> 02:25:13,000
*I don't know much about women's clothes, but I think the ensemble suits Ena.*

1708
02:25:13,000 --> 02:25:18,000
*Then again, as Hiyori said, I think almost anything would suit her.*

1709
02:25:18,000 --> 02:25:27,000
*Now Ena's not wearing her strange latex spacesuit, I can take a proper look at her, without feeling the need to avert my eyes.*

1710
02:25:27,000 --> 02:25:33,000
*She looked good in the suit too, of course, but I think I prefer this more homey apparel.*

1711
02:25:33,000 --> 02:25:36,000
Haru: "I think you look great, Ena. It's very cute."

1712
02:25:36,000 --> 02:25:37,000
Ena: "Really?"

1713
02:25:37,000 --> 02:25:42,000
*Ena's smile widens, if such a thing is possible. She looks like she's glowing.*

1714
02:25:42,000 --> 02:25:51,000
Ena: "Thank you so much! That's very sweet of you to say! I do not think I have ever been happier than I am at this moment, ehehe~"

1715
02:25:51,000 --> 02:25:56,000
*Ena's enthusiasm must be contagious, because I find myself smiling, too.*

1716
02:25:56,000 --> 02:26:11,000
*I'm a bit tired after being dragged around so many shops, and I can't pretend that I enjoyed myself while waiting outside the fitting rooms for what felt like forever, but Ena's smile makes all my accumulated fatigue melt away.*

1717
02:26:11,000 --> 02:26:14,000
*It's hard to be in a bad mood when I'm with her.*

1718
02:26:14,000 --> 02:26:17,000
*She perks my spirits up within seconds.*

1719
02:26:17,000 --> 02:26:26,000
Ena: "Hey, Hiyori, Hiyori! Can we explore the city? Tokyo seems a very interesting place. It is so vast and sprawling, quite unlike Corval!"

1720
02:26:26,000 --> 02:26:31,000
Ena: "Now I am dressed for the occasion, I want to take in all the sights!"

1721
02:26:31,000 --> 02:26:35,000
Hiyori: "But of course! I was going to suggest that myself!"

1722
02:26:35,000 --> 02:26:44,000
Hiyori: "I don't think we'll be able to see all the sights - Tokyo is awfully big, after all - but we can make a decent stab at it!"

1723
02:26:44,000 --> 02:26:45,000
Ena: ""Stab"?"

1724
02:26:45,000 --> 02:26:46,000
*Ena's brow furrows.*

1725
02:26:46,000 --> 02:26:51,000
Ena: "Why would we wish to stab anything? That sounds rather violent."

1726
02:26:51,000 --> 02:27:00,000
Ena: "I do not want to get blood upon my new clothes, even if my dress is red. It might not show the stains, but it would be an awful waste!"

1727
02:27:00,000 --> 02:27:10,000
Hiyori: "Oh, no, that's not what I meant. We won't actually be stabbing anybody. That would be a sure-fire way to get on the police's bad side."

1728
02:27:10,000 --> 02:27:17,000
Hiyori: "I'd hate for you to end your first full day on this planet in a prison cell. That simply won't do!"

1729
02:27:17,000 --> 02:27:24,000
Ena: "Ah, yes, the police. We have them on Corval, too. They ensure that nobody is breaking the rules."

1730
02:27:24,000 --> 02:27:32,000
Ena: "I would not want to make an enemy of them. They carry laser guns that can atomize body parts in less than a second!"

1731
02:27:32,000 --> 02:27:38,000
*Laser guns, huh? That sounds like something ripped straight from a sci-fi novel...*

1732
02:27:38,000 --> 02:27:44,000
*Then again, I guess Ena's whole existence is rather sci-fi, her being an alien and all.*

1733
02:27:44,000 --> 02:27:55,000
Haru: "We're not going to run into the police at all, so it's a moot point, but they don't carry laser guns here. Nobody is going to atomize you, no matter what happens."

1734
02:27:55,000 --> 02:27:58,000
Ena: "Oh, thank goodness. That is a relief."

1735
02:27:58,000 --> 02:28:07,000
Ena: "As a princess, I was under certain protections. I never would have been atomized on Corval, but I am not on Corval any longer."

1736
02:28:07,000 --> 02:28:13,000
Ena: "I am no princess on this planet. I am just Ena. I have lost all my privileges..."

1737
02:28:13,000 --> 02:28:16,000
Ena: "But that means I am also far, far freer."

1738
02:28:16,000 --> 02:28:21,000
Ena: "Now, I can go where I want, and do what I want! I cannot wait!"

1739
02:28:21,000 --> 02:28:25,000
Hiyori: "Neither can I! I love showing people around, hehe~"

1740
02:28:25,000 --> 02:28:31,000
Hiyori: "Just leave the itinerary up to Big Sis Hiyori! We're going to have a blast!"

1741
02:28:31,000 --> 02:28:39,000
*Ena, Hiyori, and I meander about the city for a while, stepping into random stores and later grabbing a bite to eat.*

1742
02:28:39,000 --> 02:28:44,000
*We do this for several hours, until we wind up at a batting center.*

1743
02:28:44,000 --> 02:28:47,000
*As for how we ended up here, well...*

1744
02:28:47,000 --> 02:28:54,000
*Ena saw the batting center as we walked through the streets and, excited, asked Hiyori what it was.*

1745
02:28:54,000 --> 02:29:08,000
*Intrigued by the concept of "baseball" ("What a novel idea! I did not know hitting balls with with wooden bats as an activity worthy of such laudation!"), Ena then asked if she could try it out for herself.*

1746
02:29:08,000 --> 02:29:13,000
*Hiyori and I capitulated to her, and now we're in the batting center.*

1747
02:29:13,000 --> 02:29:26,000
*Ena, as it transpires, isn't very good at baseball. Her hand-eye coordination leaves a lot to be desired, and during her first few pitches, she was even holding the bat the wrong way around.*

1748
02:29:26,000 --> 02:29:34,000
*I'm not a sports buff myself, either. I find any physical exercise beyond my daily commute to university a pain.*

1749
02:29:34,000 --> 02:29:38,000
*I'm a physics nerd through and through, not a pro athlete.*

1750
02:29:38,000 --> 02:29:46,000
*Physical education was always my least favorite lesson back in high school. I was one of the very worst in my class.*

1751
02:29:46,000 --> 02:29:54,000
*My classmates used to rib me for that on a regular basis. They thought it was funny I was so deficient, given how tall I am.*

1752
02:29:54,000 --> 02:29:58,000
*A lot of the girls in my class ran faster than I do.*

1753
02:29:58,000 --> 02:30:01,000
*Hiyori, however, proves to be a big surprise.*

1754
02:30:01,000 --> 02:30:05,000
*She's far, far better at baseball than I ever would've imagined.*

1755
02:30:05,000 --> 02:30:15,000
*She hits every single ball that's pitched at her by the automatic machine without breaking a sweat, the expression on her face one of easy confidence.*

1756
02:30:15,000 --> 02:30:16,000
Hiyori: "Take this!"

1757
02:30:16,000 --> 02:30:26,000
*Bat in hand, Hiyori swings it at the encroaching ball. The bat hits the ball with a satisfying thud, then shoots through the sky like a projectile.*

1758
02:30:26,000 --> 02:30:32,000
*I watch its ascent, then descent, one hand held to my eyes to blot out the wintry sunshine.*

1759
02:30:32,000 --> 02:30:37,000
*The ball lands a few hundred feet away, bouncing against the turf.*

1760
02:30:37,000 --> 02:30:39,000
*I must say, I'm impressed.*

1761
02:30:39,000 --> 02:30:40,000
Ena: "Wow!"

1762
02:30:40,000 --> 02:30:51,000
*Ena, who's long since tired of trying (and failing) to hit any of her own home runs, watches this spectacle with wide eyes, her hands clenched at her front.*

1763
02:30:51,000 --> 02:30:56,000
Ena: "That was incredible, Hiyori! I had no idea you were capable of such feats!"

1764
02:30:56,000 --> 02:31:03,000
Ena: "You humans can do almost anything when you put your minds to it. Truly, you are an impressive species!"

1765
02:31:03,000 --> 02:31:06,000
Hiyori: "Oh, it's not that impressive, really."

1766
02:31:06,000 --> 02:31:13,000
Hiyori: "I've always been fond of baseball, ever since I was a little girl. I'm not all that good at sports-"

1767
02:31:13,000 --> 02:31:14,000
*Join the club.*

1768
02:31:14,000 --> 02:31:19,000
Hiyori: "-but baseball's the one exception. It's... special, I suppose."

1769
02:31:19,000 --> 02:31:20,000
Haru: "Oh yeah?"

1770
02:31:20,000 --> 02:31:23,000
*I can't help but be curious about this.*

1771
02:31:23,000 --> 02:31:28,000
*I've known Hiyori for a while, but I had no idea she was so good at baseball.*

1772
02:31:28,000 --> 02:31:34,000
*I guess there's a lot about Hiyori I don't know. I never really cared to find out.*

1773
02:31:34,000 --> 02:31:39,000
*Despite our supposed friendship, I've always tried to keep my distance.*

1774
02:31:39,000 --> 02:31:41,000
*Was that callous of me?*

1775
02:31:41,000 --> 02:31:46,000
*Oh well. There's no time like the present to learn a little more about her.*

1776
02:31:46,000 --> 02:31:50,000
Haru: "Were you part of a club back in school or anything?"

1777
02:31:50,000 --> 02:31:58,000
Hiyori: "Oh, no, it's nothing like that. I wasn't part of any club in high school, unless you count the "going home" club."

1778
02:31:58,000 --> 02:32:04,000
Hiyori: "I never really fit in with my peers. I don't think they would've wanted me around."

1779
02:32:04,000 --> 02:32:13,000
Hiyori: "My father - my Earth father, that is - likes baseball a lot, though. He used to take me to games with him, back when I was a child."

1780
02:32:13,000 --> 02:32:18,000
Hiyori: "I have a lot of fond memories of watching matches with him."

1781
02:32:18,000 --> 02:32:34,000
Hiyori: "I decided to pick up the sport myself, though I didn't have anybody to play it with. There was a batting center like this near my parents' home, only a five minute walk away, that I'd often stop by on my commute from school."

1782
02:32:34,000 --> 02:32:40,000
Hiyori: "I wasn't very good at baseball at first, but I eventually got into the swing of it."

1783
02:32:40,000 --> 02:32:46,000
Hiyori: "Hitting the ball with the bat is very satisfying. It's a good way to let off steam..."

1784
02:32:46,000 --> 02:32:51,000
*Hiyori swings the bat again as she speaks, once more hitting a perfect home run.*

1785
02:32:51,000 --> 02:32:57,000
Hiyori: "And I like watching the ball as it soars through the sky. It looks so free and untamed."

1786
02:32:57,000 --> 02:33:01,000
Hiyori: "I've often wished I could be like one of those balls."

1787
02:33:01,000 --> 02:33:08,000
*Hiyori tips her head back, her choppy brown hair shifting in the breeze, to observe the pastel sky.*

1788
02:33:08,000 --> 02:33:18,000
Hiyori: "I, too, want to soar up into the sky some day; out of the atmosphere, and the Earth's gravitational pull, up into the recesses of space."

1789
02:33:18,000 --> 02:33:24,000
Hiyori: "I've always felt, ever since I was a child, that I've never quite belonged here."

1790
02:33:24,000 --> 02:33:30,000
Hiyori: "My real home isn't on this planet. It must be somewhere else, above my head."

1791
02:33:30,000 --> 02:33:33,000
Hiyori: "I wonder where it could be..."

1792
02:33:33,000 --> 02:33:37,000
*Hiyori sets her bat down, then exits the batting cage.*

1793
02:33:37,000 --> 02:33:45,000
*I guess she must be tired of playing baseball now - not that I can blame her. She has been going at it for a while.*

1794
02:33:45,000 --> 02:33:48,000
*Hiyori stretches, then looks to Ena.*

1795
02:33:48,000 --> 02:33:56,000
Hiyori: "I've been giving it some thought, and I've been wondering whether I come from the same planet that you do, Ena."

1796
02:33:56,000 --> 02:34:01,000
*Freed from its confines, she then turns to look at Ena, smiling as she does so.*

1797
02:34:01,000 --> 02:34:05,000
Hiyori: "I've no way of confirming that, of course..."

1798
02:34:05,000 --> 02:34:09,000
Hiyori: "But I think that'd be nice, if it were the case."

1799
02:34:09,000 --> 02:34:18,000
Ena: "Oh, yes! I quite agree! If I'd had more friends on my home planet, perhaps I, too, would not have felt compelled to leave."

1800
02:34:18,000 --> 02:34:26,000
Ena: "I love Revi a lot, of course, but you can never have too many companions; particularly kind ones like you!"

1801
02:34:26,000 --> 02:34:30,000
Hiyori: "Thank you. Hearing you say that makes me very happy."

1802
02:34:30,000 --> 02:34:31,000
*Hiyori giggles.*

1803
02:34:31,000 --> 02:34:40,000
Hiyori: "I don't know if I am from Corval or not - I have no proof either way - but I am sure my real home resides somewhere out there."

1804
02:34:40,000 --> 02:34:46,000
Hiyori: "I probably have another family who loves me, who are thinking of me even now."

1805
02:34:46,000 --> 02:34:53,000
Hiyori: "They mightn't like baseball, like my father does, but I'm sure they have other interests and hobbies."

1806
02:34:53,000 --> 02:34:59,000
Hiyori: "I want to share those interests with them. I would love to know more about them."

1807
02:34:59,000 --> 02:35:06,000
Hiyori: "I am woefully ignorant of my true parentage, but I am sure they exist somewhere out there. They must."

1808
02:35:06,000 --> 02:35:07,000
Hiyori: "After all..."

1809
02:35:07,000 --> 02:35:11,000
*Hiyori looks at Ena, her hands clenched at her front.*

1810
02:35:11,000 --> 02:35:14,000
Hiyori: "You came here, Ena, from the stars."

1811
02:35:14,000 --> 02:35:19,000
Hiyori: "Your presence here is proof that aliens do exist somewhere out there."

1812
02:35:19,000 --> 02:35:25,000
Hiyori: "If you came to Earth from a different planet, the same may be true of me..."

1813
02:35:25,000 --> 02:35:26,000
Hiyori: "No."

1814
02:35:26,000 --> 02:35:28,000
*Hiyori shakes her head.*

1815
02:35:28,000 --> 02:35:32,000
Hiyori: "It must be true. I refuse to believe otherwise."

1816
02:35:32,000 --> 02:35:42,000
Ena: "If you feel that strongly about it, there must be a grain of truth to it. Nobody knows ourselves better than we do, after all, be we human or corven."

1817
02:35:42,000 --> 02:35:49,000
Ena: "Perhaps I can help you find your home planet one day, if ever I am able to repair my spaceship."

1818
02:35:49,000 --> 02:35:51,000
Ena: "That might be fun!"

1819
02:35:51,000 --> 02:35:56,000
Hiyori: "Oh, yes! I would absolutely love that! Thank you so much, Ena!"

1820
02:35:56,000 --> 02:36:02,000
Ena: "It's no problem, ehehe. You and Haru have done so much for me already, you deserve it."

1821
02:36:02,000 --> 02:36:07,000
Ena: "It is only polite, or so I have heard, to repay others for their kindness."

1822
02:36:07,000 --> 02:36:08,000
Haru: "Hmmm..."

1823
02:36:08,000 --> 02:36:10,000
*I press my lips together.*

1824
02:36:10,000 --> 02:36:17,000
*I'm glad Hiyori looks so happy, but her insistence about her "true origins" are starting to perturb me.*

1825
02:36:17,000 --> 02:36:21,000
*Why is Hiyori so insistent that she comes from another planet?*

1826
02:36:21,000 --> 02:36:25,000
*Is being a boring, ordinary earthling not good enough for her?*

1827
02:36:25,000 --> 02:36:36,000
*Maybe her high school years have something to do with this. From what little I've gleaned, she didn't have much fun - or any friends - when she was a student.*

1828
02:36:36,000 --> 02:36:40,000
*Isolation can nurture all sorts of strange beliefs in people.*

1829
02:36:40,000 --> 02:36:43,000
*This alien shtick must be a coping mechanism.*

1830
02:36:43,000 --> 02:36:49,000
*I can't take it seriously, even if Ena is, and I don't want to encourage Hiyori, either.*

1831
02:36:49,000 --> 02:36:55,000
*I just wish she would like herself for who she is, rather than who she wants to be.*

1832
02:36:55,000 --> 02:37:02,000
*I know that's easier said than done, but I don't think it should be too impossible an undertaking.*

1833
02:37:02,000 --> 02:37:07,000
*I like Hiyori just the way she is; to such an extent, in fact, I consider her...*

1834
02:37:07,000 --> 02:37:08,000
*Sigh.*

1835
02:37:08,000 --> 02:37:13,000
*Human relationships are so complex, I sometimes feel like an alien myself.*

1836
02:37:13,000 --> 02:37:17,000
*Time passes, and the day eventually comes to a close.*

1837
02:37:17,000 --> 02:37:22,000
*The pale sun sinks beneath the horizon, ushering in a dark sky full of stars.*

1838
02:37:22,000 --> 02:37:28,000
*Ena, Hiyori, and I were kept busy all day, traipsing about the city to take in the sights.*

1839
02:37:28,000 --> 02:37:39,000
*The soles of my feet hurt from all the walking I've done, and my wallet is similarly aching after spending a not-insignificant amount of money on various tourist traps.*

1840
02:37:39,000 --> 02:37:43,000
*I'm pretty tired after the day's events, but I've nothing on Ena.*

1841
02:37:43,000 --> 02:37:50,000
*She dashed about hither and thither like a kitten, and now - predictably enough - she's exhausted.*

1842
02:37:50,000 --> 02:37:51,000
Ena: "Aaah..."

1843
02:37:51,000 --> 02:37:57,000
*Ena yawns, as if to prove my unspoken point, then rests her head against my shoulder.*

1844
02:37:57,000 --> 02:38:01,000
*Sleepily, she links her arm through mine, then murmurs...*

1845
02:38:01,000 --> 02:38:08,000
Ena: "That was quite the day. I had a good deal of fun, but perhaps I exerted myself a bit too much."

1846
02:38:08,000 --> 02:38:15,000
Ena: "I must take more care to pace myself in the future, lest I fear I will wear myself out entirely."

1847
02:38:15,000 --> 02:38:21,000
Ena: "May I return to your apartment to recuperate now, darling? I could use a rest."

1848
02:38:21,000 --> 02:38:29,000
Hiyori: "You do look sleepy, certainly. Having a nap wouldn't be a bad idea, but there's one more thing I would like us to do."

1849
02:38:29,000 --> 02:38:30,000
Haru: "Oh?"

1850
02:38:30,000 --> 02:38:32,000
*I look at Hiyori askance.*

1851
02:38:32,000 --> 02:38:37,000
Haru: "Is there a particular tourist attraction you want to go to, Hiyori?"

1852
02:38:37,000 --> 02:38:46,000
Hiyori: "Not entirely, no. This is a purely selfish request, but I have been pondering it for several hours now, and I cannot remain quiet."

1853
02:38:46,000 --> 02:38:52,000
Hiyori: "I realize Ena is tired, and I realize this may be bad timing, but... Well."

1854
02:38:52,000 --> 02:38:57,000
*Hiyori inhales, taking in a crisp mouthful of wintry air, then says...*

1855
02:38:57,000 --> 02:39:08,000
Hiyori: "W-Would the pair of you mind coming back to my house? I have warm beverages I can offer you, and my living room is very cozy. I promise to make you feel at home!"

1856
02:39:08,000 --> 02:39:09,000
Haru: "Your house...?"

1857
02:39:09,000 --> 02:39:17,000
*Now, that's an interesting proposal. I've never actually been to Hiyori's place before. I don't even know what it looks like.*

1858
02:39:17,000 --> 02:39:19,000
*I must admit, I'm curious.*

1859
02:39:19,000 --> 02:39:21,000
Haru: "What prompted this?"

1860
02:39:21,000 --> 02:39:24,000
Hiyori: "Oh, um, it's nothing, really..."

1861
02:39:24,000 --> 02:39:31,000
*Hiyori demurs, red-cheeked, in the manner that clearly telegraphs she was prompted by something, really.*

1862
02:39:31,000 --> 02:39:33,000
*Hiyori isn't very good at lying.*

1863
02:39:33,000 --> 02:39:42,000
Hiyori: "I just wanted to speak to you about something, Haru. It is not a particularly important matter, but it has been weighing on my mind."

1864
02:39:42,000 --> 02:39:46,000
Hiyori: "It'd be awkward to discuss it out here, though, so..."

1865
02:39:46,000 --> 02:39:50,000
*Hiyori looks at me shyly, beneath half-lidded eyes.*

1866
02:39:50,000 --> 02:39:55,000
Hiyori: "I thought it would be best to speak alone, in my living room."

1867
02:39:55,000 --> 02:39:57,000
Hiyori: "Is that no good...?"

1868
02:39:57,000 --> 02:40:02,000
*Hiyori looks so unusually anxious, I can't help but feel compassionate.*

1869
02:40:02,000 --> 02:40:06,000
*I don't want to turn down her offer, but I do wonder...*

1870
02:40:06,000 --> 02:40:14,000
Haru: "I don't have any problems with that, but what about you, Ena? Would you mind coming with me to Hiyori's for a bit?"

1871
02:40:14,000 --> 02:40:25,000
Ena: "Oh, no. I don't mind at all. I, too, would like to see what your abode is like, Hiyori. I cannot pass up a chance to observe how you earthlings live..."

1872
02:40:25,000 --> 02:40:30,000
Ena: "And, as you were friends, I would very much like to learn more about you."

1873
02:40:30,000 --> 02:40:34,000
Ena: "I would be glad to accept your invitation, although..."

1874
02:40:34,000 --> 02:40:38,000
*Ena yawns, yet more tears beading in her amber eyes.*

1875
02:40:38,000 --> 02:40:45,000
Ena: "I fear I might fall asleep once I get there. I hope such behavior would not be too unpardonably rude?"

1876
02:40:45,000 --> 02:40:51,000
Hiyori: "Oh, no, it's quite alright. I'm the one being rude, asking you to humor me like this."

1877
02:40:51,000 --> 02:41:00,000
Hiyori: "If you need to rest, I can let you borrow one of the guest bedrooms. My home is rather large. There is no shortage of space!"

1878
02:41:00,000 --> 02:41:05,000
Ena: "Very well then. I shall look forward to it. Please, lead the way."

1879
02:41:05,000 --> 02:41:07,000
Hiyori: "Of course! Just follow me!"

1880
02:41:07,000 --> 02:41:11,000
*Hiyori turns on her heels, then sets off through the streets.*

1881
02:41:11,000 --> 02:41:21,000
*I follow after her, a half-asleep Ena clinging to me. Her cheek rests against my shoulder, and her pale green hair flutters with every step she takes.*

1882
02:41:21,000 --> 02:41:24,000
*She looks ready to pass out at any given moment.*

1883
02:41:24,000 --> 02:41:27,000
*She seriously pushed herself too hard...*

1884
02:41:27,000 --> 02:41:33,000
*But, if given a chance to redo the day, I doubt Ena would have behaved any differently.*

1885
02:41:33,000 --> 02:41:35,000
*I know she had a blast.*

1886
02:41:35,000 --> 02:41:45,000
*Watching her was enough to put a smile upon even my grumpy face, but Hiyori's desire for a discussion has put something of a damper on my good mood.*

1887
02:41:45,000 --> 02:41:48,000
*What, exactly, does she want to talk about?*

1888
02:41:48,000 --> 02:41:51,000
*I suppose I'll find out soon enough.*

1889
02:41:51,000 --> 02:41:54,000
Hiyori: "Here we are: home sweet home."

1890
02:41:54,000 --> 02:41:59,000
Hiyori: "So, what do the pair of you think? It's not too ostentatious, is it?"

1891
02:41:59,000 --> 02:42:04,000
Haru: "I don't know if that's quite the word I would use, but... Uh..."

1892
02:42:04,000 --> 02:42:08,000
*I stare about Hiyori's living room, momentarily awestruck.*

1893
02:42:08,000 --> 02:42:20,000
*Hiyori's house isn't a mansion, but it's definitely on the larger side. Her living room is sleek and fancy, with several neatly-arranged couches and a vast, flat screen TV.*

1894
02:42:20,000 --> 02:42:28,000
*It's significantly more upscale than my family's home out in the countryside, and it's significantly more modern.*

1895
02:42:28,000 --> 02:42:35,000
*This room - no, this whole house - looks like it belongs to a well-to-do upper-middle-class family.*

1896
02:42:35,000 --> 02:42:45,000
*It's in a nice location, too. It's a brisk walk away from the nearest train station, but it's situated on a quiet, residential road, without much traffic.*

1897
02:42:45,000 --> 02:42:54,000
*This area of Tokyo's far more peaceful than the area I live in, and there's way less trash strewn about outside on the sidewalk.*

1898
02:42:54,000 --> 02:42:59,000
*These living conditions couldn't be more different from the ones I'm used to.*

1899
02:42:59,000 --> 02:43:01,000
Haru: "This is, uh, kind of crazy..."

1900
02:43:01,000 --> 02:43:04,000
Haru: "Do you really live here, Hiyori?"

1901
02:43:04,000 --> 02:43:13,000
Hiyori: "Yes, really. I'd hardly wander into a stranger's house by mistake - and I wouldn't rent out a show home to trick you, either!"

1902
02:43:13,000 --> 02:43:18,000
Hiyori: "That'd be way too much effort to go through for a simple prank, ehehe."

1903
02:43:18,000 --> 02:43:20,000
Haru: "Yeah, uh, I get that..."

1904
02:43:20,000 --> 02:43:29,000
*In retrospect, that was probably a stupid question. Of course Hiyori lives here. The key wouldn't've fit in the lock otherwise.*

1905
02:43:29,000 --> 02:43:32,000
*This is still a lot to take in, though.*

1906
02:43:32,000 --> 02:43:34,000
Haru: "Do you live here on your own?"

1907
02:43:34,000 --> 02:43:35,000
*Hiyori nods.*

1908
02:43:35,000 --> 02:43:39,000
Hiyori: "My parents don't live in Tokyo. Their home is in Chiba."

1909
02:43:39,000 --> 02:43:49,000
Hiyori: "I know Chiba isn't so far away from Tokyo, but my parents though it'd be inconvenient for me, if I had to commute for an hour every single morning."

1910
02:43:49,000 --> 02:44:00,000
Hiyori: "They've always wanted to give me the best possible start in life, or so they say, so they rented this house for me to live in whilst I attend to my studies."

1911
02:44:00,000 --> 02:44:16,000
Hiyori: "They didn't buy it outright - buying a home such as this for three years' of education would be wasteful, even from my parents' perspective - but they have sunk a considerable sum of money into it over the last couple of years."

1912
02:44:16,000 --> 02:44:19,000
Hiyori: "It all seems a bit excessive to me..."

1913
02:44:19,000 --> 02:44:25,000
Hiyori: "But my parents are excessive people. They've always had more money than sense."

1914
02:44:25,000 --> 02:44:31,000
Haru: "I remember you saying that once before. You said your parents were rich, didn't you?"

1915
02:44:31,000 --> 02:44:34,000
Hiyori: "Yes, indeed. They're incredibly well-off."

1916
02:44:34,000 --> 02:44:39,000
*I've only been in Hiyori's home a few minutes, but I can believe that.*

1917
02:44:39,000 --> 02:44:50,000
*My parents would never be able to afford putting me up in a house like this. Hiyori's parents mightn't have bought this place, but renting in Tokyo isn't cheap.*

1918
02:44:50,000 --> 02:44:58,000
*My cruddy apartment costs an eye-watering sum as it is. I can't even begin to imagine how much this house must be.*

1919
02:44:58,000 --> 02:45:04,000
*It's strange. Hiyori doesn't dress or act like a wealthy young lady, but I suppose she must be.*

1920
02:45:04,000 --> 02:45:09,000
*Should I start curtsying to her from now on, and calling her "milady"?*

1921
02:45:09,000 --> 02:45:14,000
*It's a funny thought, but I don't think Hiyori would appreciate it.*

1922
02:45:14,000 --> 02:45:21,000
*She looks unusually troubled, sitting on her sleek, modern couch, her fingers curled on her lap.*

1923
02:45:21,000 --> 02:45:25,000
*This might be her home, but she looks even stiffer than I feel.*

1924
02:45:25,000 --> 02:45:31,000
*I guess she's not comfortable to all these luxurious trappings, despite growing up among them.*

1925
02:45:31,000 --> 02:45:36,000
*Hiyori is far more relaxed when she's in the rundown astronomy clubroom.*

1926
02:45:36,000 --> 02:45:39,000
*Could that be why she spends so much time there?*

1927
02:45:39,000 --> 02:45:44,000
*The astronomy clubroom is more soothing, I'll admit, than this place.*

1928
02:45:44,000 --> 02:45:56,000
*Fancy though this living room is, it's a bit too pristine. The walls and the floor and the furnishings are so neat and tidy, it looks like something you'd find in a magazine.*

1929
02:45:56,000 --> 02:46:02,000
*There's no warmth in here at all. I can't see many personal effects scattered about, either.*

1930
02:46:02,000 --> 02:46:05,000
*The atmosphere is uncomfortably chilly.*

1931
02:46:05,000 --> 02:46:14,000
Hiyori: "I told my parents I'd be fine living in an apartment complex, like most of my fellow students, but they wouldn't hear of it."

1932
02:46:14,000 --> 02:46:22,000
Hiyori: "They were afraid I would... I don't know, get robbed, maybe, or that I would get into fights with my housemates."

1933
02:46:22,000 --> 02:46:27,000
Hiyori: "I suppose that's because I never fit in during high school."

1934
02:46:27,000 --> 02:46:33,000
Hiyori: "My parents thought I would be best off on my own, away from everybody else."

1935
02:46:33,000 --> 02:46:37,000
Hiyori: "Maybe they were right... But I'll never know that now."

1936
02:46:37,000 --> 02:46:38,000
*Hiyori sighs.*

1937
02:46:38,000 --> 02:46:45,000
Hiyori: "Having a house like this to myself has its perks, certainly, but it can be somewhat lonely."

1938
02:46:45,000 --> 02:46:51,000
Hiyori: "I envy you, Haru, having Koichi and the others to speak to. You're never alone."

1939
02:46:51,000 --> 02:46:58,000
Haru: "Oh, I don't know if my position is all that enviable. Koichi and the others can't stand me."

1940
02:46:58,000 --> 02:47:02,000
Hiyori: "I don't think that's true. They might be a bit raucous..."

1941
02:47:02,000 --> 02:47:04,000
*And that's putting it lightly.*

1942
02:47:04,000 --> 02:47:10,000
Hiyori: "...but you seem to get on well enough. You're always horsing around, aren't you?"

1943
02:47:10,000 --> 02:47:12,000
Haru: "I guess so, maybe?"

1944
02:47:12,000 --> 02:47:13,000
*Hiyori sighs again.*

1945
02:47:13,000 --> 02:47:23,000
Hiyori: "I would have loved to live somewhere with other girls, whom I could befriend. I've been rather lonely, living in this house all on my own."

1946
02:47:23,000 --> 02:47:32,000
Hiyori: "My parents say this is for my own good, but what do they know? I'm not entirely certain that they are my real parents."

1947
02:47:32,000 --> 02:47:44,000
Hiyori: "They've always spoiled me, ever since I can remember. They used to buy me toys and pretty dresses, and now they buy me fancy electronic gadgets and they pay my rent."

1948
02:47:44,000 --> 02:47:50,000
Hiyori: "I've never wanted for anything, but it's always felt like they're over-compensating."

1949
02:47:50,000 --> 02:47:54,000
Haru: "You mean, you think they're trying to buy your affection?"

1950
02:47:54,000 --> 02:48:02,000
Hiyori: "That's exactly it. They're far more generous than other parents would be because they're not my parents."

1951
02:48:02,000 --> 02:48:04,000
Hiyori: "I'm certain I'm adopted."

1952
02:48:04,000 --> 02:48:12,000
Hiyori: "I've not seen any proof - not with my own eyes - but my parents get awfully cagey whenever I bring the subject up."

1953
02:48:12,000 --> 02:48:14,000
Hiyori: "It's suspicious."

1954
02:48:14,000 --> 02:48:20,000
Hiyori: "I wish they'd be honest with me - I'm twenty years old, after all! - but..."

1955
02:48:20,000 --> 02:48:21,000
Ena: "Nn, zzz..."

1956
02:48:21,000 --> 02:48:24,000
*A yawn from Ena punctuates Hiyori's complaints.*

1957
02:48:24,000 --> 02:48:35,000
*Hiyori looks at Ena, abashed. Ena is sitting next to me on the couch, slumped against my side. Her eyelashes are matted, and it looks like she's fast asleep.*

1958
02:48:35,000 --> 02:48:36,000
Hiyori: "My, my!"

1959
02:48:36,000 --> 02:48:37,000
*Hiyori smiles.*

1960
02:48:37,000 --> 02:48:42,000
Hiyori: "I'm afraid all my talk must have bored her. She's out for the count!"

1961
02:48:42,000 --> 02:48:50,000
Haru: "I don't think Ena's bored. She's just tired. We did do a lot of walking today. She must've tired herself out."

1962
02:48:50,000 --> 02:48:58,000
Hiyori: "I suppose so. There is more I wish to discuss with you, Haru - but first, we should probably put Ena to bed."

1963
02:48:58,000 --> 02:49:05,000
Hiyori: "There's a guest room upstairs, with a nice, soft bed. I'm sure she'll feel right at home there."

1964
02:49:05,000 --> 02:49:11,000
Hiyori: "I think we should be able to carry her together, if you don't mind helping me?"

1965
02:49:11,000 --> 02:49:14,000
Haru: "Of course not. Up you get, Ena."

1966
02:49:14,000 --> 02:49:21,000
*I haul the comatose Ena to her feet, who murmurs something incoherent and cuddles up against my shoulder.*

1967
02:49:21,000 --> 02:49:29,000
*With Hiyori's help, I guide Ena up the stairs, then into one of Hiyori's guest bedrooms (apparently, she has two).*

1968
02:49:29,000 --> 02:49:34,000
*The pair of us lay Ena upon the bed, then draw the covers up beneath her chin.*

1969
02:49:34,000 --> 02:49:41,000
*She doesn't stir all the while, despite our jostling. Her eyes remain shut, her breathing soft and regular.*

1970
02:49:41,000 --> 02:49:43,000
*She really must be exhausted.*

1971
02:49:43,000 --> 02:49:48,000
*With Ena safely tucked up in bed, Hiyori and I then return to the living room.*

1972
02:49:48,000 --> 02:49:58,000
*Hiyori offers to brew me some tea, to which I accept. Hiyori then heads to the kitchen, while I sit in the neat, seemingly unused living room, all alone.*

1973
02:49:58,000 --> 02:50:03,000
*Hiyori's house might be gorgeous, but there's something awfully staid about it.*

1974
02:50:03,000 --> 02:50:05,000
*I don't think I like it very much.*

1975
02:50:05,000 --> 02:50:09,000
*Hiyori's perfect living room is so quiet it borders on sinister.*

1976
02:50:09,000 --> 02:50:14,000
*Hiyori must feel horribly alone, living in an isolated place like this.*

1977
02:50:14,000 --> 02:50:18,000
*I wonder if there's something I can do to cheer her up?*

1978
02:50:18,000 --> 02:50:28,000
*I'm pondering this when Hiyori returns from the kitchen, a tray in hand. Upon the tray are two cups of freshly-brewed tea, exuding heat, and a teapot.*

1979
02:50:28,000 --> 02:50:32,000
Hiyori: "Here you are, Haru. Sorry to keep you waiting!"

1980
02:50:32,000 --> 02:50:38,000
*Hiyori sets the tray on the coffee table, then takes a seat beside me on the couch.*

1981
02:50:38,000 --> 02:50:48,000
*I thank her and pick up my teacup. I blow on the surface of the tea a couple of times before bringing the rim of the cup to my lips, then sipping.*

1982
02:50:48,000 --> 02:50:51,000
Hiyori: "What do you think? Is it good?"

1983
02:50:51,000 --> 02:50:57,000
Haru: "Yeah, it is. I'm glad you didn't use too much sugar. You remember what I like, huh?"

1984
02:50:57,000 --> 02:51:04,000
Hiyori: "Of course I do. We've been friends for quite some time now, and I've been cooking for you regularly."

1985
02:51:04,000 --> 02:51:08,000
Hiyori: "I have all of your tastes memorized, locked up here."

1986
02:51:08,000 --> 02:51:10,000
*Hiyori taps her temple, grinning.*

1987
02:51:10,000 --> 02:51:17,000
Hiyori: "I'm not so good at recalling important facts or figures, but I recall almost everything about you."

1988
02:51:17,000 --> 02:51:19,000
Haru: "R-Really? And why is that?"

1989
02:51:19,000 --> 02:51:24,000
Hiyori: "I don't know. I suppose it's because you're special to me."

1990
02:51:24,000 --> 02:51:25,000
Haru: "I-I am?"

1991
02:51:25,000 --> 02:51:30,000
Hiyori: "Yes, very much so. I'm... really glad I met you, you know, Haru?"

1992
02:51:30,000 --> 02:51:32,000
*Hiyori smiles at me gently.*

1993
02:51:32,000 --> 02:51:39,000
Hiyori: "Back in high school, the girls in my class all teased me, and the boys didn't give me a second glance."

1994
02:51:39,000 --> 02:51:42,000
Hiyori: "They thought I was plain, and maybe I am."

1995
02:51:42,000 --> 02:51:49,000
Hiyori: "Part of me wonders if that's why I became so obsessed with the idea that I'm an alien..."

1996
02:51:49,000 --> 02:51:52,000
*Hiyori frowns, then crosses her legs.*

1997
02:51:52,000 --> 02:51:59,000
Hiyori: "Not that it did much good. My assertions only made my classmates draw even further away from me."

1998
02:51:59,000 --> 02:52:05,000
Hiyori: "This is a bit embarrassing, but you're the first proper friend I've ever had."

1999
02:52:05,000 --> 02:52:09,000
Hiyori: "You're the only person I feel like I can confide in..."

2000
02:52:09,000 --> 02:52:13,000
Hiyori: "Well, you and Ena, now. She's a sweetheart."

2001
02:52:13,000 --> 02:52:19,000
Hiyori: "I've been having fun with her, but I don't feel the same way about her as I do you."

2002
02:52:19,000 --> 02:52:21,000
Hiyori: "I like you a lot, Haru."

2003
02:52:21,000 --> 02:52:24,000
Haru: "W-Wow, uh... Th-Thanks, Hiyori."

2004
02:52:24,000 --> 02:52:30,000
*I take a sip of my tea, hoping to mask the blush which has begun to spread across my cheeks.*

2005
02:52:30,000 --> 02:52:35,000
*My heart is fluttering inside my chest like the wings of a butterfly.*

2006
02:52:35,000 --> 02:52:44,000
*All of a sudden, I'm aware of my proximity to Hiyori. She's sitting very close to me on the couch - closer, perhaps, than is necessary.*

2007
02:52:44,000 --> 02:52:50,000
*I'm used to Hiyori threading her arm through mine, but this feels even more intimate.*

2008
02:52:50,000 --> 02:52:55,000
*Maybe that's because we're alone together, in Hiyori's living room.*

2009
02:52:55,000 --> 02:53:01,000
*There's nobody here to stop us, should things get serious - n-not like that'll ever happen!*

2010
02:53:01,000 --> 02:53:09,000
*I like Hiyori as a friend, but I certainly don't like her in that way. As for Hiyori herself, meanwhile, well...*

2011
02:53:09,000 --> 02:53:11,000
Haru: "I, um... Like you a lot, too?"

2012
02:53:11,000 --> 02:53:16,000
*I reply, my voice questioning, as I set my teacup back down on the table.*

2013
02:53:16,000 --> 02:53:18,000
Haru: "You're, uh... a good friend."

2014
02:53:18,000 --> 02:53:21,000
Hiyori: "Thank you. I feel the same way about you."

2015
02:53:21,000 --> 02:53:30,000
Hiyori: "You are such a good friend to me, in fact, I want to show you something I've not shown anybody before; not willingly, at least."

2016
02:53:30,000 --> 02:53:33,000
Hiyori: "This is a bit embarrassing, but..."

2017
02:53:33,000 --> 02:53:43,000
*Hiyori swallows, then seems to come to some kind of internal agreement. She raises her head, her eyes meeting mine, then says in an unwavering voice...*

2018
02:53:43,000 --> 02:53:49,000
Hiyori: "I want you to know everything about me. You deserve to know the full truth."

2019
02:53:49,000 --> 02:53:57,000
*OK, now this is starting to sound serious. I'm almost expecting this to lead up to a confession of a criminal record.*

2020
02:53:57,000 --> 02:54:00,000
*Hiyori hasn't murdered anybody, has she?*

2021
02:54:00,000 --> 02:54:08,000
*It'd be a surprise, given how sweet and mild-mannered she is, but they do say you can't judge a book by its cover.*

2022
02:54:08,000 --> 02:54:17,000
*Would it be any more shocking, really, to discover that Hiyori has a body count, than it was to meet an actual alien like Ena?*

2023
02:54:17,000 --> 02:54:18,000
*It's hard to say.*

2024
02:54:18,000 --> 02:54:21,000
*My life really has become complicated.*

2025
02:54:21,000 --> 02:54:26,000
Haru: "What truth are you talking about, exactly? Did something happen?"

2026
02:54:26,000 --> 02:54:31,000
Hiyori: "Not really, no - but I think something might happen because of this."

2027
02:54:31,000 --> 02:54:36,000
Hiyori: "I've been waiting for something to happen for a long, long while."

2028
02:54:36,000 --> 02:54:43,000
Hiyori: "My parents told me I was being foolish - my classmates, too - but their opinions are irrelevant."

2029
02:54:43,000 --> 02:54:46,000
Hiyori: "I want to know what you think."

2030
02:54:46,000 --> 02:54:47,000
Haru: "About...?"

2031
02:54:47,000 --> 02:54:48,000
Hiyori: "This."

2032
02:54:48,000 --> 02:54:55,000
*Hiyori grabs the neckline of her sweater and pulls it down, revealing an ample amount of her cleavage.*

2033
02:54:55,000 --> 02:54:59,000
*She does this so suddenly, I can do nothing other than gawp.*

2034
02:54:59,000 --> 02:55:00,000
Haru: "Wha...?"

2035
02:55:00,000 --> 02:55:06,000
*I'd like to look away, but my vision is being sucked into the abyss of her soft bosom.*

2036
02:55:06,000 --> 02:55:17,000
*I've always known Hiyori's chest is on the large side, despite all the sweaters she wears, but now I've concrete confirmation of the fact. Hiyori really is stacked!*

2037
02:55:17,000 --> 02:55:23,000
*She looks incredible, and the pale pink blush that dubs her cheeks only adds to her charms.*

2038
02:55:23,000 --> 02:55:26,000
*I can't believe I ever thought Hiyori was plain.*

2039
02:55:26,000 --> 02:55:33,000
*She might not stand out much when compared to Ena, but that's because Ena has green hair and amber eyes.*

2040
02:55:33,000 --> 02:55:40,000
*Hiyori's looks are certainly more "normal", but there's a subtle, understated charm that underpins them.*

2041
02:55:40,000 --> 02:55:41,000
Hiyori: "Haru..."

2042
02:55:41,000 --> 02:55:45,000
*Hiyori stares at me, her brown eyes unnaturally focused.*

2043
02:55:45,000 --> 02:55:48,000
Hiyori: "Can you see anything unusual about me?"

2044
02:55:48,000 --> 02:55:49,000
Haru: "U-Unusual...?"

2045
02:55:49,000 --> 02:55:50,000
*I blink, bemused.*

2046
02:55:50,000 --> 02:55:55,000
*What does Hiyori want me to say, exactly? "Yes, your chest is unusually big?"*

2047
02:55:55,000 --> 02:56:03,000
*She might be exposing a lot of her cleavage to me, but somehow, I don't think that's quite the response she's fishing for.*

2048
02:56:03,000 --> 02:56:05,000
*What, though, is her game here?*

2049
02:56:05,000 --> 02:56:08,000
*Why is she acting in so provocative a manner?*

2050
02:56:08,000 --> 02:56:11,000
*She isn't trying to seduce me, is she?*

2051
02:56:11,000 --> 02:56:17,000
*If she is, she's doing a pretty good job at it. She looks so warm and soft and...*

2052
02:56:17,000 --> 02:56:18,000
Haru: "Oh..."

2053
02:56:18,000 --> 02:56:26,000
*Realization suddenly dawns, as my eyes zero in on a certain "abnormality" that tarnishes Hiyori's otherwise perfect skin.*

2054
02:56:26,000 --> 02:56:34,000
*I was so taken by Hiyori's body I didn't notice at first, but now I've spotted it, I can't tear my eyes away from it.*

2055
02:56:34,000 --> 02:56:36,000
*It really is strange.*

2056
02:56:36,000 --> 02:56:42,000
*There, on one of Hiyori's soft mounds, is a peculiarly-shaped birthmark that looks like a star.*

2057
02:56:42,000 --> 02:56:49,000
*I've never seen anything like it before, outside of the pages of this one popular shounen manga.*

2058
02:56:49,000 --> 02:56:53,000
*Hiyori isn't the descendent of a certain famous family, is she?*

2059
02:56:53,000 --> 02:56:58,000
*Can she perform feats of superhuman strength?! Stop time?! Save the world?!*

2060
02:56:58,000 --> 02:57:03,000
*...That seems pretty unlikely - but, then again, so is Ena. Anything's possible.*

2061
02:57:03,000 --> 02:57:06,000
Haru: "That's, um... an interesting birthmark."

2062
02:57:06,000 --> 02:57:09,000
Haru: "It, uh, is a birthmark, isn't it?"

2063
02:57:09,000 --> 02:57:10,000
*Hiyori nods.*

2064
02:57:10,000 --> 02:57:19,000
Hiyori: "I've had this since I was born. I didn't pay it much attention when I was younger, but as time wore on I started to wonder."

2065
02:57:19,000 --> 02:57:27,000
Hiyori: "It's a perfect star shape, with five neat points. It's very uncommon for birthmarks to be shaped like this."

2066
02:57:27,000 --> 02:57:35,000
Hiyori: "It was this birthmark which made me wonder whether I might, in fact, be an alien. It seems like some sort of sign."

2067
02:57:35,000 --> 02:57:41,000
Hiyori: "I've never fit on this planet, and I'm certain I'm not my parents' real daughter."

2068
02:57:41,000 --> 02:57:54,000
Hiyori: "They don't have any photographs of me as a baby, and they don't act the way other people's parents do. They're so nice, it's cloying. It's as though they're afraid I might leave them."

2069
02:57:54,000 --> 02:58:01,000
Hiyori: "After putting all the evidence together, I decided I must be an alien. This birthmark proves it."

2070
02:58:01,000 --> 02:58:05,000
Hiyori: "I've been certain of this for the last seven years."

2071
02:58:05,000 --> 02:58:11,000
*Hiyori relinquishes her grip on her sweater, once more hiding her curious birthmark.*

2072
02:58:11,000 --> 02:58:18,000
Hiyori: "I'm certain that it must mean something... but I think you're less than convinced, Haru."

2073
02:58:18,000 --> 02:58:21,000
Hiyori: "You think it's crazy, don't you?"

2074
02:58:21,000 --> 02:58:24,000
Haru: "Well, I don't know about crazy..."

2075
02:58:24,000 --> 02:58:31,000
*I look away from Hiyori, her magnetic influence on me terminated with the covering of her supple flesh.*

2076
02:58:31,000 --> 02:58:41,000
Haru: "I do think it's unlikely, though. Your birthmark is certainly unusual, but I don't think it's so very unusual it confirms you're an alien."

2077
02:58:41,000 --> 02:58:50,000
Haru: "As for your parents, well... I can't say too much on that front - I've never met them - but doting mothers and fathers do exist."

2078
02:58:50,000 --> 02:58:59,000
Haru: "They're rich, and you're their only child, so maybe they feel like spoiling you. There doesn't have to be a deeper meaning behind it."

2079
02:58:59,000 --> 02:59:05,000
Hiyori: "Yes, I suppose you're right. I've told myself that too, of course, but still..."

2080
02:59:05,000 --> 02:59:06,000
*Hiyori sighs.*

2081
02:59:06,000 --> 02:59:10,000
Hiyori: "I can't shake the feeling that I don't quite belong here."

2082
02:59:10,000 --> 02:59:22,000
Hiyori: "I've always felt more at peace when I look to the sky. The stars are more comforting to me than the company of other people has ever be - apart from you, of course."

2083
02:59:22,000 --> 02:59:27,000
*Hiyori shifts even closer to me upon the couch, then rests her hand upon mine.*

2084
02:59:27,000 --> 02:59:30,000
Hiyori: "I trust you, Haru. I like you."

2085
02:59:30,000 --> 02:59:34,000
Haru: "I know. You already said. I'm glad to hear it, but, uh..."

2086
02:59:34,000 --> 02:59:40,000
*I scratch my cheek with my free hand; the one which isn't entwined with Hiyori's.*

2087
02:59:40,000 --> 02:59:42,000
Haru: "Aren't you upset?"

2088
02:59:42,000 --> 02:59:44,000
Hiyori: "No. Why would I be?"

2089
02:59:44,000 --> 02:59:52,000
Haru: "I, uh, didn't agree with you when you said you thought you were an alien. Didn't that hurt your feelings?"

2090
02:59:52,000 --> 03:00:00,000
Hiyori: "It's fine. I didn't expect you to agree, or to understand. I just thought I should show you my birthmark."

2091
03:00:00,000 --> 03:00:03,000
Hiyori: "I want you to know everything about me."

2092
03:00:03,000 --> 03:00:07,000
*Hiyori leans in closer still, her chest pressing against my arm.*

2093
03:00:07,000 --> 03:00:16,000
Hiyori: "I've been trying to confess to you for a long time, Haru. I've not been subtle in my advances, but you never seemed to get the hint."

2094
03:00:16,000 --> 03:00:23,000
Hiyori: "I was too shy to outright state what I wanted, so I had to play my attachment off as a joke..."

2095
03:00:23,000 --> 03:00:25,000
*Hiyori's fingers squeeze my palm.*

2096
03:00:25,000 --> 03:00:29,000
Hiyori: "But it isn't a joke. It's never been a joke."

2097
03:00:29,000 --> 03:00:37,000
Hiyori: "You're the most important person in the world to me, and I can't keep that bottled up inside; not any longer."

2098
03:00:37,000 --> 03:00:40,000
Hiyori: "I have to tell you how I feel!"

2099
03:00:40,000 --> 03:00:42,000
Haru: "And... how is that, exactly?"

2100
03:00:42,000 --> 03:00:48,000
*My voice is softer than a whisper as I address Hiyori, my mouth inches away from hers.*

2101
03:00:48,000 --> 03:00:54,000
*Though I'm trying to play it cool, I can feel  my cheeks prickling pink with embarrassment.*

2102
03:00:54,000 --> 03:01:04,000
*I'm more acutely aware of Hiyori's body than I've ever been before. The sight of her bosom must have ignited a fire within me, because I feel on-edge.*

2103
03:01:04,000 --> 03:01:07,000
*My relationship with Hiyori is starting to shift.*

2104
03:01:07,000 --> 03:01:11,000
*After tonight, I doubt things will ever be the same.*

2105
03:01:11,000 --> 03:01:17,000
*This thought fills me with pressure, but it's not unpleasant. Perhaps I want things to change.*

2106
03:01:17,000 --> 03:01:21,000
Hiyori: "You should know how I feel at this point, Haru..."

2107
03:01:21,000 --> 03:01:24,000
Hiyori: "But I'll spell it out for you, if I must."

2108
03:01:24,000 --> 03:01:25,000
*Hiyori smiles.*

2109
03:01:25,000 --> 03:01:33,000
Hiyori: "It's true what people say. You boys are dense. I wish you'd realized earlier, to spare me this embarrassment..."

2110
03:01:33,000 --> 03:01:37,000
Hiyori: "But getting it off my chest should make me feel better."

2111
03:01:37,000 --> 03:01:40,000
*Hiyori exhales, her eyelashes falling shut.*

2112
03:01:40,000 --> 03:01:44,000
*Then, she peers into my face, our fingers clasped, and says...*

2113
03:01:44,000 --> 03:01:48,000
Hiyori: "I like you, Haru! I really, really like you!"

2114
03:01:48,000 --> 03:01:51,000
Hiyori: "In fact, I think I might be in love you!"

2115
03:01:51,000 --> 03:01:52,000
Haru: "Hiyori-"

2116
03:01:52,000 --> 03:01:54,000
*I begin, but I'm unable to finish.*

2117
03:01:54,000 --> 03:02:01,000
*That's because, roughly 0.03 seconds later, something soft and warm impresses itself upon my mouth.*

2118
03:02:01,000 --> 03:02:06,000
*It takes me another 0.03 seconds to figure out what this sensation is.*

2119
03:02:06,000 --> 03:02:07,000
*It's Hiyori.*

2120
03:02:07,000 --> 03:02:08,000
*She's kissing me.*

2121
03:02:08,000 --> 03:02:12,000
*There's no way I could misconstrue her affections now.*

2122
03:02:12,000 --> 03:02:14,000
*She really must love me.*

2123
03:02:14,000 --> 03:02:16,000
Hiyori: "Mm... Nn, chh..."

2124
03:02:16,000 --> 03:02:17,000
Haru: "Ah..."

2125
03:02:17,000 --> 03:02:25,000
*I sigh into the kiss, which Hiyori uses to her advantage. Her tongue slides into my mouth, her fingers cupping my cheeks.*

2126
03:02:25,000 --> 03:02:31,000
*She's the one taking the initiative, despite being much slighter and smaller than I am.*

2127
03:02:31,000 --> 03:02:43,000
*In situations like this, I thought the guy was supposed to take the lead - but my knowledge re: "situations like this" is woefully lacking. I've never had a girlfriend before.*

2128
03:02:43,000 --> 03:02:48,000
*I feel completely out of my depth - but, then again, so is Hiyori.*

2129
03:02:48,000 --> 03:02:53,000
*If I'm her first ever friend, as she said, I doubt she ever had a boyfriend.*

2130
03:02:53,000 --> 03:03:01,000
*We're both complete novices when it comes to love, but maybe that's what drew Hiyori to me so intensely in the first place.*

2131
03:03:01,000 --> 03:03:04,000
*Like her, I'm something of an outcast, too.*

2132
03:03:04,000 --> 03:03:13,000
*I've never thought of myself as an alien, but my obsession with the stars is strong enough that I've frequently been labeled a space case.*

2133
03:03:13,000 --> 03:03:20,000
*I guess Hiyori and I are pretty similar. That being the case, it's not so surprising she would fall for me.*

2134
03:03:20,000 --> 03:03:22,000
*As for me, meanwhile...*

2135
03:03:22,000 --> 03:03:27,000
*I don't know what, exactly, will happen next, but maybe that doesn't matter.*

2136
03:03:27,000 --> 03:03:32,000
*I want to kiss Hiyori, and touch her, and inhale the scent of her shampoo...*

2137
03:03:32,000 --> 03:03:35,000
*And, above all else, I want to make her happy.*

2138
03:03:35,000 --> 03:03:43,000
*The cool, wintry air rumples my hair and nips at my skin, but it can't dilute the memory of Hiyori's mouth against me.*

2139
03:03:43,000 --> 03:03:53,000
*I'd thought Hiyori might have been interested in me, given her propensity for affectionate displays, but I chalked all that up to her... well. Hiyori-ness.*

2140
03:03:53,000 --> 03:03:56,000
*I thought she was just being friendly.*

2141
03:03:56,000 --> 03:04:00,000
*I wasn't aware that her feelings for me ran deeper than that.*

2142
03:04:00,000 --> 03:04:13,000
*I wasn't really sure, if I'm being honest, that Hiyori was capable of falling in love with anybody. She seemed too lost in her own little world to pay attention to earthly affairs such as romance.*

2143
03:04:13,000 --> 03:04:15,000
*I guess I was mistaken.*

2144
03:04:15,000 --> 03:04:17,000
*Now what am I going to do?*

2145
03:04:17,000 --> 03:04:19,000
Haru: "What do you think, Ena?"

2146
03:04:19,000 --> 03:04:24,000
*I glance at my companion, whose cheek is pressed against my shoulder.*

2147
03:04:24,000 --> 03:04:26,000
Haru: "Should I start dating Hiyori?"

2148
03:04:26,000 --> 03:04:33,000
Haru: "It'd seem scummy not to, after she confessed so earnestly, but I still don't know how I feel about her."

2149
03:04:33,000 --> 03:04:35,000
Haru: "Do you have any advice?"

2150
03:04:35,000 --> 03:04:37,000
*Ena, alas, doesn't reply.*

2151
03:04:37,000 --> 03:04:40,000
*I was hoping for a bit of feminine insight, but...*

2152
03:04:40,000 --> 03:04:42,000
Ena: "Mm, nn... Zzz..."

2153
03:04:42,000 --> 03:04:49,000
*Ena is asleep, her eyelashes matted together. She must have exhausted herself, after the day's exertions.*

2154
03:04:49,000 --> 03:04:59,000
*Her arms are looped tight about mine, and her head is lolling. A few strands of her green hair are in her mouth, and her lower lip is spotted with saliva.*

2155
03:04:59,000 --> 03:05:07,000
*It's a miracle she's able to remain upright, and that she's been keeping pace with me during our walk back home.*

2156
03:05:07,000 --> 03:05:10,000
*She's stumbling along like a little zombie.*

2157
03:05:10,000 --> 03:05:14,000
Haru: "...I guess now's not the best time to discuss all this."

2158
03:05:14,000 --> 03:05:18,000
*Ena's plainly incapable of discussing anything at the moment.*

2159
03:05:18,000 --> 03:05:26,000
*I smile at my alien companion, touched by how sweetly vulnerable she looks, and brush some stray hair from her mouth.*

2160
03:05:26,000 --> 03:05:27,000
Ena: "Nn... Nnmph...?"

2161
03:05:27,000 --> 03:05:32,000
*Ena stirs at this, shifting at my touch, but her eyes remain shut tight.*

2162
03:05:32,000 --> 03:05:41,000
Haru: "Sorry for dumping all this on you, Ena. This isn't your problem. I'll have to think about Hiyori's feelings on my own terms."

2163
03:05:41,000 --> 03:05:47,000
Haru: "For now, let's get you back home. You look like you could use some proper shut-eye..."

2164
03:05:47,000 --> 03:05:53,000
*I yawn, my eyes beading with tears. The cold breeze chills them, so my skin prickles.*

2165
03:05:53,000 --> 03:05:56,000
Haru: "And so could I, as a matter of fact."

2166
03:05:56,000 --> 03:06:00,000
*Today's been more eventful than I imagined it would.*

2167
03:06:00,000 --> 03:06:04,000
*My life really has become hectic since Ena crash-landed into it.*

2168
03:06:04,000 --> 03:06:13,000
*Things are occurring at so rapid a pace, it's hard to keep abreast of it all, but I'm not unhappy with how things have worked out.*

2169
03:06:13,000 --> 03:06:15,000
*Maybe I should thank Ena for that.*

2170
03:06:15,000 --> 03:06:20,000
*Whether it was intentional or not, she really has brightened things up.*

2171
03:06:20,000 --> 03:06:29,000
*I return to my apartment at as brisk a pace I can manage, while supporting the near-comatose Ena, and let the pair of us inside my room.*

2172
03:06:29,000 --> 03:06:37,000
*Ena is so tired, I have to help her out of her new clothes and into the oversized shirt she's been using as her pajamas.*

2173
03:06:37,000 --> 03:06:44,000
*I do my best not to gawp at Ena, but it's a tricky business, given how voluptuous her curves are.*

2174
03:06:44,000 --> 03:06:48,000
*My fingertips brush Ena's bared skin, and she sighs in response.*

2175
03:06:48,000 --> 03:06:53,000
*She looks so beautiful, indecent thoughts begin to cloud my mind...*

2176
03:06:53,000 --> 03:06:58,000
*But, with monk-like self-control, I'm able to ward these thoughts away.*

2177
03:06:58,000 --> 03:07:08,000
*I don't want to look at Ena as a mere object of lust. That would only serve to strain our relationship, not to mention my relationship with Hiyori.*

2178
03:07:08,000 --> 03:07:11,000
*Now, I wonder what I'm going to do about that?*

2179
03:07:11,000 --> 03:07:13,000
*I still have no idea.*

2180
03:07:13,000 --> 03:07:16,000
*I've a lot to think about. It's all a mess.*

2181
03:07:16,000 --> 03:07:23,000
*I worry, as I help Ena into her futon, then lay down in my own, that I'll never be able to get any rest.*

2182
03:07:23,000 --> 03:07:29,000
*My brain is stuffed to the brim with thoughts, like packing paper in a cardboard box.*

2183
03:07:29,000 --> 03:07:31,000
*It's all a bit overwhelming...*

2184
03:07:31,000 --> 03:07:35,000
*But my exhaustion claims me quicker than I thought it would.*

2185
03:07:35,000 --> 03:07:40,000
*My eyelashes fall shut the moment my cheek meets my pillow, and soon...*

2186
03:07:40,000 --> 03:07:42,000
Haru: "Mm... Nn, zzz..."

2187
03:07:42,000 --> 03:07:46,000
*...I find myself pulled into the dark recesses of my own dreams.*

2188
03:07:46,000 --> 03:07:52,000
*I don't dream of Ena or Hiyori, though they've been playing on my mind a good deal all day.*

2189
03:07:52,000 --> 03:07:57,000
*My dreams are devoid of the touch of human flesh; devoid, too, of any warmth.*

2190
03:07:57,000 --> 03:08:02,000
*In my dreams, I see myself stranded in the vast, dark recesses of space.*

2191
03:08:02,000 --> 03:08:12,000
*Stars twinkle around me like granules of sugar, and the planets revolve slowly about the sun, little more than tiny pinpricks in the distance.*

2192
03:08:12,000 --> 03:08:18,000
*It's a humbling kind of dream, which impresses upon me just how small and insignificant I am.*

2193
03:08:18,000 --> 03:08:22,000
*The vast, uncharted depths of space are terrifying...*

2194
03:08:22,000 --> 03:08:24,000
*But they're reassuring, too.*

2195
03:08:24,000 --> 03:08:30,000
*When I look to the sky, I'm always reminded of just how unimportant my own problems are.*

2196
03:08:30,000 --> 03:08:35,000
*It's this knowledge which gives me the fortitude to keep on going.*

2197
03:08:35,000 --> 03:08:42,000
*I can do anything - or so I like to tell myself - so long as I can look to the stars for guidance.*

2198
03:08:42,000 --> 03:08:43,000
*...*

2199
03:08:43,000 --> 03:08:44,000
*...*

2200
03:08:44,000 --> 03:08:45,000
*...*

2201
03:08:45,000 --> 03:08:47,000
*And so, the next day...*

2202
03:08:47,000 --> 03:08:50,000
???: "Good morning, darling! Rise and shine!"

2203
03:08:50,000 --> 03:08:56,000
???: "We have another busy day ahead of us, and I am very much looking forward to it."

2204
03:08:56,000 --> 03:09:05,000
???: "I would like to explore more of this wonderful city, and indulge myself in more of you earthlings' intriguing pastimes..."

2205
03:09:05,000 --> 03:09:09,000
???: "But, before that, I have a gift I would like to give you."

2206
03:09:09,000 --> 03:09:12,000
???: "Perhaps it will help invigorate you... Ehehe."

2207
03:09:12,000 --> 03:09:13,000
Haru: "What...?"

2208
03:09:13,000 --> 03:09:19,000
*I blink groggily, dispersing white pinpricks of light which cloud my vision, then...*

2209
03:09:19,000 --> 03:09:20,000
Haru: "Ah..."

2210
03:09:20,000 --> 03:09:21,000
*My eyes snap open.*

2211
03:09:21,000 --> 03:09:26,000
*I feel wide awake, despite the lingering fatigue which still clings to my body.*

2212
03:09:26,000 --> 03:09:31,000
*I can't help but be awake, really, after being met with so sensuous a sight.*

2213
03:09:31,000 --> 03:09:37,000
*Ena is lying atop me, wearing nothing but the oversized button-up shirt I gave her to sleep in.*

2214
03:09:37,000 --> 03:09:42,000
*Her chest is pressed up against mine, and our mouths are locked together.*

2215
03:09:42,000 --> 03:09:43,000
*She's kissing me.*

2216
03:09:43,000 --> 03:09:44,000
Haru: "Mmph...?!"

2217
03:09:44,000 --> 03:09:51,000
*Ena's pointed, cat-like tongue slides into my mouth, coiling with my own. I can taste her saliva, honey-sweet.*

2218
03:09:51,000 --> 03:09:56,000
*The clean, refreshing smell of soap, meanwhile, wafts from Ena's body.*

2219
03:09:56,000 --> 03:10:01,000
*Her long hair brushes against my neck and my cheeks as she shifts atop me.*

2220
03:10:01,000 --> 03:10:08,000
*Though the covers of my futon are between us, acting as a barrier, this situation feels awfully intimate.*

2221
03:10:08,000 --> 03:10:09,000
Ena: "Mm, chh, mm..."

2222
03:10:09,000 --> 03:10:14,000
*Ena sighs as she kisses me, her tongue probing my mouth more deeply.*

2223
03:10:14,000 --> 03:10:19,000
*Her fingers curl about my shoulders, and a warm blush spreads across her cheeks.*

2224
03:10:19,000 --> 03:10:23,000
*Her eyelashes, which are tightly shut, are trembling.*

2225
03:10:23,000 --> 03:10:25,000
*Ena looks cute, but...*

2226
03:10:25,000 --> 03:10:26,000
Haru: "E-Ena..."

2227
03:10:26,000 --> 03:10:37,000
*I break the kiss, then take Ena's shoulders in my own. I push her away gently, as one might handle a newborn kitten - I don't want to hurt her - and stare at her.*

2228
03:10:37,000 --> 03:10:40,000
Haru: "Wh-What was that for, exactly?"

2229
03:10:40,000 --> 03:10:46,000
Ena: "It was a good morning kiss! I wanted to wake you up, and I thought this was the best way."

2230
03:10:46,000 --> 03:10:48,000
Ena: "Isn't this what couples do?"

2231
03:10:48,000 --> 03:10:53,000
Haru: "I guess it is, yeah... But we're not exactly a "couple", are we?"

2232
03:10:53,000 --> 03:10:54,000
Ena: "Are we not?"

2233
03:10:54,000 --> 03:10:57,000
Haru: "No! The jury's still out on that one."

2234
03:10:57,000 --> 03:11:04,000
*Ena might have decided I'm her "darling", but I've yet to come to any concrete conclusions there.*

2235
03:11:04,000 --> 03:11:09,000
*Ena's certainly pretty, and I do like her, but do I like her enough to date her?*

2236
03:11:09,000 --> 03:11:17,000
*I have a few reservations, particularly given how little time we've spent together. I don't want to rush into anything.*

2237
03:11:17,000 --> 03:11:22,000
*Then, there's also Hiyori's confession from last night to think about.*

2238
03:11:22,000 --> 03:11:28,000
*My love life, once as stagnant as a muddy puddle, has become rather troubled lately.*

2239
03:11:28,000 --> 03:11:33,000
*It's a lot for me to think about; especially this early in the morning.*

2240
03:11:33,000 --> 03:11:39,000
Haru: "I don't mean to be rude, but can you get off me, Ena? I need to get up and get dressed."

2241
03:11:39,000 --> 03:11:43,000
Ena: "I can help you get dressed, if you would like!"

2242
03:11:43,000 --> 03:11:47,000
Haru: "It's fine. I'll be alright on my own, thanks."

2243
03:11:47,000 --> 03:11:48,000
Ena: "Are you sure?"

2244
03:11:48,000 --> 03:11:49,000
*Ena's face falls.*

2245
03:11:49,000 --> 03:11:59,000
Ena: "If you won't let me kiss you, you should at least let me dress you, darling. That is another duty of wives upon this planet, or so I have heard!"

2246
03:11:59,000 --> 03:12:04,000
Haru: "I don't know if it's a "duty", per se. This isn't the feudal era..."

2247
03:12:04,000 --> 03:12:07,000
Haru: "And you're not my wife, silly."

2248
03:12:07,000 --> 03:12:11,000
Ena: "Not yet, maybe, but I will be after the wedding ceremony!"

2249
03:12:11,000 --> 03:12:13,000
Haru: "Yeah, yeah. Keep dreaming."

2250
03:12:13,000 --> 03:12:19,000
Ena: "I will! I am very good at daydreaming! It is one of my special skills, heehee!"

2251
03:12:19,000 --> 03:12:21,000
Haru: "Some skill that is."

2252
03:12:21,000 --> 03:12:25,000
*I roll my eyes, but I can't help but smile at Ena's cheeriness.*

2253
03:12:25,000 --> 03:12:35,000
*She might've woken me with an unorthodox method, but I can't bring myself to feel too upset about it. Ena's so cute, I can't be mad at her for long.*

2254
03:12:35,000 --> 03:12:41,000
*Her good morning kiss is a significant step up from the wake-up call I received yesterday, too.*

2255
03:12:41,000 --> 03:12:45,000
*I think Ena's learning about human customs, slowly but surely.*

2256
03:12:45,000 --> 03:12:50,000
*Ena's only been on Earth a couple of days, but she's making progress.*

2257
03:12:50,000 --> 03:12:53,000
*I almost feel like patting her on the head...*

2258
03:12:53,000 --> 03:12:58,000
*But that might be infantilizing, so I'll settle for pushing her off me instead.*

2259
03:12:58,000 --> 03:12:59,000
Haru: "Upsy-daisy."

2260
03:12:59,000 --> 03:13:06,000
*I nudge Ena off my supine body and onto the tatami floor, which she hits with a dull thud, then sit up.*

2261
03:13:06,000 --> 03:13:09,000
Haru: "Right. I think I'll have a shower."

2262
03:13:09,000 --> 03:13:14,000
Ena: "As you wish, darling! If you would like, I would be more than happy to-"

2263
03:13:14,000 --> 03:13:15,000
Haru: "No, it's fine."

2264
03:13:15,000 --> 03:13:18,000
*I cut Ena off, before she can proposition me.*

2265
03:13:18,000 --> 03:13:23,000
Haru: "You don't need to come in with me. I can handle that on my own, too."

2266
03:13:23,000 --> 03:13:29,000
Ena: "Oh dear. You humans are so awfully independent. I wish you would rely on me more..."

2267
03:13:29,000 --> 03:13:34,000
Ena: "But perhaps it is not I you wish to dote upon you, but Hiyori?"

2268
03:13:34,000 --> 03:13:35,000
Haru: "Hmm?"

2269
03:13:35,000 --> 03:13:37,000
*I peer at Ena curiously.*

2270
03:13:37,000 --> 03:13:48,000
*Her words have called back Hiyori's confession from last night, and the kiss which occurred after it. A blush rises to my cheeks which I can't fight off, hot and guilty.*

2271
03:13:48,000 --> 03:13:51,000
Haru: "Wh-What do you know about Hiyori and I?"

2272
03:13:51,000 --> 03:13:55,000
Ena: "Not much, really... But I have seen how close she is to you."

2273
03:13:55,000 --> 03:14:01,000
Ena: "You two did not get up to anything salacious last night, while I was asleep, did you?"

2274
03:14:01,000 --> 03:14:02,000
Haru: "Well, uh..."

2275
03:14:02,000 --> 03:14:04,000
*I glance away, suddenly awkward.*

2276
03:14:04,000 --> 03:14:12,000
*My gut instinct is to refute this accusation of Ena's, but I don't want to lie to her. Ena deserves to know the truth.*

2277
03:14:12,000 --> 03:14:18,000
*After some internal "um"ing and "ah"ing, I eventually muster the resolve to be honest.*

2278
03:14:18,000 --> 03:14:24,000
*I give Ena an abridged version of last night's events, while she nods thoughtfully.*

2279
03:14:24,000 --> 03:14:32,000
Ena: "I see. I thought something like that might happen. You appear awfully close, despite claiming to be nothing but friends."

2280
03:14:32,000 --> 03:14:42,000
Haru: "So you suspected Hiyori had a thing for me, huh? That's strange. I never cottoned onto Hiyori's feelings myself, and I'd known her for months."

2281
03:14:42,000 --> 03:14:48,000
Ena: "That must be because you human males are notoriously dense when it comes to feelings!"

2282
03:14:48,000 --> 03:14:50,000
Haru: "Hiyori said that, too..."

2283
03:14:50,000 --> 03:14:52,000
Ena: "And she would be correct!"

2284
03:14:52,000 --> 03:14:53,000
Haru: "Oh yeah?"

2285
03:14:53,000 --> 03:14:54,000
*I pout.*

2286
03:14:54,000 --> 03:14:57,000
Haru: "What do you know about "human males", Ena?"

2287
03:14:57,000 --> 03:15:02,000
Ena: "I know a good deal! I have read a lot of romance manga, after all!"

2288
03:15:02,000 --> 03:15:08,000
Ena: "Many of these stories do not work if the human males in them are not denser than bricks!"

2289
03:15:08,000 --> 03:15:19,000
Ena: "I thought this was, perhaps, an exaggeration, intended for comic effect, but interacting with you has led me to believe these stereotypes are based on truth!"

2290
03:15:19,000 --> 03:15:22,000
Ena: "Human men can be awfully dense..."

2291
03:15:22,000 --> 03:15:26,000
Ena: "But that thick-headedness is part of your appeal!"

2292
03:15:26,000 --> 03:15:28,000
Haru: "Right. Thanks, I guess. Uh..."

2293
03:15:28,000 --> 03:15:31,000
*I run a hand through my hair, distracted.*

2294
03:15:31,000 --> 03:15:34,000
Haru: "You're not angry about this, are you?"

2295
03:15:34,000 --> 03:15:40,000
Ena: "Who, me? No! I would never be angry at you, darling - or Hiyori, for that matter."

2296
03:15:40,000 --> 03:15:43,000
Ena: "You are both my precious friends."

2297
03:15:43,000 --> 03:15:53,000
Ena: "If you love Hiyori more than you love me, then I will stand aside and let you be together. You have known her longer than I have, after all."

2298
03:15:53,000 --> 03:15:54,000
Ena: "However..."

2299
03:15:54,000 --> 03:15:58,000
*Ena looks me up and down, a coy smile playing about her lips.*

2300
03:15:58,000 --> 03:16:02,000
Ena: "It seems you do not fully understand your own feelings."

2301
03:16:02,000 --> 03:16:09,000
Ena: "That being the case, I see no qualms in continuing my attempts at seduction, clumsy though they may be."

2302
03:16:09,000 --> 03:16:16,000
Ena: "Perhaps my kisses will help you realize who it is you really care for; be that Hiyori, myself, or..."

2303
03:16:16,000 --> 03:16:18,000
*Ena's eyes flash mischievously.*

2304
03:16:18,000 --> 03:16:20,000
Ena: "...the both of us?"

2305
03:16:20,000 --> 03:16:21,000
Haru: "Both of you?"

2306
03:16:21,000 --> 03:16:22,000
*My brow knits.*

2307
03:16:22,000 --> 03:16:24,000
Haru: "Is that really alright?"

2308
03:16:24,000 --> 03:16:30,000
Ena: "It is upon my planet. In Corval, monogamous relationships were the exception to the rule."

2309
03:16:30,000 --> 03:16:37,000
Ena: "I would not mind in the slightest if, unable to make up your mind, you chose to marry both Hiyori and I."

2310
03:16:37,000 --> 03:16:45,000
Ena: "I know little of human customs, so it would be nice to have a fellow bride to help me pick out my dress, ehehe."

2311
03:16:45,000 --> 03:16:47,000
Haru: "Now, isn't that an idea...?"

2312
03:16:47,000 --> 03:16:48,000
*I frown.*

2313
03:16:48,000 --> 03:16:58,000
*I think getting married to one woman sounds stressful, let alone two. That seems like a recipe for disaster, no matter how understanding Ena might be.*

2314
03:16:58,000 --> 03:17:02,000
*I wouldn't want Hiyori and Ena to get jealous of one another.*

2315
03:17:02,000 --> 03:17:07,000
*That might be inevitable, though, the longer I'm unable to choose between them.*

2316
03:17:07,000 --> 03:17:11,000
*Like last night, I find myself busy weighing up my options.*

2317
03:17:11,000 --> 03:17:12,000
*What do I want...?*

2318
03:17:12,000 --> 03:17:17,000
*...I guess that's what I'd prefer, but I'm still not entirely certain.*

2319
03:17:17,000 --> 03:17:19,000
*This is all very confusing.*

2320
03:17:19,000 --> 03:17:25,000
*This question plays on my mind while I have my shower, brush my teeth, and get dressed.*

2321
03:17:25,000 --> 03:17:31,000
*Once both Ena and I are in a presentable state, we head off once more to look around the city.*

2322
03:17:31,000 --> 03:17:43,000
*Hiyori and I were only able to show Ena a small part of Tokyo's many attractions, and Ena is enthusiastic in her pursuit to further her knowledge about this city we call home.*

2323
03:17:43,000 --> 03:17:48,000
*I arrange to meet Hiyori outside the train station, like yesterday.*

2324
03:17:48,000 --> 03:17:55,000
*Hiyori is standing there when Ena and I approach, dressed in her favorite pink sweater and winter coat.*

2325
03:17:55,000 --> 03:18:01,000
*Seeing Hiyori again, after what transpired between us, prompts a blush to rise to my cheeks.*

2326
03:18:01,000 --> 03:18:06,000
*It's hard to look her in the eye, after everything that transpired between...*

2327
03:18:06,000 --> 03:18:08,000
Ena: "Greetings, Hiyori!"

2328
03:18:08,000 --> 03:18:11,000
*But Ena, of course, has no such compunctions.*

2329
03:18:11,000 --> 03:18:15,000
Ena: "It is very good to once more make your acquaintance!"

2330
03:18:15,000 --> 03:18:25,000
Hiyori: "You too, Ena. I'm always glad to see you. You're looking as cute as a button today - and you're wearing the outfit I chose for you, I see!"

2331
03:18:25,000 --> 03:18:30,000
Ena: "Oh, yes. It is very lovely. I'm so glad you picked it for me, Hiyori!"

2332
03:18:30,000 --> 03:18:35,000
Ena: "You have quite an eye for fashion. You are very knowledgeable, ehehe."

2333
03:18:35,000 --> 03:18:46,000
Hiyori: "Oh, please, you're flattering me. I don't know all that much about clothes. You'd be adorable, is all, regardless of what you're wearing. Isn't that right, Haru?"

2334
03:18:46,000 --> 03:18:47,000
Haru: "Oh, yeah..."

2335
03:18:47,000 --> 03:18:51,000
*I blink, pulled abruptly from my thoughts about my love life.*

2336
03:18:51,000 --> 03:18:54,000
Haru: "Ena is very pretty, I can admit that much."

2337
03:18:54,000 --> 03:18:55,000
Hiyori: "See?"

2338
03:18:55,000 --> 03:18:57,000
*Hiyori grins triumphantly.*

2339
03:18:57,000 --> 03:19:04,000
Hiyori: "Now, shall we take a look around? There are some nice parks around here you might want to see, Ena."

2340
03:19:04,000 --> 03:19:14,000
Ena: "Oh, yes! I would love to explore more of Tokyo! It is such a large city, and it is so very different from all I know back on my home planet!"

2341
03:19:14,000 --> 03:19:16,000
Ena: "I am very excited!"

2342
03:19:16,000 --> 03:19:20,000
*Ena hurries along after Hiyori, while I tag along at their heels.*

2343
03:19:20,000 --> 03:19:26,000
*They might look chipper, but I'm still eaten up with thoughts about what, exactly, I should do.*

2344
03:19:26,000 --> 03:19:33,000
*I don't want to inadvertently pit Ena and Hiyori against one another in a fight for my affections.*

2345
03:19:33,000 --> 03:19:39,000
*I'd hate it if the kisses I've shared between the both of them sullied their friendship.*

2346
03:19:39,000 --> 03:19:40,000
*What should I do?*

2347
03:19:40,000 --> 03:19:48,000
*Ena knows about my dalliances with Hiyori, but Hiyori doesn't know the full extent of my relationship with Ena.*

2348
03:19:48,000 --> 03:19:56,000
*I should probably tell her, before Ena lets it slip herself. That might result in a rather awkward conversation.*

2349
03:19:56,000 --> 03:20:05,000
*Perhaps it's inevitable I'll end up hurting Hiyori's feelings, but honesty - as my mother always taught me - really is the best policy.*

2350
03:20:05,000 --> 03:20:06,000
Haru: "Hey, Hiyori..."

2351
03:20:06,000 --> 03:20:10,000
*I sidle up to Hiyori, then tug her discreetly to one side.*

2352
03:20:10,000 --> 03:20:22,000
*Ena doesn't seem to notice, being taken with a cute, stray kitty she's seen on the roadside. She's kneeling next to it, murmuring, "Here, kitty, kitty,", while trying to pet it.*

2353
03:20:22,000 --> 03:20:24,000
*I'm glad she's so easily amused.*

2354
03:20:24,000 --> 03:20:30,000
*With Ena's attention diverted, I should be able to speak to Hiyori about... well, everything.*

2355
03:20:30,000 --> 03:20:34,000
Haru: "There's something I want to talk to you about."

2356
03:20:34,000 --> 03:20:35,000
Hiyori: "Oh?"

2357
03:20:35,000 --> 03:20:38,000
*Hiyori glances at me, her head tilted to one side.*

2358
03:20:38,000 --> 03:20:40,000
Hiyori: "What is it, Haru?"

2359
03:20:40,000 --> 03:20:47,000
Haru: "I, uh... I'm sorry if this is a bit awkward, but it's about... you and me. Ena, too. All three of us."

2360
03:20:47,000 --> 03:20:49,000
Hiyori: "O-Oh, I see. Um..."

2361
03:20:49,000 --> 03:20:52,000
Hiyori: "I-Is this a-about that kiss we shared?"

2362
03:20:52,000 --> 03:20:54,000
Haru: "Y-Yes, uh... I guess it is."

2363
03:20:54,000 --> 03:21:01,000
Hiyori: "I see. I thought you might want to talk about that. It did happen rather quickly, after all."

2364
03:21:01,000 --> 03:21:06,000
*Hiyori toys with a lock of her short, choppy hair and, distractedly, she sighs.*

2365
03:21:06,000 --> 03:21:15,000
*It's such a cold day, Hiyori's breath hangs in the air for a few moments after it escapes her lips; faint and gauzy, like a miasma.*

2366
03:21:15,000 --> 03:21:17,000
Hiyori: "I'm sorry about that, Haru."

2367
03:21:17,000 --> 03:21:18,000
Haru: "Huh?"

2368
03:21:18,000 --> 03:21:21,000
*I blink at Hiyori, momentarily blind-sided.*

2369
03:21:21,000 --> 03:21:24,000
Haru: "What are you apologizing for, exactly?"

2370
03:21:24,000 --> 03:21:32,000
Hiyori: "For what happened. I was serious when I confessed to you, but I'm afraid I might have been a bit too pushy."

2371
03:21:32,000 --> 03:21:38,000
Hiyori: "I'd hate to think that I forced myself on you - or that you kissed me out of, well..."

2372
03:21:38,000 --> 03:21:39,000
*Another sigh.*

2373
03:21:39,000 --> 03:21:43,000
Hiyori: "Obligation, I suppose. I'd feel really awful then."

2374
03:21:43,000 --> 03:21:47,000
Hiyori: "You didn't kiss me to spare my feelings, did you?"

2375
03:21:47,000 --> 03:21:51,000
Haru: "N-No, that's not it at all! You've got it all wrong!"

2376
03:21:51,000 --> 03:21:58,000
Haru: "That kiss might've been a surprise, but I didn't hate it. I was happy to know that you liked me so much."

2377
03:21:58,000 --> 03:22:06,000
Haru: "I'm still not entirely sure how this will affect our relationship, but you've got nothing to worry about on that score."

2378
03:22:06,000 --> 03:22:10,000
Haru: "I wouldn't turn on you because you love me, Hiyori."

2379
03:22:10,000 --> 03:22:12,000
Hiyori: "Oh, thank goodness..."

2380
03:22:12,000 --> 03:22:20,000
*Hiyori's face floods with relief. A gentle smile curves her lips upwards, illuminating her countenance so it seems to glow.*

2381
03:22:20,000 --> 03:22:27,000
Hiyori: "I'm very happy to hear that. I really so worried about it, I could hardly sleep last night!"

2382
03:22:27,000 --> 03:22:35,000
Hiyori: "I'd feel awful - truly awful - if I thought my rashness had put a wedge between us, or ruined our relationship."

2383
03:22:35,000 --> 03:22:45,000
Hiyori: "We don't even need to date - not if you don't want to. Simply being with you is enough to make me happy, whether we can kiss and hold hands or not."

2384
03:22:45,000 --> 03:22:50,000
Hiyori: "I'm totally fine with being friend-zoned, so long as you don't hate me!"

2385
03:22:50,000 --> 03:22:53,000
Haru: "I already said, silly, I don't hate you."

2386
03:22:53,000 --> 03:22:58,000
*I ruffle Hiyori's mop of choppy brown hair roughly, which makes her giggle.*

2387
03:22:58,000 --> 03:23:04,000
Haru: "Thanks, though, for that enthusiastic declaration. I'll, uh, keep it in mind."

2388
03:23:04,000 --> 03:23:06,000
Hiyori: "It's no problem, ehehe."

2389
03:23:06,000 --> 03:23:10,000
*Giggling, Hiyori cozies up to me, her arm looped through mine.*

2390
03:23:10,000 --> 03:23:19,000
*This gesture seems a bit too intimate for mere friends, but given Hiyori has always clung a bit too close to me, it doesn't feel unusual.*

2391
03:23:19,000 --> 03:23:25,000
*It would be stranger, in fact, if Hiyori was making a concentrated effort to keep her distance.*

2392
03:23:25,000 --> 03:23:28,000
*I don't want her feeling uncomfortable around me.*

2393
03:23:28,000 --> 03:23:35,000
*That kiss last night - and what proceeded it - doesn't need to altar our relationship irrevocably.*

2394
03:23:35,000 --> 03:23:38,000
*I'd like us to behave as we always did.*

2395
03:23:38,000 --> 03:23:42,000
*Seeing Hiyori smile sets my heart at ease like nothing else...*

2396
03:23:42,000 --> 03:23:45,000
*Except, perhaps, her delicious, hearty cooking.*

2397
03:23:45,000 --> 03:23:46,000
Hiyori: "So..."

2398
03:23:46,000 --> 03:23:50,000
*Hiyori peers at me, her brown eyes wide with intrigue.*

2399
03:23:50,000 --> 03:23:54,000
Hiyori: "Was that not what you wanted to talk to me about?"

2400
03:23:54,000 --> 03:23:59,000
Haru: "No. This topic's only related to our kiss. It's kind of awkward, but..."

2401
03:23:59,000 --> 03:24:05,000
*I look at Ena, who's still kneeling by the roadside, her attention eaten up by the stray kitty.*

2402
03:24:05,000 --> 03:24:15,000
Haru: "I figured I should be completely honest and upfront with you, just like you were when you confessed to me. I don't want to hide anything from you."

2403
03:24:15,000 --> 03:24:19,000
Haru: "I didn't exactly instigate this, but... Well."

2404
03:24:19,000 --> 03:24:23,000
*Ah, geez. I don't think there's a sensitive way to say this.*

2405
03:24:23,000 --> 03:24:28,000
*I guess I'll have to come clean with it, and hope Hiyori isn't too upset.*

2406
03:24:28,000 --> 03:24:32,000
Haru: "This morning, when I was asleep, Ena, she... Uh..."

2407
03:24:32,000 --> 03:24:35,000
Haru: "She decided to wake me up with a kiss."

2408
03:24:35,000 --> 03:24:36,000
Hiyori: "Oh?"

2409
03:24:36,000 --> 03:24:39,000
*Hiyori blinks at me, her lips pursed.*

2410
03:24:39,000 --> 03:24:42,000
Hiyori: "Is that all you wanted to tell me?"

2411
03:24:42,000 --> 03:24:49,000
Haru: "That, and, well, you know how Ena is. She's always calling me "darling", and clinging to me..."

2412
03:24:49,000 --> 03:24:51,000
*I smile at Hiyori faintly.*

2413
03:24:51,000 --> 03:24:54,000
Haru: "A bit like you are now, actually."

2414
03:24:54,000 --> 03:25:01,000
Haru: "We've even done some more intimate things together, similar to what you and I did last night."

2415
03:25:01,000 --> 03:25:08,000
Haru: "Ena instigated that, too. By the time I realized what was happening, it was too late to stop her."

2416
03:25:08,000 --> 03:25:18,000
Haru: "It's not like we're in any kind of committed relationship - I still don't know how I feel about her - but I thought I should tell you about it."

2417
03:25:18,000 --> 03:25:25,000
Haru: "I wouldn't want you to think that I'm seeing Ena behind your back. That would feel pretty scummy."

2418
03:25:25,000 --> 03:25:27,000
Haru: "I'm not a cheater."

2419
03:25:27,000 --> 03:25:28,000
Hiyori: "Ah. I see."

2420
03:25:28,000 --> 03:25:33,000
*Hiyori nods. Her expression is pensive, but only for a few moments.*

2421
03:25:33,000 --> 03:25:37,000
*Our eyes meet, Hiyori's brown on mine. Then, she smiles.*

2422
03:25:37,000 --> 03:25:40,000
Hiyori: "Well, that's fine. I don't mind."

2423
03:25:40,000 --> 03:25:41,000
Haru: "Are you sure?"

2424
03:25:41,000 --> 03:25:42,000
Hiyori: "I'm sure!"

2425
03:25:42,000 --> 03:25:51,000
Hiyori: "I know Ena's crazy about you. She's been clinging to you since she first laid eyes on you. How could you hope to resist her?"

2426
03:25:51,000 --> 03:26:03,000
Hiyori: "I'm not a guy, but even I think Ena's adorable. If she kept flirting with me that unabashedly, I might end up kissing her, too - and all sorts of other things besides!"

2427
03:26:03,000 --> 03:26:04,000
*Hiyori giggles.*

2428
03:26:04,000 --> 03:26:13,000
Hiyori: "You're both adults, and you're living under the same roof. I would've been more surprised if nothing had happened between you."

2429
03:26:13,000 --> 03:26:15,000
Haru: "So, you're not jealous...?"

2430
03:26:15,000 --> 03:26:24,000
Hiyori: "Maybe a little. I mean, I like you a lot too, Haru. I love you, in fact - but so does Ena. My feelings don't invalidate hers."

2431
03:26:24,000 --> 03:26:28,000
Hiyori: "If you're happy together, I'm happy for you."

2432
03:26:28,000 --> 03:26:35,000
Haru: "Well, thanks. I still don't know if I really want to date Ena, though. She's even pushier than you are."

2433
03:26:35,000 --> 03:26:41,000
Haru: "I don't mind going along with it, I suppose, but do I actually love her? I can't tell."

2434
03:26:41,000 --> 03:26:42,000
Hiyori: "Oh, you."

2435
03:26:42,000 --> 03:26:45,000
*Hiyori nudges me in the side with her elbow.*

2436
03:26:45,000 --> 03:26:50,000
Hiyori: "You're so indecisive. Is it really that hard to choose between us?"

2437
03:26:50,000 --> 03:27:01,000
Haru: "It is, actually. I've never been in a situation like this before. This might come as a surprise to you, but I wasn't exactly a babe magnet in high school."

2438
03:27:01,000 --> 03:27:08,000
Haru: "I feel like I've got to take this carefully, or I could end up hurting you, and I don't want that."

2439
03:27:08,000 --> 03:27:13,000
Haru: "You and Ena are both important to me. I need to consider this carefully."

2440
03:27:13,000 --> 03:27:15,000
Hiyori: "How methodical!"

2441
03:27:15,000 --> 03:27:20,000
Haru: "Yeah, well, I am a physics student. It comes with the territory."

2442
03:27:20,000 --> 03:27:21,000
Hiyori: "I guess."

2443
03:27:21,000 --> 03:27:23,000
Hiyori: "You're so serious, Haru..."

2444
03:27:23,000 --> 03:27:27,000
Hiyori: "But that's one of the things I like about you."

2445
03:27:27,000 --> 03:27:33,000
*Hiyori nuzzles her cheek against my shoulder, her misty breath escaping her pursed lips.*

2446
03:27:33,000 --> 03:27:40,000
Hiyori: "You have a lot of integrity. You're not the sort of guy who'd take advantage of the situation."

2447
03:27:40,000 --> 03:27:42,000
Hiyori: "You're pretty special."

2448
03:27:42,000 --> 03:27:48,000
Hiyori: "You don't have to return my feelings... but I know I was right to fall for you."

2449
03:27:48,000 --> 03:27:50,000
Hiyori: "I really do love you."

2450
03:27:50,000 --> 03:27:51,000
Haru: "O-Oh..."

2451
03:27:51,000 --> 03:27:54,000
*Now, that confession was unexpected.*

2452
03:27:54,000 --> 03:27:56,000
*How does it make me feel?*

2453
03:27:56,000 --> 03:28:04,000
*How did an ordinary guy like me end up with two sweet, kind women gunning after me, desperate for my affection?*

2454
03:28:04,000 --> 03:28:13,000
*It doesn't really make any sense - not that I'm complaining. Koichi would be well within his rights to be pissed, if he knew about this.*

2455
03:28:13,000 --> 03:28:17,000
*Now, I need a bit of time to think about my next move.*

2456
03:28:17,000 --> 03:28:18,000
*The next day...*

2457
03:28:18,000 --> 03:28:23,000
Haru: "Alright, Ena, I'm going to university. Will you be alright staying here?"

2458
03:28:23,000 --> 03:28:25,000
Ena: "Inside your apartment?"

2459
03:28:25,000 --> 03:28:29,000
*Ena glances about, her hands linked behind her back.*

2460
03:28:29,000 --> 03:28:37,000
Ena: "I suppose that would not be too awful. You have many interesting books to read, upon all manner of subjects..."

2461
03:28:37,000 --> 03:28:42,000
*Now, I wonder what "interesting books" she could be talking about, exactly.*

2462
03:28:42,000 --> 03:28:47,000
*This isn't about the lewd magazines stuffed inside my closet, is it?*

2463
03:28:47,000 --> 03:28:57,000
*I don't even break out those magazines all that often. I'm nowhere near as invested in, uh, "that" sort of thing, as Kosuke and the others are.*

2464
03:28:57,000 --> 03:29:02,000
*I swear, those magazines have caused me no end of trouble since Ena moved in.*

2465
03:29:02,000 --> 03:29:06,000
*Maybe I should throw them out for good. We could have a bonfire!*

2466
03:29:06,000 --> 03:29:12,000
Ena: "...but I fear sitting in your room, alone, for many hours, may grow wearisome."

2467
03:29:12,000 --> 03:29:20,000
Ena: "I do not wish to cause any problems for you, Haru, but I am awfully interested in this "university" of which you speak."

2468
03:29:20,000 --> 03:29:26,000
Ena: "I would love to see it with my own two eyes! I imagine it must be a wonderful building!"

2469
03:29:26,000 --> 03:29:32,000
Haru: "The university I go to isn't that special, really. It's hardly the most prestigious."

2470
03:29:32,000 --> 03:29:37,000
Haru: "I guess it's been around for around a century, but it's no Tokyo U."

2471
03:29:37,000 --> 03:29:38,000
Ena: "A century?"

2472
03:29:38,000 --> 03:29:41,000
*Ena stares at me, her amber eyes wide.*

2473
03:29:41,000 --> 03:29:43,000
Ena: "And it's still standing?!"

2474
03:29:43,000 --> 03:29:51,000
Haru: "I guess. There isn't much of the original building left, though. It's been renovated a whole lot over the years."

2475
03:29:51,000 --> 03:30:03,000
Haru: "The astronomy clubroom's in the oldest wing of the campus, which is all wooden. The floor creaks, and the windows rattle in the winter. It's a bit of a health hazard."

2476
03:30:03,000 --> 03:30:06,000
Haru: "I bet it'll get torn down before long."

2477
03:30:06,000 --> 03:30:13,000
Ena: "Goodness me! The more you speak of this so-called "university", the more intriguing it sounds!"

2478
03:30:13,000 --> 03:30:18,000
Ena: "You and Hiyori spend a good deal of time there, is that correct?"

2479
03:30:18,000 --> 03:30:27,000
Haru: "Yeah, that's true. We're both students, and we take our studies seriously. We have to go in for lectures and seminars every weekday."

2480
03:30:27,000 --> 03:30:32,000
Haru: "Hiyori's studying history, so she doesn't have as many hours as I do."

2481
03:30:32,000 --> 03:30:38,000
Haru: "It's not uncommon for my lectures to finish at about seven in the evening..."

2482
03:30:38,000 --> 03:30:42,000
Ena: "Seven? My goodness! And you set off at seven in the morning?"

2483
03:30:42,000 --> 03:30:45,000
Haru: "I kind of have to, so I'm not late."

2484
03:30:45,000 --> 03:30:50,000
Ena: "That sounds like a very long day indeed! You do work hard, darling!"

2485
03:30:50,000 --> 03:30:55,000
Haru: "I don't work harder than any of the other students on my course..."

2486
03:30:55,000 --> 03:31:04,000
Haru: "And I knew what I was signing up for before I applied to study physics. The science courses are always pretty demanding."

2487
03:31:04,000 --> 03:31:08,000
Ena: "And yet, you endure these demands without complaint!"

2488
03:31:08,000 --> 03:31:15,000
Ena: "You are rather different to I. I could not bear the burdens inflicted upon me by my parents."

2489
03:31:15,000 --> 03:31:20,000
Ena: "I had no desire to learn how to be Corval's monarch, upon their abdication!"

2490
03:31:20,000 --> 03:31:23,000
Haru: "Did you have a lot of lessons, too?"

2491
03:31:23,000 --> 03:31:30,000
Ena: "Yes, indeed. I had to study etiquette for many, many hours - and politics, too. It was all very tedious!"

2492
03:31:30,000 --> 03:31:43,000
Ena: "I had so many facts and dates and important figures to recall, and I've never had the best memory. I only care to remember things I am interested in, such as facts about human culture."

2493
03:31:43,000 --> 03:31:47,000
Ena: "It did not help that my tutors were all so dull, either."

2494
03:31:47,000 --> 03:31:49,000
Ena: "I could not stomach it!"

2495
03:31:49,000 --> 03:31:55,000
Haru: "It sounds like you had a pretty intense learning schedule all of your own, then."

2496
03:31:55,000 --> 03:31:57,000
*I smile at Ena sympathetically.*

2497
03:31:57,000 --> 03:32:08,000
Haru: "Our situations are a bit different, though. You were forced to learn all this stuff by your family. I, on the other hand, am going to university of my own volition."

2498
03:32:08,000 --> 03:32:15,000
Haru: "It's always more fun to study, I think, when you're passionate about the topic you're learning about."

2499
03:32:15,000 --> 03:32:17,000
Haru: "Otherwise, it's a huge slog."

2500
03:32:17,000 --> 03:32:22,000
Haru: "I wasn't a big fan of composition back in high school myself - or sports."

2501
03:32:22,000 --> 03:32:23,000
*I pull a face.*

2502
03:32:23,000 --> 03:32:25,000
Haru: "I can't stand running."

2503
03:32:25,000 --> 03:32:32,000
Ena: "Be that as it may, I must salute you for devoting so much time to academics. It is most commendable."

2504
03:32:32,000 --> 03:32:35,000
Ena: "I doubt I would be able to do the same..."

2505
03:32:35,000 --> 03:32:41,000
Ena: "But I really would like to see this university of yours, with my own two eyes!"

2506
03:32:41,000 --> 03:32:52,000
Ena: "It might help me learn more about you earthlings and your cultures - and, even if it does not, it should prove to be more interesting than remaining here!"

2507
03:32:52,000 --> 03:32:57,000
Ena: "You do not wish me to thumb through all your funny books, do you?"

2508
03:32:57,000 --> 03:32:58,000
Haru: "Urgh..."

2509
03:32:58,000 --> 03:33:02,000
*The mention of my "funny books" makes my face redden.*

2510
03:33:02,000 --> 03:33:07,000
*I wish Ena would drop the subject already. It's not worth discussing.*

2511
03:33:07,000 --> 03:33:10,000
Haru: "That's... a good point, I guess..."

2512
03:33:10,000 --> 03:33:16,000
Ena: "Can I accompany you to your university, then? Please, darling? Please, please, please?!"

2513
03:33:16,000 --> 03:33:19,000
Ena: "I just wish to be more involved in your life!"

2514
03:33:19,000 --> 03:33:26,000
*That's what Ena says, but I'm not buying it. I think she just wants a chance to stretch her legs.*

2515
03:33:26,000 --> 03:33:29,000
*She can't stand being cooped up indoors.*

2516
03:33:29,000 --> 03:33:32,000
*In that sense, she's quite like a puppy.*

2517
03:33:32,000 --> 03:33:34,000
Ena: "Please, please, please?!"

2518
03:33:34,000 --> 03:33:39,000
*Ena's wheedling - no, make that outright demanding - is a bit wearisome, but...*

2519
03:33:39,000 --> 03:33:40,000
Haru: "Oh, very well."

2520
03:33:40,000 --> 03:33:42,000
*I eventually capitulate.*

2521
03:33:42,000 --> 03:33:44,000
*What harm can it do, really?*

2522
03:33:44,000 --> 03:33:59,000
*If Ena wants to look around the campus, I can hardly stop her. She mightn't be a student, but people meander about the campus all the time - some, prospective students, others come simply to walk their dogs or take in the air.*

2523
03:33:59,000 --> 03:34:06,000
*The campus is quite pretty, even during the winter. I can't begrudge Ena for wanting to come with me.*

2524
03:34:06,000 --> 03:34:07,000
Ena: "Yay!"

2525
03:34:07,000 --> 03:34:13,000
*Ena beams, cheered by my agreement, then dashes over and loops her arm with mine.*

2526
03:34:13,000 --> 03:34:18,000
Ena: "Thank you, darling! You are the best partner I could ever ask for!"

2527
03:34:18,000 --> 03:34:22,000
Haru: "I don't think I'm all that great, really... but thanks."

2528
03:34:22,000 --> 03:34:24,000
*I smile, then pat Ena on the head.*

2529
03:34:24,000 --> 03:34:30,000
Haru: "Shall we go? We still need to meet up with Hiyori. I don't want us to be late."

2530
03:34:30,000 --> 03:34:31,000
Ena: "Yes, indeed!"

2531
03:34:31,000 --> 03:34:40,000
Ena: "Seeing Hiyori again is sure to be a lot of fun! I love spending time together, the three of us! It is so nice to have friends, hehe."

2532
03:34:40,000 --> 03:34:43,000
Ena: "I am a very fortunate woman indeed!"

2533
03:34:43,000 --> 03:34:49,000
*I wind up walking to university with Ena, the pair of us talking companionably all the while.*

2534
03:34:49,000 --> 03:34:57,000
*At some point during my trek, we meet up with Hiyori. She seems pleased to see Ena, and she asks where Ena's going.*

2535
03:34:57,000 --> 03:35:03,000
*I tell Hiyori that Ena's coming to university with me today: a plan Hiyori seems to support.*

2536
03:35:03,000 --> 03:35:10,000
Hiyori: "Oh, that sounds fun! I think Ena will enjoy that much more than being cooped up inside your room!"

2537
03:35:10,000 --> 03:35:14,000
Hiyori: "There's quite a bit to see on the campus, although..."

2538
03:35:14,000 --> 03:35:15,000
*Hiyori frowns.*

2539
03:35:15,000 --> 03:35:23,000
Hiyori: "Will Ena be attending your lectures? She might draw attention to yourself. She isn't on your course, after all."

2540
03:35:23,000 --> 03:35:29,000
*I had considered this, naturally, and I tell Hiyori about my cunning plan in turn.*

2541
03:35:29,000 --> 03:35:38,000
*Rather than have Ena tag along during my lectures, I mean to have her wait in the university's library until I'm done for the day.*

2542
03:35:38,000 --> 03:35:50,000
*While I'm sure following me about campus would, at first, enthrall Ena, listening to my professors talk about condensed matter would (in all likelihood) bore her to tears.*

2543
03:35:50,000 --> 03:36:00,000
*I find my lectures interesting, but then again, I would. I signed up to this course of my own volition, and I've always been a huge space nerd.*

2544
03:36:00,000 --> 03:36:07,000
*Ena might be from space, quite literally, but she doesn't seem to share my zeal for atoms and particles.*

2545
03:36:07,000 --> 03:36:15,000
*In the library, at least, Ena should be able to pick and choose what she wants to read, depending on what catches her eye.*

2546
03:36:15,000 --> 03:36:16,000
Hiyori: "Ooh, I see."

2547
03:36:16,000 --> 03:36:21,000
*Hiyori nods when I tell her about my plan, one hand under her chin.*

2548
03:36:21,000 --> 03:36:25,000
Hiyori: "That sounds like a good idea! I hope you have fun, Ena!"

2549
03:36:25,000 --> 03:36:32,000
Ena: "I am positive that I will. I am looking forward to stepping foot in your hallowed halls of learning."

2550
03:36:32,000 --> 03:36:39,000
Ena: "I, too, wish to educate myself, so that I may become more familiar with you earthlings and your customs!"

2551
03:36:39,000 --> 03:36:42,000
Ena: "Then, I shall be even closer to my darling!"

2552
03:36:42,000 --> 03:36:46,000
Ena: "Our wedding is imminent. I can hear the bells already!"

2553
03:36:46,000 --> 03:36:49,000
Haru: "Are you sure you're not getting tinnitus?"

2554
03:36:49,000 --> 03:36:56,000
Ena: "I do not think so. I am quite certain there are no issues with my auditory processing abilities."

2555
03:36:56,000 --> 03:37:06,000
Haru: "There may be something wrong with your memory, then. Haven't you forgotten, I told you not to cling to me so much when we're in public?"

2556
03:37:06,000 --> 03:37:07,000
Ena: "But darling-"

2557
03:37:07,000 --> 03:37:11,000
Haru: "A-And you probably shouldn't call me that, either."

2558
03:37:11,000 --> 03:37:13,000
*I shrug Ena off, who pouts.*

2559
03:37:13,000 --> 03:37:16,000
Ena: "Boo! You are not being very much fun!"

2560
03:37:16,000 --> 03:37:22,000
Haru: "Hey! I let you come with me to university. The least you could do is respect my wishes!"

2561
03:37:22,000 --> 03:37:28,000
*As much as I like Ena, she isn't my girlfriend, and she's definitely not my wife.*

2562
03:37:28,000 --> 03:37:35,000
*I don't want to condone her fawning over me until I've decided whether I can reciprocate her feelings or not.*

2563
03:37:35,000 --> 03:37:40,000
*Call me old-fashioned, but I think it's important to do these things properly.*

2564
03:37:40,000 --> 03:37:41,000
Hiyori: "Oh, you two."

2565
03:37:41,000 --> 03:37:45,000
*Hiyori watches Ena and I, an amused smile playing about her lips.*

2566
03:37:45,000 --> 03:37:51,000
Hiyori: "For all your protests, Haru, you're acting just like a married couple already!"

2567
03:37:51,000 --> 03:37:52,000
Ena: "We are?!"

2568
03:37:52,000 --> 03:37:59,000
Haru: "She means, it's because we're arguing. Parents often seem to do that - mostly about petty things..."

2569
03:37:59,000 --> 03:38:01,000
*I sigh, while Hiyori smiles.*

2570
03:38:01,000 --> 03:38:11,000
Hiyori: "So, if Ena will be hanging around campus today, do you want to meet up later in the astronomy clubroom? Maybe we can go stargazing together!"

2571
03:38:11,000 --> 03:38:13,000
Ena: "Ooh, I would love that!"

2572
03:38:13,000 --> 03:38:20,000
Ena: "You can be assured that I will participate in your club activities. It sounds like a good deal of fun!"

2573
03:38:20,000 --> 03:38:23,000
Hiyori: "I'm glad! I'll see you two later, then!"

2574
03:38:23,000 --> 03:38:32,000
*The three of us reach the campus, and Hiyori heads off for her first lecture of the day. I, meanwhile, escort Ena to the library.*

2575
03:38:32,000 --> 03:38:41,000
*I'm a bit worried she might take issue with my plan after all, and demand to stay with me throughout the day, but to my relief...*

2576
03:38:41,000 --> 03:38:42,000
Ena: "Ooh!"

2577
03:38:42,000 --> 03:38:47,000
*Ena starts glancing about the library like a kid in a candy store.*

2578
03:38:47,000 --> 03:38:52,000
Ena: "Is this the "library" you spoke of in such glowing terms, darling?"

2579
03:38:52,000 --> 03:39:01,000
Haru: "That's right. There's all sorts of books here, as you can see, so you should be able to find something to keep your attention."

2580
03:39:01,000 --> 03:39:03,000
Ena: "Oh, yes, I expect so!"

2581
03:39:03,000 --> 03:39:12,000
Ena: "There are so many books here, it would take a lifetime to read through them all. There is plenty of material here to occupy my mind."

2582
03:39:12,000 --> 03:39:14,000
Haru: "You sure you won't get bored?"

2583
03:39:14,000 --> 03:39:21,000
Ena: "I do not think so. I love learning, as I have told you already: particularly about you humans."

2584
03:39:21,000 --> 03:39:27,000
Ena: "You may rest assured, darling, that I shall find my time here most enjoyable."

2585
03:39:27,000 --> 03:39:29,000
Haru: "Good. I'm glad to hear that."

2586
03:39:29,000 --> 03:39:39,000
Haru: "Now, as this is a university library, a lot of the people here will be studying, or writing essays. Don't make too much noise, alright?"

2587
03:39:39,000 --> 03:39:45,000
Haru: "If you distract them, you might get kicked out. The librarian here is a bit, uh..."

2588
03:39:45,000 --> 03:39:52,000
*I glance over to the desk in the corner, where the stern-faced librarian sits, tapping away at her PC.*

2589
03:39:52,000 --> 03:39:57,000
Haru: "Well, she's kind of scary. You'd do well not to get on her bad side."

2590
03:39:57,000 --> 03:39:58,000
Ena: "Understood."

2591
03:39:58,000 --> 03:39:59,000
*Ena salutes me.*

2592
03:39:59,000 --> 03:40:07,000
Ena: "I shall be on my best behavior. Worry not, darling. As your wife-to-be, I will do nothing to disgrace your good name."

2593
03:40:07,000 --> 03:40:13,000
Ena: "I promise I can blend in with you humans. I shall do nothing to betray your trust."

2594
03:40:13,000 --> 03:40:15,000
Haru: "Great. I'm glad to hear it."

2595
03:40:15,000 --> 03:40:21,000
*Though, I do take issue with that "wife-to-be" statement. Isn't that a touch presumptuous?*

2596
03:40:21,000 --> 03:40:23,000
*Oh well. I guess Ena will be Ena.*

2597
03:40:23,000 --> 03:40:31,000
*If my warnings haven't stopped her over-familiarity during the last few days, I can't imagine they'll be of much use now.*

2598
03:40:31,000 --> 03:40:32,000
Haru: "Right..."

2599
03:40:32,000 --> 03:40:38,000
*I glance at my cell phone. The time's wearing on, and my first lecture of the day is coming up.*

2600
03:40:38,000 --> 03:40:43,000
Haru: "I've got to go. I don't want to miss Professor Shima's talk."

2601
03:40:43,000 --> 03:40:47,000
Haru: "I'll check up on you later when I'm done, alright?"

2602
03:40:47,000 --> 03:40:54,000
Haru: "If you get hungry, you can go to the canteen. It's in the next building over. Here's some change."

2603
03:40:54,000 --> 03:40:57,000
*I hand Ena some money, which she pockets.*

2604
03:40:57,000 --> 03:40:59,000
Haru: "See you later, Ena."

2605
03:40:59,000 --> 03:41:03,000
Ena: "I shall see you too, darling. Have a good day!"

2606
03:41:03,000 --> 03:41:05,000
Haru: "Yeah, uh... I will."

2607
03:41:05,000 --> 03:41:09,000
*Ena's earnest well wishes leave me feeling discombobulated.*

2608
03:41:09,000 --> 03:41:18,000
*I've always shrugged aside Ena's manifold attempts to play at being my partner, but  that "have a good day" was awfully convincing.*

2609
03:41:18,000 --> 03:41:22,000
*For a moment there, she sounded just like a genuine housewife.*

2610
03:41:22,000 --> 03:41:23,000
*...Geez.*

2611
03:41:23,000 --> 03:41:31,000
*I turn on my heels and march out of the library quickly, before Ena can see the blush that's beginning to permeate my cheeks.*

2612
03:41:31,000 --> 03:41:34,000
*She's too adorable for her own good.*

2613
03:41:34,000 --> 03:41:39,000
*If she keeps being this considerate, I really might end up falling for her.*

2614
03:41:39,000 --> 03:41:44,000
*Several hours pass, which I spend in various lectures and seminars.*

2615
03:41:44,000 --> 03:41:52,000
*Eventually, my last lecture of the day wraps up, and I head off to the library to reconvene with my alien wannabe wife.*

2616
03:41:52,000 --> 03:42:00,000
*I'm a bit worried she might have grown bored, despite her earlier enthusiasm, after being stuck in the library for so long...*

2617
03:42:00,000 --> 03:42:03,000
*But, as I soon discover, I needn't have worried.*

2618
03:42:03,000 --> 03:42:10,000
*Ena is sitting at the same desk in the library where I left her this morning, a book clutched in her hands.*

2619
03:42:10,000 --> 03:42:14,000
*She stares at the book, wide-eyed, a bright smile on her face.*

2620
03:42:14,000 --> 03:42:19,000
*I'm not sure what she's reading, exactly, but she looks awfully invested in it.*

2621
03:42:19,000 --> 03:42:23,000
*She's so ensconced, she hasn't even seen me approach.*

2622
03:42:23,000 --> 03:42:35,000
*I'd feel a bit bad about interrupting her, but Ena did say she wanted to check out the astronomy clubroom. Hiyori will probably be there already, and I don't want to keep her waiting.*

2623
03:42:35,000 --> 03:42:36,000
Haru: "Hey, Ena."

2624
03:42:36,000 --> 03:42:39,000
*I clear my throat, then announce my presence.*

2625
03:42:39,000 --> 03:42:40,000
Ena: "Oh, darling!"

2626
03:42:40,000 --> 03:42:43,000
*Ena peers at me from over the top of her book.*

2627
03:42:43,000 --> 03:42:48,000
Ena: "Have you finished with your educational obligations for the day?"

2628
03:42:48,000 --> 03:42:53,000
Haru: "That's a convoluted way of phrasing it... but, yeah, I have. I'm free now."

2629
03:42:53,000 --> 03:42:55,000
Haru: "Were you alright on your own?"

2630
03:42:55,000 --> 03:43:03,000
Ena: "Oh, yes, I was just fine! This library is a true treasure trove, full of all manner of instructional manuals!"

2631
03:43:03,000 --> 03:43:12,000
Ena: "I have been perusing these shelves since you departed, and have learned any number of intriguing facts about your rich culture!"

2632
03:43:12,000 --> 03:43:13,000
Haru: "Oh, yeah?"

2633
03:43:13,000 --> 03:43:23,000
*I should be on my way to the astronomy clubroom right now, with Ena in tow, but her enthusiasm has me intrigued. I think it must be catching.*

2634
03:43:23,000 --> 03:43:27,000
*I pull up a chair beside her, take a seat, then say...*

2635
03:43:27,000 --> 03:43:31,000
Haru: "So, what have you been reading? History books?"

2636
03:43:31,000 --> 03:43:32,000
Ena: "Not quite."

2637
03:43:32,000 --> 03:43:38,000
Haru: "Then, have you been learning about Earth's geography? Rain forests and famous rivers?"

2638
03:43:38,000 --> 03:43:41,000
Ena: "That also sounds very illuminating, but..."

2639
03:43:41,000 --> 03:43:45,000
*Ena smiles coyly, then hands me the book she was poring over.*

2640
03:43:45,000 --> 03:43:50,000
Ena: "That is not quite the subject which took so much of my attention."

2641
03:43:50,000 --> 03:43:52,000
Haru: "Yeah? What did, then?"

2642
03:43:52,000 --> 03:43:54,000
*I peer at the book Ena's holding.*

2643
03:43:54,000 --> 03:43:56,000
Haru: "Can I take a look?"

2644
03:43:56,000 --> 03:43:57,000
Ena: "Be my guest!"

2645
03:43:57,000 --> 03:44:03,000
*Ena hands the book over to me. I scan through it, expecting... what, I'm not exactly sure.*

2646
03:44:03,000 --> 03:44:10,000
*I'm not sure what an alien like Ena would care to research, while surrounded by a repository of knowledge.*

2647
03:44:10,000 --> 03:44:22,000
*There's any number of things she could be poring over, from photo albums full of beautiful scenery to information about, oh, I don't know, the emergence of synthwave music in the 80s...*

2648
03:44:22,000 --> 03:44:23,000
Haru: "...?"

2649
03:44:23,000 --> 03:44:30,000
*But the book Ena was reading seems to be quite a different beast altogether from my milquetoast suppositions.*

2650
03:44:30,000 --> 03:44:38,000
*The book is devoid of images, but it doesn't need them. The small, dense characters pack enough of a punch without them.*

2651
03:44:38,000 --> 03:44:44,000
*Words leap out at me, one after another: words like "petals", "honey", "musk", and "fluid".*

2652
03:44:44,000 --> 03:44:51,000
*These words paint quite the evocative series of scenes, despite foregoing  more direct terminology.*

2653
03:44:51,000 --> 03:44:58,000
*Moans and sighs crisscross the pages, sultrier than something you'd expect to hear at a soapland...*

2654
03:44:58,000 --> 03:45:03,000
*Not that I've ever been inside one of those establishments, of course.*

2655
03:45:03,000 --> 03:45:13,000
*I can't deny, I've had a passing interest (I'm a healthy young man, after all!), but Tokyo's decadent nightlife is a little too rich for my blood.*

2656
03:45:13,000 --> 03:45:16,000
*I'd rather not take part in any of that.*

2657
03:45:16,000 --> 03:45:23,000
*I'm more interested in the furthest reaches of space than, well, the furthest recesses of women's bodies.*

2658
03:45:23,000 --> 03:45:32,000
*I thought Ena, being an alien, would be similarly fascinated by the cosmos, but her interests seem to be of a decidedly more earthly caste.*

2659
03:45:32,000 --> 03:45:45,000
*A particularly descriptive passage leaps out from me from the pages of this innocuous-looking book - something about "Momoko's petals, bedecked in dew, began to quiver" - which makes me blush.*

2660
03:45:45,000 --> 03:45:53,000
*It's especially awkward when I consider that Seiji, my big cousin, was pretty good friends with a girl called Momoko.*

2661
03:45:53,000 --> 03:45:59,000
*The "Momoko" in this book sounds just like Seiji's friend, to such a degree it's eerie.*

2662
03:45:59,000 --> 03:46:02,000
*Abashed, I slam the book shut, then glower at Ena.*

2663
03:46:02,000 --> 03:46:03,000
Haru: "E-Ena..."

2664
03:46:03,000 --> 03:46:04,000
Ena: "Yes?"

2665
03:46:04,000 --> 03:46:06,000
*Ena looks at me askance.*

2666
03:46:06,000 --> 03:46:12,000
Ena: "What is it, darling? Is something the matter? That book did not displease you, did it?"

2667
03:46:12,000 --> 03:46:24,000
Haru: "I-It didn't displease me, exactly, b-but it did surprise me. I didn't think you'd be reading stuff like that. Heck, I didn't think the library would have stuff like that!"

2668
03:46:24,000 --> 03:46:25,000
Ena: "Like what?"

2669
03:46:25,000 --> 03:46:28,000
Haru: "You know what I mean! This is smut!!!"

2670
03:46:28,000 --> 03:46:38,000
*By now, by impassioned cries have attracted a few curious eyes. My fellow students, who're busy trying to study, lift their heads to glower at me.*

2671
03:46:38,000 --> 03:46:49,000
*Maybe I should've been more circumspect there - but geez! I wasn't the one sitting in the library, reading a tawdry bodice ripper with nary a care in the world!*

2672
03:46:49,000 --> 03:46:51,000
*Doesn't Ena have any shame?!*

2673
03:46:51,000 --> 03:46:52,000
Ena: "Is this smut?"

2674
03:46:52,000 --> 03:46:56,000
*Ena frowns, while resting one finger against her lower lip.*

2675
03:46:56,000 --> 03:46:59,000
Ena: "I thought it was a romance story."

2676
03:46:59,000 --> 03:47:03,000
Haru: "It's a romance story with smut. In fact, it's mostly smut!"

2677
03:47:03,000 --> 03:47:14,000
Ena: "Oh, yes. I suppose you have a point. The characters do take their clothes off quite a lot - often at the smallest of provocations - but I thought it was romantic!"

2678
03:47:14,000 --> 03:47:17,000
Ena: "Is that not what loving couples do?"

2679
03:47:17,000 --> 03:47:20,000
Haru: "Not as much as these characters, no!"

2680
03:47:20,000 --> 03:47:25,000
Ena: "Oh dear. I thought I could, perhaps, use these books as research material."

2681
03:47:25,000 --> 03:47:28,000
Haru: "What were you hoping to research, exactly?"

2682
03:47:28,000 --> 03:47:32,000
Ena: "How to make you fall in love with me, of course!"

2683
03:47:32,000 --> 03:47:40,000
Ena: "I had hoped this book would shed some light on the complex maze of human relationships, which I find hard to navigate..."

2684
03:47:40,000 --> 03:47:43,000
Ena: "But you say that it is unrealistic?"

2685
03:47:43,000 --> 03:47:52,000
Haru: "This book mightn't include any elves or fairies, but it's even more fantastical than any heroic quest set in another world."

2686
03:47:52,000 --> 03:47:53,000
Ena: "I see..."

2687
03:47:53,000 --> 03:48:01,000
*Ena's expression falls, but only for a few moments. It takes less than a second for her cheery demeanor to return.*

2688
03:48:01,000 --> 03:48:08,000
Ena: "Well, never mind! I enjoyed reading this story regardless! It was a good way to pass the time."

2689
03:48:08,000 --> 03:48:11,000
Ena: "Some of its contents were rather amusing!"

2690
03:48:11,000 --> 03:48:18,000
Ena: "Would you like to take my soft globes in hand, darling, and worship at my altar with your turgid-"

2691
03:48:18,000 --> 03:48:19,000
Haru: "Ena!!!!"

2692
03:48:19,000 --> 03:48:26,000
*I reach out, then clap a hand across Ena's mouth, before she can spew even more embarrassing sentiments.*

2693
03:48:26,000 --> 03:48:29,000
Haru: "Cut that out! There's a time and a place!!!"

2694
03:48:29,000 --> 03:48:31,000
???: "Yes, indeed, there is."

2695
03:48:31,000 --> 03:48:32,000
Haru: "Ah..."

2696
03:48:32,000 --> 03:48:33,000
*My body tenses.*

2697
03:48:33,000 --> 03:48:41,000
*I can sense an imposing, indomitable presence looming behind my shoulder, even more ominous than an earthquake warning.*

2698
03:48:41,000 --> 03:48:46,000
*Slowly, I turn my head, to be confronted by the no-nonsense librarian.*

2699
03:48:46,000 --> 03:48:53,000
*She glowers at me behind the lenses of her glasses, both hands planted on her hips, and says coldly...*

2700
03:48:53,000 --> 03:49:00,000
Librarian: "Please remember that this is a university library. You are not in preschool any more."

2701
03:49:00,000 --> 03:49:10,000
Librarian: "If you cannot behave as adults should, I will have to ask you both to leave. You are disturbing the students who genuinely wish to learn."

2702
03:49:10,000 --> 03:49:12,000
Librarian: "Now, get. Out."

2703
03:49:12,000 --> 03:49:18,000
*The librarian's frigid tones offer no room for argument. I can only cower, my face flushed.*

2704
03:49:18,000 --> 03:49:20,000
Haru: "Yes, ma'am. Sorry, ma'am."

2705
03:49:20,000 --> 03:49:29,000
*I murmur apologies while getting to my feet. I take Ena's hand in my own and drag her bodily from the library, smoldering from the shame.*

2706
03:49:29,000 --> 03:49:38,000
*I want to get out of here as soon as possible; away from the ill-tempered librarian and the scathing gaze of my fellow students.*

2707
03:49:38,000 --> 03:49:41,000
*How much of that did they hear, anyway?*

2708
03:49:41,000 --> 03:49:47,000
*I hope they weren't privy to Ena's dramatic reading. Now, that really would be embarrassing.*

2709
03:49:47,000 --> 03:49:54,000
*The way things are, I'm starting to worry if I'll ever be able to go back to this library again.*

2710
03:49:54,000 --> 03:50:02,000
*Ena, for her part, seems blissfully unaware of how awkward things are. She's actually humming to herself, all smiles.*

2711
03:50:02,000 --> 03:50:05,000
*I wish I could be as carefree as she is.*

2712
03:50:05,000 --> 03:50:09,000
Hiyori: "Hey, Haru! Hey, Ena! It's good to see you again..."

2713
03:50:09,000 --> 03:50:10,000
Hiyori: "Um...?"

2714
03:50:10,000 --> 03:50:16,000
*Hiyori's greeting, once so cheery, fades to confusion, upon taking in my flushed face.*

2715
03:50:16,000 --> 03:50:18,000
Hiyori: "Hey, Haru, are you alright?"

2716
03:50:18,000 --> 03:50:23,000
Haru: "Oh, yes. I'm fine. I just got into a bit of an altercation in the library."

2717
03:50:23,000 --> 03:50:25,000
Hiyori: "An altercation?"

2718
03:50:25,000 --> 03:50:37,000
Haru: "Yeah. Ena was reading a book which wasn't entirely appropriate for public consumption, so I gave her a lecture. I got a bit too heated, and the librarian overheard me."

2719
03:50:37,000 --> 03:50:41,000
Haru: "We were more or less ousted from the library in disgrace."

2720
03:50:41,000 --> 03:50:44,000
Hiyori: "Oh my! That sounds very dramatic!"

2721
03:50:44,000 --> 03:50:54,000
Hiyori: "And what was this inappropriate book, if I might ask? Surely it couldn't have been that bad, if it was available in the university's library!"

2722
03:50:54,000 --> 03:50:55,000
*I groan.*

2723
03:50:55,000 --> 03:50:57,000
Haru: "Oh, you don't want to know."

2724
03:50:57,000 --> 03:51:03,000
Haru: "The look the librarian gave me was glacial. I feel like I've aged about ten years..."

2725
03:51:03,000 --> 03:51:09,000
*That librarian would put Medusa to shame. Her expression was downright blood-chilling.*

2726
03:51:09,000 --> 03:51:19,000
*I know I'm being silly, but my body has been feeling pretty stiff since my brief stint in the library - and no, I don't mean that in an enticing way.*

2727
03:51:19,000 --> 03:51:21,000
*I hope I'm not turning into stone.*

2728
03:51:21,000 --> 03:51:22,000
Haru: "So..."

2729
03:51:22,000 --> 03:51:33,000
*I make a brave attempt at forcing the topic back on track, away from Ena's burgeoning tastes in literary erotica to the finer things in life: namely, space.*

2730
03:51:33,000 --> 03:51:40,000
Haru: "What's the forecast looking like for tonight? Will the skies be clear enough for a bout of stargazing?"

2731
03:51:40,000 --> 03:51:42,000
Hiyori: "That's a good question!"

2732
03:51:42,000 --> 03:51:43,000
*Hiyori beams.*

2733
03:51:43,000 --> 03:51:52,000
Hiyori: "The skies look rather clear. I think we should have a nice, unimpeded view of the stars, if things remain as they are."

2734
03:51:52,000 --> 03:51:58,000
Hiyori: "The sun should set in about an hour, so we've got a bit of time to spare until then."

2735
03:51:58,000 --> 03:52:04,000
Hiyori: "For now, would the pair of you like to play a board game with me? That might be fun!"

2736
03:52:04,000 --> 03:52:05,000
Haru: "Sure, I guess."

2737
03:52:05,000 --> 03:52:12,000
*It's not like I have anything better to do, and it'll help me take my mind off "Momoko's wet petals"...*

2738
03:52:12,000 --> 03:52:13,000
*Shudder.*

2739
03:52:13,000 --> 03:52:20,000
*Why can't these writers just be explicit about the various parts of human anatomy they're referring to?*

2740
03:52:20,000 --> 03:52:27,000
*All these euphemisms make their characters seem like botanical gardens, rather than embracing lovers.*

2741
03:52:27,000 --> 03:52:28,000
Ena: ""Board game"?"

2742
03:52:28,000 --> 03:52:30,000
*Ena cocks her head in confusion.*

2743
03:52:30,000 --> 03:52:32,000
Ena: "What are those, exactly?"

2744
03:52:32,000 --> 03:52:44,000
Hiyori: "They're just a fun way of passing the time with friends. There are lots of different kinds, but generally, the players compete to see who can achieve a goal first."

2745
03:52:44,000 --> 03:52:51,000
Hiyori: "We have a lot of board games in the clubroom, but most of them aren't much fun with two players."

2746
03:52:51,000 --> 03:52:55,000
Hiyori: "It should be more interesting now you're here, Ena!"

2747
03:52:55,000 --> 03:53:02,000
Ena: "I do hope so. I've not played any of these so-called "board games" before, but they sound intriguing."

2748
03:53:02,000 --> 03:53:06,000
Hiyori: "That's great! Let's have a few games, then!"

2749
03:53:06,000 --> 03:53:09,000
Hiyori: "Now, let me see what we have..."

2750
03:53:09,000 --> 03:53:17,000
*Hiyori begins to dig through our board game cabinet, searching for a suitable game to cement our three-way friendship.*

2751
03:53:17,000 --> 03:53:20,000
*I, meanwhile, find myself smiling sardonically.*

2752
03:53:20,000 --> 03:53:32,000
*It'll be interesting to see whether these newly-forged bonds of ours are strong enough to withstand a game of Oligopoly. Now, that'll be the real test of our relationship.*

2753
03:53:32,000 --> 03:53:44,000
*The days begin to wear on, as they do, at a fast clip. I while my time away with Hiyori and Ena, often in the astronomy clubroom, which has become a sort of haven for the three of us.*

2754
03:53:44,000 --> 03:53:51,000
*During the day Hiyori and I attend our lectures, while Ena pores over books in the university library.*

2755
03:53:51,000 --> 03:54:02,000
*Then, at night, the three of us congregate in the clubroom, to play board games, sip tea, and then - eventually - stargaze on the roof with Hiyori's foldable telescope.*

2756
03:54:02,000 --> 03:54:16,000
*This eats up the weekdays, while the weekends are full of trips about Tokyo. Hiyori and I take Ena everywhere we can think of, from museums to parks to art galleries, while she coos and claps in appreciation.*

2757
03:54:16,000 --> 03:54:27,000
*I also have my studies to contend with, alongside all this socializing. My life has never been busier - but, at the same token, it's never been more fulfilling.*

2758
03:54:27,000 --> 03:54:38,000
*Once, the stars used to be my main source of joy. I could gaze at them for hours on end without tiring, my mind focused solely upon the dark recesses of space.*

2759
03:54:38,000 --> 03:54:43,000
*Now, however, I have more earthly occupations to keep me grounded.*

2760
03:54:43,000 --> 03:54:50,000
*Ena's easy conversation and cheerful enthusiasm pushes me closer, not just to her, but to Hiyori, too.*

2761
03:54:50,000 --> 03:54:57,000
*I've always considered Hiyori a friend, of sorts, but we've never hung out quite this much before.*

2762
03:54:57,000 --> 03:55:00,000
*It's more enjoyable than I expected.*

2763
03:55:00,000 --> 03:55:09,000
*This knowledge doesn't hit me with a jolt, like Ena's sudden arrival on Earth did. Instead, it creeps up on me slowly, day after day.*

2764
03:55:09,000 --> 03:55:11,000
*I really am having fun.*

2765
03:55:11,000 --> 03:55:16,000
*About three weeks pass in this manner, in a blur of almost incessant activity.*

2766
03:55:16,000 --> 03:55:27,000
*I thought I would have tired of Ena's presence at this point, but it's the exact opposite. I'm more attached to her now than I ever have been - and Hiyori, too.*

2767
03:55:27,000 --> 03:55:35,000
*The only pall cast over our good times is the question which continues to linger, unanswered, in the back of my head.*

2768
03:55:35,000 --> 03:55:39,000
*Whose confession should I respond to: Ena's, or Hiyori's?*

2769
03:55:39,000 --> 03:55:42,000
*Which of them do I care about the most?*

2770
03:55:42,000 --> 03:55:50,000
*I thought spending more time with them would help me decide, but it's only grown more difficult to untangle my feelings.*

2771
03:55:50,000 --> 03:55:51,000
*I like both of them.*

2772
03:55:51,000 --> 03:55:53,000
*What do I really want...?*

2773
03:55:53,000 --> 03:56:00,000
*This thought nags at me, even during our sessions on the roof, when I should be focusing at the stars.*

2774
03:56:00,000 --> 03:56:03,000
Hiyori: "Wow! Would you look at that!"

2775
03:56:03,000 --> 03:56:09,000
*Hiyori exclaims on one such night, her iris hovering near the eyepiece of the telescope.*

2776
03:56:09,000 --> 03:56:17,000
Hiyori: "The sky is particular clear tonight. I can see so many stars - and ooh, over there! I think I can see Venus!"

2777
03:56:17,000 --> 03:56:27,000
Ena: "Ooh, really? That sounds awfully intriguing. I'm unsure whether I have been able to detect it before, given these last few nights have been so cloudy."

2778
03:56:27,000 --> 03:56:33,000
Ena: "May I look through the telescope too, Hiyori, if it would not be too much trouble?"

2779
03:56:33,000 --> 03:56:35,000
Hiyori: "Of course you can!"

2780
03:56:35,000 --> 03:56:40,000
Hiyori: "This might be my telescope, but we're all members of the astronomy club!"

2781
03:56:40,000 --> 03:56:45,000
Hiyori: "It wouldn't do to permit you from using our equipment, Ena!"

2782
03:56:45,000 --> 03:56:46,000
Ena: "Really...?"

2783
03:56:46,000 --> 03:56:48,000
*Ena gestures to herself, blinking.*

2784
03:56:48,000 --> 03:56:52,000
Ena: "Do you honestly consider me a member of your club?"

2785
03:56:52,000 --> 03:56:54,000
Hiyori: "Of course! Why wouldn't I?"

2786
03:56:54,000 --> 03:57:01,000
Ena: "It does not seem right, somehow. I am not a student at this university, so I cannot join officially..."

2787
03:57:01,000 --> 03:57:06,000
Ena: "And I cannot help but worry that I might have forced you into this."

2788
03:57:06,000 --> 03:57:13,000
Ena: "I crash-landed in your lives very suddenly, without giving you prior warning. It was awfully rude of me."

2789
03:57:13,000 --> 03:57:19,000
Ena: "Though I enjoy being with the pair of you, I do fret that I may be getting in the way."

2790
03:57:19,000 --> 03:57:23,000
Hiyori: "No, you're not! You couldn't be more mistaken, Ena!"

2791
03:57:23,000 --> 03:57:28,000
Hiyori: "The astronomy club's been really cheery since you arrived!"

2792
03:57:28,000 --> 03:57:35,000
Hiyori: "I like Haru a lot, but it's fun having somebody else around to point out the constellations too."

2793
03:57:35,000 --> 03:57:41,000
Hiyori: "I love how enthusiastic you are, even though you yourself are from space, ehehe~"

2794
03:57:41,000 --> 03:57:50,000
Ena: "I may be from space, but I do not know everything about it. It is vast and wide, and many aspects are beyond my comprehension."

2795
03:57:50,000 --> 03:58:02,000
Hiyori: "Then we've just gotta keep studying space together! There's no shortage of stars out there for us to look at - and that means there's no reason why our club should ever disband!"

2796
03:58:02,000 --> 03:58:09,000
Hiyori: "You've been stargazing with us on this roof almost every night for the last three weeks, Ena!"

2797
03:58:09,000 --> 03:58:15,000
Hiyori: "If that doesn't make you a bona fide club member, I don't know what does!"

2798
03:58:15,000 --> 03:58:19,000
*Hiyori looks to me now, grinning cheerily despite the chill.*

2799
03:58:19,000 --> 03:58:27,000
Hiyori: "What do you say, Haru, my second-in-command? Can't we make Ena an honorary member, though she's not a student?"

2800
03:58:27,000 --> 03:58:35,000
Haru: "I don't know why you need to ask me that. You're the club leader. You're the one with all the authority here..."

2801
03:58:35,000 --> 03:58:38,000
*I return Hiyori's smile with one of my own.*

2802
03:58:38,000 --> 03:58:42,000
Haru: "And I know you've already come to a decision."

2803
03:58:42,000 --> 03:58:48,000
Haru: "Ena's been a proper member of our club ever since she first appeared on the roof."

2804
03:58:48,000 --> 03:58:54,000
Hiyori: "That's exactly what I was thinking! You know me too well, second-in-command!"

2805
03:58:54,000 --> 03:58:59,000
Haru: "Of course. We are friends, leader. What else did you expect?"

2806
03:58:59,000 --> 03:59:06,000
Hiyori: "I don't know. You can be a little slow when it comes to picking up on other people's emotions, hehe..."

2807
03:59:06,000 --> 03:59:15,000
Haru: "Guilty as charged. I'm not the best at discerning how others' feel - but I can tell how you feel about Ena easily enough."

2808
03:59:15,000 --> 03:59:18,000
Haru: "You've made it pretty obvious."

2809
03:59:18,000 --> 03:59:26,000
Haru: "I want the three of us to continue looking at the stars as we are now. The astronomy club is very important to me..."

2810
03:59:26,000 --> 03:59:29,000
Haru: "And it's important to me because of you two."

2811
03:59:29,000 --> 03:59:35,000
Haru: "That proves that you're both important members of the club. You're irreplaceable."

2812
03:59:35,000 --> 03:59:36,000
Ena: "Oh, darling..."

2813
03:59:36,000 --> 03:59:39,000
*Ena sighs, one hand pressed against her chest.*

2814
03:59:39,000 --> 03:59:43,000
Ena: "You are so nice to me! Thank you for your acceptance!"

2815
03:59:43,000 --> 03:59:54,000
Ena: "I was unsure, when I first came to this planet, whether I would really fit in, but you and Hiyori have done everything you can to make me feel welcome!"

2816
03:59:54,000 --> 04:00:01,000
Ena: "I really do love this planet, but I love looking for other planets with the pair of you, too!"

2817
04:00:01,000 --> 04:00:06,000
Ena: "Stargazing is so much fun, I would like us to keep on doing it!"

2818
04:00:06,000 --> 04:00:13,000
Hiyori: "Then that's just what we'll do! There's no reason for us to stop; not now it's become a habit."

2819
04:00:13,000 --> 04:00:17,000
Hiyori: "The three of us are gonna stay together, no matter what!"

2820
04:00:17,000 --> 04:00:18,000
Hiyori: "Now..."

2821
04:00:18,000 --> 04:00:20,000
*Hiyori gestures to the telescope.*

2822
04:00:20,000 --> 04:00:28,000
Hiyori: "Do you want to take a look, Ena? Venus is very clear tonight. I think you'll get a kick out of seeing it."

2823
04:00:28,000 --> 04:00:30,000
Ena: "Oh, yes! I would love to!"

2824
04:00:30,000 --> 04:00:36,000
*Ena takes her position at the telescope, beaming brightly, while Hiyori and I watch her.*

2825
04:00:36,000 --> 04:00:43,000
*Her enthusiasm is so palpable, it's contagious. I can't help but smile myself when I look at her.*

2826
04:00:43,000 --> 04:00:48,000
*I never used to smile all that much in the past, but Ena brings it out of me.*

2827
04:00:48,000 --> 04:00:53,000
*Being with her - and Hiyori, too - makes me happier than I knew was possible.*

2828
04:00:53,000 --> 04:01:00,000
*It's no wonder Koichi and the others get so pissed at me on a regular basis. I really am a lucky guy.*

2829
04:01:00,000 --> 04:01:04,000
*I almost feel obliged to apologize to my housemates, but...*

2830
04:01:04,000 --> 04:01:11,000
Ena: "Goodness me! You are correct, Hiyori! I can see Venus in so much detail, it is quite astounding!"

2831
04:01:11,000 --> 04:01:12,000
*...Nah.*

2832
04:01:12,000 --> 04:01:19,000
*I'm not going to apologize for having fun, and I'm not going to apologize for meeting Ena, either.*

2833
04:01:19,000 --> 04:01:24,000
*I'm going, instead, to enjoy my newfound happiness without overthinking it.*

2834
04:01:24,000 --> 04:01:30,000
*Then, with some hope, I should be able to hold onto it... no matter what the future holds.*

2835
04:01:30,000 --> 04:01:36,000
*Hiyori folds up her portable telescope, and I carry it down to the clubroom for us.*

2836
04:01:36,000 --> 04:01:40,000
*Hiyori then bids Ena and I goodnight, and leaves the campus.*

2837
04:01:40,000 --> 04:01:43,000
*I mean to follow after her, but Ena stops me.*

2838
04:01:43,000 --> 04:01:44,000
Ena: "Hey, Haru..."

2839
04:01:44,000 --> 04:01:52,000
*Ena says my name - a rarity for her, given how often she calls me "darling" - in a soft voice pregnant with emotion.*

2840
04:01:52,000 --> 04:01:55,000
*I pause, then glance at her, blinking.*

2841
04:01:55,000 --> 04:01:59,000
Haru: "Are you alright, Ena? Is something the matter?"

2842
04:01:59,000 --> 04:02:06,000
Ena: "Oh, no, nothing is the matter with me. I am not in poor spirits. In fact, it could not be the opposite."

2843
04:02:06,000 --> 04:02:09,000
Ena: "I wished to speak to you, darling-"

2844
04:02:09,000 --> 04:02:12,000
*Aha. Now that's more like the Ena I know.*

2845
04:02:12,000 --> 04:02:17,000
Ena: "-only to confess how very glad I am that I was able to meet you."

2846
04:02:17,000 --> 04:02:28,000
Ena: "I must thank you, yet again, for agreeing to let me live with you. Without you, I do not think I would have grown to love this planet half as much as I do now."

2847
04:02:28,000 --> 04:02:33,000
Ena: "You have been kinder to me than I deserve, and I am most gratified."

2848
04:02:33,000 --> 04:02:36,000
Ena: "I just wanted you to know that."

2849
04:02:36,000 --> 04:02:38,000
Haru: "Like I'm not aware already."

2850
04:02:38,000 --> 04:02:42,000
*I smile, then poke the tip of Ena's nose with my index finger.*

2851
04:02:42,000 --> 04:02:50,000
Haru: "I'm happy to hear you say that stuff, but none of it's news to me. You make your feelings more than apparent as it is."

2852
04:02:50,000 --> 04:02:51,000
Ena: "I do...?"

2853
04:02:51,000 --> 04:02:56,000
Haru: "Definitely. You're always telling me how much you love my company."

2854
04:02:56,000 --> 04:03:03,000
*And, when she's not telling me how much she loves my company, she's telling me how much she loves me.*

2855
04:03:03,000 --> 04:03:12,000
Haru: "I know how you feel already, so don't feel obliged to keep thanking me. I don't want you to feel like you owe me anything."

2856
04:03:12,000 --> 04:03:18,000
Haru: "Just keep having fun, alright? That's the only payment I could really ask for."

2857
04:03:18,000 --> 04:03:19,000
Ena: "Oh, darling...!"

2858
04:03:19,000 --> 04:03:27,000
*Ena's amber eyes shine with feeling. Her irises look even brighter than the stars outside, suspended in the night sky.*

2859
04:03:27,000 --> 04:03:32,000
Ena: "This is why I like being with you so much. You truly are a kind man."

2860
04:03:32,000 --> 04:03:41,000
Ena: "I was pondering this earlier, as we were up on the roof, gazing at the stars, and now I have come to a firm, unassailable conclusion."

2861
04:03:41,000 --> 04:03:46,000
*Ena rests one hand upon her chest, fingers splayed, above her beating heart.*

2862
04:03:46,000 --> 04:03:55,000
Ena: "I thought I might, perhaps, feel a faint stirring of homesickness as I gazed upon the recesses of space, but that did not happen."

2863
04:03:55,000 --> 04:04:04,000
Ena: "I have fond memories of my home planet, and of course I miss my family, but I have no desire to return to Corval: not in the slightest."

2864
04:04:04,000 --> 04:04:08,000
Ena: "Corval might have been my home once, but no longer."

2865
04:04:08,000 --> 04:04:16,000
Ena: "I feel vastly more at ease upon this planet, when I am by your side, than I ever did in the palace I was raised in."

2866
04:04:16,000 --> 04:04:21,000
Ena: "That is proof, I think, that I was meant to live upon this planet."

2867
04:04:21,000 --> 04:04:25,000
Ena: "I am not an earthling, but Earth is where I belong..."

2868
04:04:25,000 --> 04:04:34,000
Ena: "And, if it is not too much of a burden upon you, I would like to continue experiencing all this planet has to offer by your side."

2869
04:04:34,000 --> 04:04:45,000
Ena: "I am being serious, darling, when I say that I love you. I love you more now than I ever have before, and getting to know you has only solidified these feelings."

2870
04:04:45,000 --> 04:04:51,000
Ena: "I want only for us to stay together. If I have you, I do not need anything else!"

2871
04:04:51,000 --> 04:04:52,000
Haru: "Ah..."

2872
04:04:52,000 --> 04:04:56,000
*Ena's address is so sincere it makes my own heart flutter.*

2873
04:04:56,000 --> 04:05:05,000
*I was trying to play it cool earlier, but I can't keep my expression impassive; not when she's staring at me as intently as she is.*

2874
04:05:05,000 --> 04:05:12,000
*Ena has been calling me her "darling" since day one, but none of her prior confessions felt quite like this.*

2875
04:05:12,000 --> 04:05:19,000
*I don't think Ena was ever lying about her feelings, but I don't think she fully understood them, either.*

2876
04:05:19,000 --> 04:05:25,000
*As an alien, her perception of "love" is probably a bit different to an average human's.*

2877
04:05:25,000 --> 04:05:30,000
*I think she's begun to learn what, exactly, "love" entails now, though.*

2878
04:05:30,000 --> 04:05:38,000
*She says she's fallen in love with me - and, though I've only known her a few weeks, I'm tempted to believe her.*

2879
04:05:38,000 --> 04:05:46,000
*I don't think she could look at me like that, with such indescribably gentle eyes, if there weren't a bit of truth to it.*

2880
04:05:46,000 --> 04:05:49,000
*So, Ena loves me. She seriously loves me.*

2881
04:05:49,000 --> 04:05:51,000
*How should I answer that?*

2882
04:05:51,000 --> 04:05:54,000
*I know Hiyori likes me a lot too, but...*

2883
04:05:54,000 --> 04:05:56,000
Ena: "Darling? Are you alright?"

2884
04:05:56,000 --> 04:06:02,000
*Ena looks at me shyly (that's unusual, for her), her fingers linked together at her front.*

2885
04:06:02,000 --> 04:06:06,000
Ena: "I hope my confession has not caused you any problems."

2886
04:06:06,000 --> 04:06:16,000
Ena: "If there is another you possess feelings for - Hiyori, for example - then I shall not force the issue. I would not want to make you uncomfortable."

2887
04:06:16,000 --> 04:06:26,000
Ena: "I have learned, after reading many romance novels in the library, that love should not be a selfish thing. It should be pure and gentle."

2888
04:06:26,000 --> 04:06:37,000
Ena: "It is not "love" if one seeks to possess another for their own gratification. Those who are truly in love will wish only for their beloved to be happy..."

2889
04:06:37,000 --> 04:06:41,000
Ena: "Even if their happiness is found within the arms of another."

2890
04:06:41,000 --> 04:06:48,000
Ena: "I confess, it would be painful for me if you chose Hiyori, but I would not think any less of you for it."

2891
04:06:48,000 --> 04:06:54,000
Ena: "I would be happy, instead, that you have found somebody you wish to be with."

2892
04:06:54,000 --> 04:07:01,000
Ena: "I would never begrudge your joy; not after everything you have done for me. I can promise you that."

2893
04:07:01,000 --> 04:07:02,000
Haru: "Ena..."

2894
04:07:02,000 --> 04:07:06,000
*My heart does another flip in my stomach, like a pancake.*

2895
04:07:06,000 --> 04:07:12,000
*I've been a bit unsure about how to answer Ena's feelings, so I've been avoiding the issue.*

2896
04:07:12,000 --> 04:07:17,000
*I can't avoid it now, however; not when we're alone in the astronomy clubroom.*

2897
04:07:17,000 --> 04:07:23,000
*There's nowhere to run - and, if I'm being perfectly honest, I don't want to run: not anymore.*

2898
04:07:23,000 --> 04:07:29,000
*Ena mustered up the courage to tell me how she felt, so I should respond in turn.*

2899
04:07:29,000 --> 04:07:32,000
*I don't know much about romance, it's true, but...*

2900
04:07:32,000 --> 04:07:38,000
Haru: "Thank you for being so understanding. Not many people could be so selfless."

2901
04:07:38,000 --> 04:07:44,000
Ena: "Perhaps it comes easier to me because I am not a regular human. I am an alien."

2902
04:07:44,000 --> 04:07:51,000
Haru: "No, I don't think that's the case. Alien or no, I believe you're a good, kind-hearted girl."

2903
04:07:51,000 --> 04:07:55,000
Haru: "You place the happiness of others before your own..."

2904
04:07:55,000 --> 04:07:59,000
*I cross the room, then ruffle the top of Ena's head.*

2905
04:07:59,000 --> 04:08:03,000
Haru: "And that's why I've grown to like you so much."

2906
04:08:03,000 --> 04:08:04,000
Ena: "H-Huh...?"

2907
04:08:04,000 --> 04:08:07,000
*Ena looks up at me, her amber eyes wide.*

2908
04:08:07,000 --> 04:08:09,000
Ena: "You... like me...?"

2909
04:08:09,000 --> 04:08:12,000
Haru: "That's right. I like you a lot."

2910
04:08:12,000 --> 04:08:24,000
Haru: "I didn't realize quite how much I liked you in the beginning. Your appearance in my life was awfully sudden, after all. At the start, I confess, I thought you were a nuisance..."

2911
04:08:24,000 --> 04:08:30,000
Haru: "But now we've spent more time together, I can't imagine my life without you in it."

2912
04:08:30,000 --> 04:08:39,000
Haru: "My days used to be gray and monotonous, but you've filled them with laughter. I always like spending time with you, so..."

2913
04:08:39,000 --> 04:08:40,000
*I smile.*

2914
04:08:40,000 --> 04:08:49,000
Haru: "As much as I like Hiyori, I don't like her in the same way I like you. She doesn't light up my life in quite the same way as you."

2915
04:08:49,000 --> 04:08:54,000
Haru: "You're special, Ena, and that's not just because you're an alien."

2916
04:08:54,000 --> 04:08:59,000
Haru: "I don't know much about relationships, never having been in one before..."

2917
04:08:59,000 --> 04:09:04,000
Haru: "But, if I had to put my feelings into words, I'd say I like you, too."

2918
04:09:04,000 --> 04:09:08,000
Haru: "Th-This might be a bit too soon for me, but... Um..."

2919
04:09:08,000 --> 04:09:10,000
*I clear my throat, then say...*

2920
04:09:10,000 --> 04:09:12,000
Haru: "I might just love you, too."

2921
04:09:12,000 --> 04:09:14,000
Ena: "Haru... Oh, Haru...!"

2922
04:09:14,000 --> 04:09:17,000
*Ena stares at me, overwhelmed, and then...*

2923
04:09:17,000 --> 04:09:19,000
Ena: "Haru, I'm so happy!!!"

2924
04:09:19,000 --> 04:09:28,000
*With a sigh of relief, Ena presses her body against mine. Her fingers fist against the front of my sweater, her eyes upturned to meet mine.*

2925
04:09:28,000 --> 04:09:34,000
*I can feel Ena's warmth leaking through her clothes. Her touch makes my skin prickle.*

2926
04:09:34,000 --> 04:09:38,000
*Heat rises to my cheeks, dyeing my face redder still.*

2927
04:09:38,000 --> 04:09:43,000
*Before I met Ena, I'd never been so close to a member of the opposite sex.*

2928
04:09:43,000 --> 04:09:49,000
*After she came into my life, I had to swiftly grow accustomed to her displays of affection.*

2929
04:09:49,000 --> 04:09:53,000
*Ena's a bit like a puppy. She has no qualms about clinging to me.*

2930
04:09:53,000 --> 04:09:59,000
*Initially, I found it annoying, but now I'm glad she's so open about her feelings.*

2931
04:09:59,000 --> 04:10:04,000
*If she wasn't, I don't think I ever would have realized how much I like her.*

2932
04:10:04,000 --> 04:10:07,000
*Her boldness is inspiring. She lets me be brave.*

2933
04:10:07,000 --> 04:10:18,000
*To hell with societal norms and customs. I've let that stuff bog me down for way too long. It's time I stopped caring about what other people thought of me.*

2934
04:10:18,000 --> 04:10:22,000
*I want to reciprocate Ena's embrace - and so, I do.*

2935
04:10:22,000 --> 04:10:29,000
*I wind my arms about her slender waist, though my heart is hammering all the while, and draw her closer to me.*

2936
04:10:29,000 --> 04:10:30,000
Ena: "Oh, Haru..."

2937
04:10:30,000 --> 04:10:35,000
*Ena sighs happily, while snuggling her body even more closely against mine.*

2938
04:10:35,000 --> 04:10:39,000
Ena: "You have no idea how happy I am to hear you say that."

2939
04:10:39,000 --> 04:10:48,000
Haru: "Perhaps not, but I think I can guess. I'm sure you must be feeling at least as happy as I am, and that's pretty darn happy."

2940
04:10:48,000 --> 04:10:49,000
Ena: "You are happy?"

2941
04:10:49,000 --> 04:10:50,000
Haru: "Very much so."

2942
04:10:50,000 --> 04:10:53,000
Ena: "Yay! Then that should be a positive sign."

2943
04:10:53,000 --> 04:11:00,000
Ena: "If we are able to cheer one another, then this relationship should work, regardless of our races."

2944
04:11:00,000 --> 04:11:08,000
Ena: "You might be a human, I an alien, but I do not think we are so very dissimilar we cannot have a fortuitous relationship."

2945
04:11:08,000 --> 04:11:09,000
Ena: "Moreover..."

2946
04:11:09,000 --> 04:11:11,000
*Ena smiles bashfully.*

2947
04:11:11,000 --> 04:11:15,000
Ena: "The books I read did say that opposites attract."

2948
04:11:15,000 --> 04:11:18,000
Haru: "That's a pretty common cliché, yeah."

2949
04:11:18,000 --> 04:11:23,000
*I never gave it much thought before, but maybe there's some truth to it.*

2950
04:11:23,000 --> 04:11:27,000
*Ena and I seem to get on well, despite our differences.*

2951
04:11:27,000 --> 04:11:34,000
*She's bubbly, whereas I'm withdrawn. She loves talking, whereas I've always preferred the quiet.*

2952
04:11:34,000 --> 04:11:40,000
*She's an alien, like she said, and I'm a human - but, despite all that, I'm still drawn to her.*

2953
04:11:40,000 --> 04:11:44,000
*She's so beautiful, I can hardly tear my eyes away from her.*

2954
04:11:44,000 --> 04:11:48,000
Ena: "Can we stay together, then, Haru? Would that be alright?"

2955
04:11:48,000 --> 04:11:51,000
Haru: "Of course. It's what I want, too."

2956
04:11:51,000 --> 04:11:55,000
*I cup Ena's cheeks with my hands, then dip my head.*

2957
04:11:55,000 --> 04:12:02,000
*Ena stands up on tiptoe, being several inches shorter than I am, and meets my mouth with her own.*

2958
04:12:02,000 --> 04:12:08,000
*Her eyes flutter shut, as do mine, as together, we lose ourselves in this mutual kiss.*

2959
04:12:08,000 --> 04:12:15,000
*This isn't the first time I've kissed Ena, but it is the first time I've done so of my own volition.*

2960
04:12:15,000 --> 04:12:22,000
*I thought her lips were soft back then, when first they met, but they feel even more yielding now.*

2961
04:12:22,000 --> 04:12:25,000
*Could that be because I'm taking the lead?*

2962
04:12:25,000 --> 04:12:30,000
*It's an exciting thought, which further stimulates my love for her.*

2963
04:12:30,000 --> 04:12:34,000
*How did I never realize, until now, how adorable she is?*

2964
04:12:34,000 --> 04:12:37,000
*I want to hold her close and never let her go.*

2965
04:12:37,000 --> 04:12:47,000
*I don't know what the future withholds for Ena and I, or how a relationship between an alien and a human will work, but I can't wait to find out.*

2966
04:12:47,000 --> 04:12:50,000
*I can face any challenge if I'm with Ena.*

2967
04:12:50,000 --> 04:12:56,000
*Ignorant in relationship matters though I am, I think that's what true love is all about.*

2968
04:12:56,000 --> 04:13:03,000
*Hiyori sits beside me on the couch in the astronomy clubroom, her hands resting demurely on her thighs.*

2969
04:13:03,000 --> 04:13:12,000
*Her hair is a bit rumpled after her time spent on the rooftop, gazing at the stars, and her cheeks are tinged pink from the cold.*

2970
04:13:12,000 --> 04:13:22,000
*The three of us - Ena, Hiyori, and I - enjoyed a couple of hours on the roof together, looking up at the stars, but Hiyori eventually had to call it quits.*

2971
04:13:22,000 --> 04:13:28,000
*She feels the cold easily, and she needed to return to the clubroom to recuperate.*

2972
04:13:28,000 --> 04:13:37,000
*Ena, meanwhile, was so transfixed by the stars that she decided to remain on the roof, the sole custodian of Hiyori's telescope.*

2973
04:13:37,000 --> 04:13:41,000
*Now, Hiyori and I are the only ones in the clubroom.*

2974
04:13:41,000 --> 04:13:50,000
*We've not had much of a chance to speak together, one-on-one, since she confessed her feelings to me in her home that one night.*

2975
04:13:50,000 --> 04:13:56,000
*As a result, the atmosphere between us feels a bit... charged, I suppose you could say.*

2976
04:13:56,000 --> 04:14:02,000
*I'm not one to get easily flustered, but I'm finding it hard to look Hiyori in the eye.*

2977
04:14:02,000 --> 04:14:06,000
*I can't help but recall the sensation of her mouth on mine.*

2978
04:14:06,000 --> 04:14:11,000
*Hiyori's made her feelings towards me abundantly apparent, but as for me...*

2979
04:14:11,000 --> 04:14:12,000
Hiyori: "Haru?"

2980
04:14:12,000 --> 04:14:16,000
*Hiyori looks at me curiously, her head tilted to one side.*

2981
04:14:16,000 --> 04:14:20,000
Hiyori: "Is something on your mind? You've been awfully quiet."

2982
04:14:20,000 --> 04:14:22,000
Haru: "What? Oh, uh..."

2983
04:14:22,000 --> 04:14:26,000
*I jump, abashed, and run a hand through my flyaway hair.*

2984
04:14:26,000 --> 04:14:32,000
Haru: "Sorry, Hiyori. I didn't mean to worry you. I was just off in my own thoughts, is all."

2985
04:14:32,000 --> 04:14:35,000
Hiyori: "Were you thinking about space?"

2986
04:14:35,000 --> 04:14:37,000
Haru: "Not this time, for once."

2987
04:14:37,000 --> 04:14:39,000
Hiyori: "Then, about Ena?"

2988
04:14:39,000 --> 04:14:48,000
Haru: "No, this isn't about her either. Things have changed a lot since she arrived, it's true, but my life doesn't revolve around her."

2989
04:14:48,000 --> 04:14:51,000
Haru: "She doesn't occupy all my thoughts."

2990
04:14:51,000 --> 04:14:54,000
Hiyori: "Just a sizable chunk of them?"

2991
04:14:54,000 --> 04:14:56,000
Haru: "It's about 20/80 right now."

2992
04:14:56,000 --> 04:14:57,000
Hiyori: "Really...?"

2993
04:14:57,000 --> 04:15:03,000
*Hiyori shifts a little closer to me on the couch. Her thighs brush against mine, and I shiver.*

2994
04:15:03,000 --> 04:15:05,000
Hiyori: "What's the 80, then?"

2995
04:15:05,000 --> 04:15:07,000
Haru: "That would be..."

2996
04:15:07,000 --> 04:15:11,000
*I swallow. All of a sudden, my throat feels very dry.*

2997
04:15:11,000 --> 04:15:15,000
*It feels embarrassing to admit this outright, but... well.*

2998
04:15:15,000 --> 04:15:22,000
*Hiyori must have endured more than her fair share of embarrassment when she 'fessed up her feelings to me.*

2999
04:15:22,000 --> 04:15:29,000
*That must have taken an incredible amount of courage, but she was able to overcome her fears when it counted.*

3000
04:15:29,000 --> 04:15:32,000
*I thought her determination was very impressive...*

3001
04:15:32,000 --> 04:15:34,000
*And it was adorable, too.*

3002
04:15:34,000 --> 04:15:40,000
*She really must love me, to be willing to make herself so vulnerable for my sake.*

3003
04:15:40,000 --> 04:15:47,000
*She exposed herself even more thoroughly than Ena did in the bathtub the night she moved into my apartment.*

3004
04:15:47,000 --> 04:15:55,000
*I've had a while to think about my response to Hiyori's confession, and now I think I've come up with a response.*

3005
04:15:55,000 --> 04:16:00,000
*Unsure though I remain, I can't keep stringing her along like this.*

3006
04:16:00,000 --> 04:16:06,000
*It's cruel to keep her in the dark, without any idea as to the state of our relationship.*

3007
04:16:06,000 --> 04:16:10,000
*I'm supposed to be a man. It's time I took the lead.*

3008
04:16:10,000 --> 04:16:15,000
*I inhale deeply, then affix Hiyori with a very serious expression indeed.*

3009
04:16:15,000 --> 04:16:17,000
Haru: "That would be you, Hiyori."

3010
04:16:17,000 --> 04:16:18,000
Hiyori: "What...?"

3011
04:16:18,000 --> 04:16:23,000
*Hiyori stares at me uncomprehendingly, then points towards her chest.*

3012
04:16:23,000 --> 04:16:24,000
Hiyori: "Me?"

3013
04:16:24,000 --> 04:16:25,000
Haru: "Yes, you."

3014
04:16:25,000 --> 04:16:31,000
Haru: "I often think of Ena, it's true... but, as of late, you're the one who's been on my mind."

3015
04:16:31,000 --> 04:16:37,000
Haru: "I think about you when I wake up in the mornings, and when I go to sleep at night."

3016
04:16:37,000 --> 04:16:43,000
Haru: "When we're together, like we are now, I can't get your confession from my mind."

3017
04:16:43,000 --> 04:16:48,000
Haru: "I've been giving your words a good deal of thought, and... Well."

3018
04:16:48,000 --> 04:16:56,000
*I offer Hiyori a smile. I'm doing my best to appear calm, though my heart is pounding like a drum inside my chest.*

3019
04:16:56,000 --> 04:17:02,000
Haru: "I think I would like to be your boyfriend... if you still want me to be, that is."

3020
04:17:02,000 --> 04:17:07,000
Haru: "I've not been in a relationship before, but I'd like to try it with you."

3021
04:17:07,000 --> 04:17:11,000
Haru: "We're both inexperienced, but I think we can make it work."

3022
04:17:11,000 --> 04:17:15,000
Haru: "What do you say? Are you, um, still interested in me?"

3023
04:17:15,000 --> 04:17:18,000
Haru: "I know I've kept you waiting a while, but-"

3024
04:17:18,000 --> 04:17:20,000
*I begin, but Hiyori cuts me off.*

3025
04:17:20,000 --> 04:17:27,000
Hiyori: "Oh, Haru! Of course I want to be in a relationship with you! You don't even need to ask!"

3026
04:17:27,000 --> 04:17:31,000
Hiyori: "I love you, after all! I love you so, so much!"

3027
04:17:31,000 --> 04:17:38,000
*So saying, Hiyori shuffles even closer to me on the worn old couch, then rests her head upon my shoulder.*

3028
04:17:38,000 --> 04:17:44,000
*Her upturned eyes peer at me, warm and rich like honey beneath her long eyelashes.*

3029
04:17:44,000 --> 04:17:55,000
Hiyori: "I didn't think you would respond to my confession, if I'm being honest. You've always being kind of awkward when it comes to displays of affection, ehehe."

3030
04:17:55,000 --> 04:18:02,000
Hiyori: "You've always flinched away from me when I hugged you, and you deflect all my compliments."

3031
04:18:02,000 --> 04:18:08,000
Hiyori: "I was certain you would pretend that my confession never happened - nor my kiss."

3032
04:18:08,000 --> 04:18:09,000
Haru: "Oh, Hiyori..."

3033
04:18:09,000 --> 04:18:10,000
*I frown.*

3034
04:18:10,000 --> 04:18:14,000
Haru: "Do you really think I'd do that? I'm not that callous."

3035
04:18:14,000 --> 04:18:21,000
Haru: "I wouldn't ignore your feelings like that; not after you mustered the courage to confess to me."

3036
04:18:21,000 --> 04:18:26,000
Haru: "That took real guts. Your hard work deserves to be rewarded."

3037
04:18:26,000 --> 04:18:29,000
Hiyori: "Why, thank you. I'm glad, ehehe~"

3038
04:18:29,000 --> 04:18:37,000
Hiyori: "I was really nervous before I confessed to you... but I guess it was a good thing I went through with it."

3039
04:18:37,000 --> 04:18:42,000
Hiyori: "If I'd never told you how I felt, I doubt you'd ever know."

3040
04:18:42,000 --> 04:18:50,000
Hiyori: "You might know a lot about space, but you're not the best when it comes to understanding girls' hearts!"

3041
04:18:50,000 --> 04:18:57,000
Haru: "I guess not, no. I don't have very much practice in that department, but I'm willing to learn."

3042
04:18:57,000 --> 04:18:59,000
Haru: "Can you teach me, Hiyori?"

3043
04:18:59,000 --> 04:19:02,000
Haru: "I'll even call you "Professor", if you want!"

3044
04:19:02,000 --> 04:19:05,000
Hiyori: "I'm not too sure about that..."

3045
04:19:05,000 --> 04:19:07,000
*Hiyori giggles again.*

3046
04:19:07,000 --> 04:19:13,000
Hiyori: "I've never been in a relationship myself, either. This is all very new to me."

3047
04:19:13,000 --> 04:19:19,000
Haru: "It's new to me, too... but I think that's fine. We can help one another out."

3048
04:19:19,000 --> 04:19:21,000
Hiyori: "Yes, I suppose so. Oh..."

3049
04:19:21,000 --> 04:19:27,000
*Hiyori nuzzles her cheek against my shoulder as a cat might, her face glowing with happiness.*

3050
04:19:27,000 --> 04:19:32,000
Hiyori: "This is almost too good to be true. It feels like a dream."

3051
04:19:32,000 --> 04:19:39,000
Haru: "It's not a dream. I can promise you that much. Your straightforward approach was able to win me over."

3052
04:19:39,000 --> 04:19:45,000
Haru: "After seeing how cute you were, there was no way I couldn't reciprocate your feelings."

3053
04:19:45,000 --> 04:19:52,000
Hiyori: "I don't think I'm that cute, really. Compared to Ena, I'm rather plain - speaking of which..."

3054
04:19:52,000 --> 04:19:53,000
*Hiyori frowns.*

3055
04:19:53,000 --> 04:19:58,000
Hiyori: "What will you do about Ena? She seems pretty gung-ho about marrying you."

3056
04:19:58,000 --> 04:20:01,000
Hiyori: "Won't this news hurt her feelings?"

3057
04:20:01,000 --> 04:20:11,000
Haru: "I'll break it to her gently. She's a nice girl, so I'm sure she'll understand. I have known you a good deal longer than I've known her, after all."

3058
04:20:11,000 --> 04:20:16,000
Haru: "She might be a little upset, but I'm sure she'll recover in due course."

3059
04:20:16,000 --> 04:20:19,000
Hiyori: "I guess so. She is very cheery, isn't she?"

3060
04:20:19,000 --> 04:20:23,000
Haru: "Yeah, she is. It's an endearing trait of hers..."

3061
04:20:23,000 --> 04:20:26,000
Haru: "But you're no less endearing than she is."

3062
04:20:26,000 --> 04:20:35,000
Haru: "Please don't compare yourself to Ena. There's no need. Ena might be pretty, but you're adorable, and you're the one I want to be with."

3063
04:20:35,000 --> 04:20:39,000
Haru: "I'm not joking when I say I like you, Hiyori."

3064
04:20:39,000 --> 04:20:40,000
Hiyori: "Aaah..."

3065
04:20:40,000 --> 04:20:42,000
*Hiyori's face floods scarlet.*

3066
04:20:42,000 --> 04:20:46,000
Hiyori: "I don't know if I'll ever get used to you saying that!"

3067
04:20:46,000 --> 04:20:52,000
Haru: "Well, you'd better, because I'm going to be saying it to you a lot from this point on."

3068
04:20:52,000 --> 04:20:56,000
Haru: "I like you, Hiyori. In fact, I might even love you."

3069
04:20:56,000 --> 04:20:57,000
Hiyori: "Oh, wow..."

3070
04:20:57,000 --> 04:21:03,000
*Hiyori holds one hand to her chest. We're so close together, I can hear her heart thumping.*

3071
04:21:03,000 --> 04:21:06,000
Hiyori: "That's so forward. You're making me blush!"

3072
04:21:06,000 --> 04:21:11,000
Haru: "Good. You look even more adorable than usual when you blush."

3073
04:21:11,000 --> 04:21:15,000
Haru: "That's one of the things I love the most about you."

3074
04:21:15,000 --> 04:21:17,000
Haru: "Will you be my girlfriend?"

3075
04:21:17,000 --> 04:21:21,000
Hiyori: "Yes, of course! I'd be anything for you, Haru!"

3076
04:21:21,000 --> 04:21:29,000
*Hiyori leans in, then presses a quick kiss against my cheek. Before drawing away, she then whispers into my ear...*

3077
04:21:29,000 --> 04:21:34,000
Hiyori: "I've often felt like I don't belong on this planet, but..."

3078
04:21:34,000 --> 04:21:39,000
*Hiyori draws back, beaming, flashing a mouthful of pearly white teeth.*

3079
04:21:39,000 --> 04:21:44,000
Hiyori: "I feel like I belong in your arms. My home is with you, by your side."

3080
04:21:44,000 --> 04:21:48,000
Hiyori: "So long as we're together, I don't need anything else."

3081
04:21:48,000 --> 04:21:50,000
Hiyori: "I really do love you."

3082
04:21:50,000 --> 04:22:03,000
*It's pretty late - almost midnight - and I'm tired. I'm ready to hit the hay and call it a night, but Hiyori's voice makes me pause before I can retrieve my messenger bag from the ground.*

3083
04:22:03,000 --> 04:22:07,000
Hiyori: "Hey, Haru... Would you mind waiting a little while?"

3084
04:22:07,000 --> 04:22:13,000
Hiyori: "There's something I - well, both Ena and I - would like to discuss with you."

3085
04:22:13,000 --> 04:22:14,000
Haru: "Oh?"

3086
04:22:14,000 --> 04:22:19,000
*I straighten my back, my bag forgotten, and look at Hiyori and Ena curiously.*

3087
04:22:19,000 --> 04:22:20,000
Haru: "What's that?"

3088
04:22:20,000 --> 04:22:29,000
*It sounds kind of serious, based on the tone of Hiyori's voice. She's smiling, but her fingers are curled anxiously at her front.*

3089
04:22:29,000 --> 04:22:30,000
*Is something wrong?*

3090
04:22:30,000 --> 04:22:33,000
Hiyori: "This is a bit of a delicate topic, um..."

3091
04:22:33,000 --> 04:22:41,000
Hiyori: "Perhaps it's a bit too late to discuss such things right now - I'm not even sure if you're in the mood - but, well..."

3092
04:22:41,000 --> 04:22:43,000
*Hiyori clears her throat.*

3093
04:22:43,000 --> 04:22:50,000
Hiyori: "I was talking things through with Ena, when we were stargazing, a-and we came to a conclusion."

3094
04:22:50,000 --> 04:22:53,000
Hiyori: "I-It's, um... Well, the thing is-"

3095
04:22:53,000 --> 04:22:57,000
Ena: "It's been too long since we confessed to you, darling!"

3096
04:22:57,000 --> 04:23:01,000
*Ena suddenly interjects, both her hands on her hips.*

3097
04:23:01,000 --> 04:23:07,000
Ena: "I don't mind if you want a bit of time to decide, but Hiyori and I have feelings, too!"

3098
04:23:07,000 --> 04:23:11,000
Ena: "We've both been rather anxious, awaiting your response!"

3099
04:23:11,000 --> 04:23:18,000
Ena: "I think it is past time that you told us what you want, and whether you will accept our confessions!"

3100
04:23:18,000 --> 04:23:19,000
Haru: "Oh, right..."

3101
04:23:19,000 --> 04:23:29,000
*I figured Hiyori might want to talk to me about this, when she stopped me. It doesn't come as a big surprise, though it does make my stomach sink.*

3102
04:23:29,000 --> 04:23:36,000
Haru: "I'm sorry, you two. I didn't mean to keep stringing you along. It just sort of... happened."

3103
04:23:36,000 --> 04:23:37,000
*I sigh.*

3104
04:23:37,000 --> 04:23:41,000
Haru: "I know that's a poor excuse, but it's the best I can offer."

3105
04:23:41,000 --> 04:23:49,000
Haru: "I've never been confessed to by one girl before, let alone two, and I'm just... not sure what to make of it all."

3106
04:23:49,000 --> 04:23:52,000
Haru: "It's hard to know how to reply."

3107
04:23:52,000 --> 04:23:53,000
Ena: "Is it?"

3108
04:23:53,000 --> 04:23:54,000
*Ena pouts.*

3109
04:23:54,000 --> 04:24:01,000
Ena: "I do not think it should be so very difficult. You need only tell Hiyori and I how you feel."

3110
04:24:01,000 --> 04:24:03,000
Ena: "Do you love Hiyori-"

3111
04:24:03,000 --> 04:24:06,000
*Ena gestures to the shyly blushing Hiyori.*

3112
04:24:06,000 --> 04:24:07,000
Ena: "-or me-"

3113
04:24:07,000 --> 04:24:09,000
*Ena gestures to herself.*

3114
04:24:09,000 --> 04:24:11,000
Ena: "-or both of us, or neither?"

3115
04:24:11,000 --> 04:24:13,000
Haru: "I-I don't know."

3116
04:24:13,000 --> 04:24:22,000
*Ena makes this all sound very simple, but I suppose it would be for her. She's always been honest and upfront about her feelings.*

3117
04:24:22,000 --> 04:24:24,000
*I wish I could be more like that.*

3118
04:24:24,000 --> 04:24:31,000
*My lack of experience, coupled with my inability to come to a decision, is making this all awfully hard.*

3119
04:24:31,000 --> 04:24:40,000
Haru: "I like both of you, I suppose. You've been a good friend to me for a while, Hiyori, while you're a lot of fun to be with, Ena."

3120
04:24:40,000 --> 04:24:49,000
Haru: "I don't know if my feelings qualify as "love", but I don't think I'd be opposed to dating either of you, just to try it out."

3121
04:24:49,000 --> 04:24:56,000
Haru: "That's why this is so hard. I can't choose one over the other; not when one of you will get hurt."

3122
04:24:56,000 --> 04:24:58,000
Haru: "I'd hate to upset you."

3123
04:24:58,000 --> 04:25:01,000
Ena: "Oh, is that your problem? I thought as much."

3124
04:25:01,000 --> 04:25:02,000
*Ena smiles.*

3125
04:25:02,000 --> 04:25:11,000
Ena: "You really are sweet, darling. That is why I like you so much. You are always putting the feelings of others before your own."

3126
04:25:11,000 --> 04:25:15,000
Ena: "This time, however, your indecision has caused us pain."

3127
04:25:15,000 --> 04:25:21,000
Ena: "It would be best to get this over with quickly, so we can move on from this awful impasse."

3128
04:25:21,000 --> 04:25:24,000
Haru: "I know. I'm sorry. It's just... difficult."

3129
04:25:24,000 --> 04:25:35,000
Ena: "You earthlings, as I have gathered, have a tendency to make things unnecessarily difficult: relationships in particular! It does not need to be so, though."

3130
04:25:35,000 --> 04:25:38,000
*Ena approaches me, then takes my hand in her own.*

3131
04:25:38,000 --> 04:25:41,000
*Smiling, her amber eyes soft, she then says...*

3132
04:25:41,000 --> 04:25:48,000
Ena: "You do not have to choose one of us over the other. You can choose both of us, like I said."

3133
04:25:48,000 --> 04:25:49,000
Haru: "B-Both?"

3134
04:25:49,000 --> 04:25:52,000
*I stare at Ena, momentarily dumbstruck.*

3135
04:25:52,000 --> 04:26:03,000
*I can understand what she's suggesting, in theory (I've seen such scenarios in lewd magazines), but I've never thought of applying such "logic" to my day-to-day life.*

3136
04:26:03,000 --> 04:26:07,000
Haru: "Do you really think I should date both of you?"

3137
04:26:07,000 --> 04:26:08,000
Ena: "Yes, I do!"

3138
04:26:08,000 --> 04:26:09,000
Haru: "Oh, wow..."

3139
04:26:09,000 --> 04:26:14,000
*I thought as much, but I guess it doesn't hurt to have my suspicions confirmed.*

3140
04:26:14,000 --> 04:26:17,000
*Now, how am I supposed to respond to that?*

3141
04:26:17,000 --> 04:26:20,000
Haru: "W-Wouldn't you mind sharing me, Ena?"

3142
04:26:20,000 --> 04:26:27,000
Ena: "Not at all; not if I would be sharing you with somebody I love. I am very fond of Hiyori, too!"

3143
04:26:27,000 --> 04:26:32,000
Ena: "There would be no jealousy between us; of that, I can assure you."

3144
04:26:32,000 --> 04:26:39,000
Ena: "Polygamy is not uncommon on my planet, as I've already told you. This is all quite normal for me!"

3145
04:26:39,000 --> 04:26:45,000
Haru: "Maybe it's normal for you, but it's less so here. How would you feel about that, Hiyori?"

3146
04:26:45,000 --> 04:26:50,000
Hiyori: "I feel the same way as Ena. I wouldn't mind sharing you, either!"

3147
04:26:50,000 --> 04:26:55,000
*Hiyori's response is instant. She doesn't even pause to think about it.*

3148
04:26:55,000 --> 04:26:59,000
*She's more determined than I ever gave her credit for.*

3149
04:26:59,000 --> 04:27:10,000
Hiyori: "Ena and I were talking on the roof, and we both decided that we would be fine sharing you. We both love you, after all, and we both care for one another."

3150
04:27:10,000 --> 04:27:16,000
Hiyori: "We want each other to be happy, and sharing you seems the best way to go about it!"

3151
04:27:16,000 --> 04:27:23,000
Hiyori: "I know it's not usual - I'm sure my parents would frown upon this decision - but, well..."

3152
04:27:23,000 --> 04:27:25,000
*Hiyori smiles bashfully.*

3153
04:27:25,000 --> 04:27:28,000
Hiyori: "I am not a usual woman myself."

3154
04:27:28,000 --> 04:27:36,000
Hiyori: "I'm still convinced that I'm an alien. For all I know, polygamy could be commonly practiced on my planet, too."

3155
04:27:36,000 --> 04:27:41,000
Hiyori: "I don't care about Earth's norms: not so long as we can be together!"

3156
04:27:41,000 --> 04:27:43,000
Haru: "Oh, uh... I see..."

3157
04:27:43,000 --> 04:27:44,000
*I cough.*

3158
04:27:44,000 --> 04:27:50,000
Haru: "I-It sounds like you and Ena had a pretty serious conversation while you were stargazing."

3159
04:27:50,000 --> 04:27:58,000
Hiyori: "It was rather involved, yes. I am glad we had such a talk, though. I feel closer to her now than ever before."

3160
04:27:58,000 --> 04:28:04,000
Hiyori: "The two of us are agreed on this issue. All we're waiting for is your answer."

3161
04:28:04,000 --> 04:28:08,000
Hiyori: "Would you be willing to make both of us happy, Haru?"

3162
04:28:08,000 --> 04:28:09,000
*I'm not so sure.*

3163
04:28:09,000 --> 04:28:19,000
*This proposition would certainly solve my concerns about favoring one girl over the other, but I'm worried I wouldn't be able to satisfy the both of them.*

3164
04:28:19,000 --> 04:28:21,000
*It's a worrying thought, but...*

3165
04:28:21,000 --> 04:28:24,000
Haru: "This is what you guys want, right?"

3166
04:28:24,000 --> 04:28:27,000
Ena: "Yes, it is. I want it very much."

3167
04:28:27,000 --> 04:28:28,000
Hiyori: "Me too!"

3168
04:28:28,000 --> 04:28:29,000
Haru: "Well, then..."

3169
04:28:29,000 --> 04:28:40,000
*It's true enough that I like both Ena and Hiyori. I've been unable to accept either of their confessions for fear of upsetting them, but this should solve all my worries.*

3170
04:28:40,000 --> 04:28:46,000
*I know I've kept them waiting an unfair amount of time. I owe them a response, and so...*

3171
04:28:46,000 --> 04:28:55,000
Haru: "Alright. Let's give it a go. You can both be my girlfriends, and I'll do my best to make you happy. How does that sound?"

3172
04:28:55,000 --> 04:28:58,000
Ena: "Oh, darling, that sounds wonderful!"

3173
04:28:58,000 --> 04:29:06,000
Hiyori: "Thank you, Haru, for giving me a chance! I'll make sure you don't regret this! I'm going to shower you in love!"

3174
04:29:06,000 --> 04:29:09,000
Ena: "And I'll shower you in even more love!"

3175
04:29:09,000 --> 04:29:10,000
Hiyori: "No, me!"

3176
04:29:10,000 --> 04:29:17,000
*Both Ena and Hiyori descend upon me. They wind their arms about me and nuzzle against me, smiling serenely.*

3177
04:29:17,000 --> 04:29:22,000
*They look so happy about this newfound arrangement, I can't help but laugh.*

3178
04:29:22,000 --> 04:29:27,000
*This dual attack was certainly unexpected, but it's by no means unwelcome.*

3179
04:29:27,000 --> 04:29:34,000
*Now, I can make both Ena and Hiyori happy. I don't need to worry about prioritizing one over the other.*

3180
04:29:34,000 --> 04:29:39,000
*We can stay together, and I'm sure the three of us will be very happy.*

3181
04:29:39,000 --> 04:29:43,000
*Despite my initial misgivings, I have no doubts about that.*

3182
04:29:43,000 --> 04:29:44,000
Haru: "What...?"

3183
04:29:44,000 --> 04:29:55,000
*I'm aroused from my slumber that morning by a peculiar, damp sensation around my crotch. Something brushes against me, feather light, which makes me shiver.*

3184
04:29:55,000 --> 04:29:56,000
*What could it be?*

3185
04:29:56,000 --> 04:29:58,000
*It's certainly a strange feeling...*

3186
04:29:58,000 --> 04:30:00,000
